cal care systems to ensure rapid response and continuity of care.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:888:\"<h3><strong>Cardiac Diagnostic Services</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Electrocardiogram (ECG) for rhythm assessment</p></li><li><p>2D Echocardiography for heart structure and function</p></li><li><p>Cardiac risk profiling and clinical evaluation</p></li><li><p>Monitoring of heart function in medical and surgical patients</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Medical Management</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Hypertension management</p></li><li><p>Heart failure medical treatment</p></li><li><p>Arrhythmia management</p></li><li><p>Medical treatment for coronary artery disease</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Preventive &amp; Emergency Cardiac Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Cardiac risk assessment and lifestyle counselling</p></li><li><p>Monitoring high-risk patients (diabetes, obesity, family history)</p></li><li><p>Immediate evaluation of chest pain</p></li><li><p>Cardiac monitoring in ICU and wards</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:370:\"<ul><li><p>ECG machines for rapid rhythm assessment</p></li><li><p>2D Echocardiography systems</p></li><li><p>Advanced laboratory medicine for cardiac markers</p></li><li><p>ICU and emergency services for continuous monitoring</p></li><li><p>Digital X-Ray, CT, and MRI support when required</p></li><li><p>24×7 pharmacy for uninterrupted medication access</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:349:\"<ul><li><p>Hypertension and coronary artery disease</p></li><li><p>Heart rhythm disorders and heart failure</p></li><li><p>Chest pain, breathlessness, palpitations</p></li><li><p>Dizziness or fainting episodes</p></li><li><p>Cardiac involvement in diabetes and kidney disease</p></li><li><p>Pre-operative cardiac assessment for surgery</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:223:\"<ul><li><p>Early detection over late intervention</p></li><li><p>Evidence-based medical management</p></li><li><p>Patient education and lifestyle modification</p></li><li><p>Continuous monitoring and follow-up</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:174:\"<ul><li><p>Preventive Cardiology</p></li><li><p>Heart Failure Management</p></li><li><p>Medical Cardiology</p></li><li><p>Cardiac Risk Assessment and Monitoring</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:67:\"Best Heart Care & Cardiology Hospital in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:258:\"Nano Hospitals is a trusted cardiology and heart care hospital in Bangalore offering expert diagnosis and treatment for heart disease, hypertension, arrhythmia, heart failure, and chest pain. Consult experienced cardiologists — book your appointment today.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:14:30\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-12 13:16:18\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/a7cdc4e0-1622-45f5-8253-216e12293df9.webp\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}i:1;O:21:\"App\\Models\\Speciality\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:12:\"specialities\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:13;s:4:\"name\";s:11:\"Dermatology\";s:4:\"slug\";s:11:\"dermatology\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/33f1af24-e94c-4e94-b63b-96a7342e4fab.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8FYYNHKB9GR2ZA7Q7X83V.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:268:\"<p>Dermatology at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> focuses on the diagnosis, treatment, and long-term management of conditions affecting the skin, hair, and nails. The department manages medical, surgical, and cosmetic dermatological concerns across all age groups.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:658:\"<p>Skin problems may begin with mild symptoms such as itching, rashes, acne, pigmentation, or hair thinning, but can progress to chronic infections, scarring, or systemic disease manifestations if left untreated. At Nano Hospitals, care aims not only to relieve visible symptoms but also to identify underlying causes and restore healthy skin function and appearance.</p><p>Treatment follows a patient-centred approach combining clinical evaluation, dermatoscopic assessment, laboratory support, procedural dermatology, and long-term skincare guidance. Each care plan is tailored according to skin type, condition severity, lifestyle, and overall health.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:375:\"<p>Dermatology deals with disorders of the skin, hair, nails, and related mucous membranes. Early symptoms such as persistent itching, discoloration, unusual moles, hair loss, or non-healing skin lesions should be evaluated promptly.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early diagnosis, targeted treatment, and preventive skincare education to maintain long-term skin health.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:1015:\"<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Medical treatment for acne, eczema, and psoriasis</p></li><li><p>Allergy and skin infection management</p></li><li><p>Pigmentation disorder treatment</p></li><li><p>Hair loss evaluation and medical therapy</p></li><li><p>Nail infection and disorder treatment</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Chemical peels for pigmentation and acne scars</p></li><li><p>Cryotherapy for warts and small lesions</p></li><li><p>Intralesional injections for keloids and alopecia</p></li><li><p>PRP (Platelet-Rich Plasma) therapy for hair restoration</p></li><li><p>Dermatoscopic mole evaluation</p></li></ul><h3>Surgical &amp; Advanced Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Minor skin surgeries for cysts and benign growths</p></li><li><p>Skin biopsies for diagnosis</p></li><li><p>Mole and skin lesion removal</p></li><li><p>Laser treatments for scars, pigmentation, and vascular lesions</p></li><li><p>Treatment of skin cancers (in coordination with oncology)</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:342:\"<ul><li><p>Dermatoscopy for detailed skin lesion analysis</p></li><li><p>Laser therapy systems for skin and hair treatments</p></li><li><p>Cryotherapy units</p></li><li><p>Minor procedure rooms for dermatologic surgery</p></li><li><p>Advanced laboratory support for skin testing</p></li><li><p>Allergy and patch testing services</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:410:\"<ul><li><p>Acne and acne scars</p></li><li><p>Eczema and dermatitis</p></li><li><p>Psoriasis</p></li><li><p>Fungal, bacterial, and viral skin infections</p></li><li><p>Pigmentation disorders (melasma, vitiligo)</p></li><li><p>Hair loss and scalp disorders</p></li><li><p>Nail infections and deformities</p></li><li><p>Skin allergies and urticaria</p></li><li><p>Benign and suspicious skin growths</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:300:\"<ul><li><p>Chronic recurrence in conditions like eczema and psoriasis</p></li><li><p>Risk of scarring without timely treatment</p></li><li><p>Spread of untreated infections</p></li><li><p>Cosmetic concerns affecting self-confidence</p></li><li><p>Need for long-term skincare maintenance</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:195:\"<ul><li><p>Medical Dermatology</p></li><li><p>Pediatric Dermatology</p></li><li><p>Cosmetic Dermatology</p></li><li><p>Dermatosurgery</p></li><li><p>Trichology (Hair and Scalp Care)</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:55:\"Best Dermatology Hospital in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:150:\"Nano Hospitals offers advanced Dermatology services in Bangalore for acne, pigmentation, hair loss, and other skin conditions with expert specialists.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:46:27\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 13:29:59\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/8fed089e-c444-42eb-97fc-8537abb40dad.webp\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:13;s:4:\"name\";s:11:\"Dermatology\";s:4:\"slug\";s:11:\"dermatology\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/33f1af24-e94c-4e94-b63b-96a7342e4fab.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8FYYNHKB9GR2ZA7Q7X83V.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:268:\"<p>Dermatology at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> focuses on the diagnosis, treatment, and long-term management of conditions affecting the skin, hair, and nails. The department manages medical, surgical, and cosmetic dermatological concerns across all age groups.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:658:\"<p>Skin problems may begin with mild symptoms such as itching, rashes, acne, pigmentation, or hair thinning, but can progress to chronic infections, scarring, or systemic disease manifestations if left untreated. At Nano Hospitals, care aims not only to relieve visible symptoms but also to identify underlying causes and restore healthy skin function and appearance.</p><p>Treatment follows a patient-centred approach combining clinical evaluation, dermatoscopic assessment, laboratory support, procedural dermatology, and long-term skincare guidance. Each care plan is tailored according to skin type, condition severity, lifestyle, and overall health.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:375:\"<p>Dermatology deals with disorders of the skin, hair, nails, and related mucous membranes. Early symptoms such as persistent itching, discoloration, unusual moles, hair loss, or non-healing skin lesions should be evaluated promptly.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early diagnosis, targeted treatment, and preventive skincare education to maintain long-term skin health.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:1015:\"<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Medical treatment for acne, eczema, and psoriasis</p></li><li><p>Allergy and skin infection management</p></li><li><p>Pigmentation disorder treatment</p></li><li><p>Hair loss evaluation and medical therapy</p></li><li><p>Nail infection and disorder treatment</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Chemical peels for pigmentation and acne scars</p></li><li><p>Cryotherapy for warts and small lesions</p></li><li><p>Intralesional injections for keloids and alopecia</p></li><li><p>PRP (Platelet-Rich Plasma) therapy for hair restoration</p></li><li><p>Dermatoscopic mole evaluation</p></li></ul><h3>Surgical &amp; Advanced Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Minor skin surgeries for cysts and benign growths</p></li><li><p>Skin biopsies for diagnosis</p></li><li><p>Mole and skin lesion removal</p></li><li><p>Laser treatments for scars, pigmentation, and vascular lesions</p></li><li><p>Treatment of skin cancers (in coordination with oncology)</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:342:\"<ul><li><p>Dermatoscopy for detailed skin lesion analysis</p></li><li><p>Laser therapy systems for skin and hair treatments</p></li><li><p>Cryotherapy units</p></li><li><p>Minor procedure rooms for dermatologic surgery</p></li><li><p>Advanced laboratory support for skin testing</p></li><li><p>Allergy and patch testing services</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:410:\"<ul><li><p>Acne and acne scars</p></li><li><p>Eczema and dermatitis</p></li><li><p>Psoriasis</p></li><li><p>Fungal, bacterial, and viral skin infections</p></li><li><p>Pigmentation disorders (melasma, vitiligo)</p></li><li><p>Hair loss and scalp disorders</p></li><li><p>Nail infections and deformities</p></li><li><p>Skin allergies and urticaria</p></li><li><p>Benign and suspicious skin growths</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:300:\"<ul><li><p>Chronic recurrence in conditions like eczema and psoriasis</p></li><li><p>Risk of scarring without timely treatment</p></li><li><p>Spread of untreated infections</p></li><li><p>Cosmetic concerns affecting self-confidence</p></li><li><p>Need for long-term skincare maintenance</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:195:\"<ul><li><p>Medical Dermatology</p></li><li><p>Pediatric Dermatology</p></li><li><p>Cosmetic Dermatology</p></li><li><p>Dermatosurgery</p></li><li><p>Trichology (Hair and Scalp Care)</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:55:\"Best Dermatology Hospital in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:150:\"Nano Hospitals offers advanced Dermatology services in Bangalore for acne, pigmentation, hair loss, and other skin conditions with expert specialists.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:46:27\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 13:29:59\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/8fed089e-c444-42eb-97fc-8537abb40dad.webp\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}i:2;O:21:\"App\\Models\\Speciality\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:12:\"specialities\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:10;s:4:\"name\";s:27:\"Diabetology & Endocrinology\";s:4:\"slug\";s:25:\"diabetology-endocrinology\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/aa2fba41-cb73-4339-b7e5-547c4dfb1507.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8DX2W3E0QMVZEGKA6NVQF.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:280:\"<p>Diabetology &amp; Endocrinology at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> focuses on the diagnosis, treatment, and long-term management of endocrine disorders — conditions caused by imbalance of hormones that regulate metabolism, growth, reproduction, and overall body function.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:737:\"<p>Hormonal problems often develop gradually, with symptoms such as unexplained weight changes, fatigue, excessive thirst, frequent urination, mood fluctuations, menstrual irregularities, or growth concerns. If left untreated, these disorders can affect the heart, kidneys, nerves, bones, and reproductive health. At Nano Hospitals, care is aimed not only at controlling symptoms but also at restoring hormonal balance and preventing long-term complications.</p><p>Treatment follows a patient-centred approach combining laboratory evaluation, advanced imaging, medication management, lifestyle guidance, and continuous monitoring. Each care plan is individualised based on age, gender, lifestyle, and the specific hormonal condition.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:459:\"<p>This specialty (Endocrinology) deals with disorders of hormone-producing glands such as the pancreas, thyroid, adrenal glands, pituitary gland, and reproductive glands. Early detection of hormonal imbalance is essential, as many endocrine conditions silently damage organs over time.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early screening, precise diagnosis, personalised medication plans, and long-term follow-up to maintain metabolic and hormonal stability.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:1017:\"<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Diabetes management with oral medications and insulin therapy</p></li><li><p>Continuous glucose monitoring guidance</p></li><li><p>Thyroid disorder management (hypothyroidism and hyperthyroidism)</p></li><li><p>Hormone therapy for adrenal and pituitary disorders</p></li><li><p>Lifestyle and dietary counselling for metabolic health</p></li><li><p>Bone health and osteoporosis management</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Fine-needle aspiration (FNA) for thyroid nodules</p></li><li><p>Hormone level testing with dynamic endocrine evaluations</p></li><li><p>Image-guided procedures for certain gland-related conditions</p></li></ul><h3>Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Thyroid surgery for nodules, goiter, or thyroid cancer</p></li><li><p>Adrenal gland surgery for hormone-secreting tumors</p></li><li><p>Pituitary gland surgery (in coordination with neurosurgery)</p></li><li><p>Parathyroid surgery for calcium imbalance disorder</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:407:\"<ul><li><p>Advanced hormone laboratory testing</p></li><li><p>Continuous glucose monitoring systems</p></li><li><p>Thyroid ultrasound imaging</p></li><li><p>CT Scan and MRI for endocrine gland evaluation</p></li><li><p>Bone density scan (DEXA) for osteoporosis detection</p></li><li><p>Dedicated diabetes education and counselling support</p></li><li><p>Long-term metabolic monitoring programs</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:440:\"<ul><li><p>Type 1 and Type 2 Diabetes</p></li><li><p>Gestational diabetes</p></li><li><p>Thyroid disorders (hypothyroidism, hyperthyroidism, nodules)</p></li><li><p>Polycystic Ovary Syndrome (PCOS)</p></li><li><p>Obesity and metabolic syndrome</p></li><li><p>Osteoporosis and calcium disorders</p></li><li><p>Pituitary gland disorders</p></li><li><p>Adrenal gland disorders</p></li><li><p>Hormonal growth and puberty disorders</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:302:\"<ul><li><p>Organ damage from uncontrolled diabetes</p></li><li><p>Heart, kidney, and nerve complications</p></li><li><p>Hormonal imbalances affecting fertility and growth</p></li><li><p>Bone loss leading to fractures</p></li><li><p>Lifelong monitoring needed for many endocrine conditions</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:233:\"<ul><li><p>Diabetology and Metabolic Care</p></li><li><p>Thyroid and Parathyroid Disorders</p></li><li><p>Reproductive Endocrinology</p></li><li><p>Pediatric Endocrinology</p></li><li><p>Bone and Mineral Metabolism Care</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:57:\"Diabetology & Endocrinology in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:160:\"Nano Hospitals offers expert diabetes and hormone care in Bangalore with specialized endocrinologists for diabetes, thyroid, PCOS, and other hormonal disorders.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:32:01\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 13:06:53\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/ad21344f-1601-4dfa-bb47-5105d2c9beed.webp\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:10;s:4:\"name\";s:27:\"Diabetology & Endocrinology\";s:4:\"slug\";s:25:\"diabetology-endocrinology\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/aa2fba41-cb73-4339-b7e5-547c4dfb1507.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8DX2W3E0QMVZEGKA6NVQF.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:280:\"<p>Diabetology &amp; Endocrinology at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> focuses on the diagnosis, treatment, and long-term management of endocrine disorders — conditions caused by imbalance of hormones that regulate metabolism, growth, reproduction, and overall body function.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:737:\"<p>Hormonal problems often develop gradually, with symptoms such as unexplained weight changes, fatigue, excessive thirst, frequent urination, mood fluctuations, menstrual irregularities, or growth concerns. If left untreated, these disorders can affect the heart, kidneys, nerves, bones, and reproductive health. At Nano Hospitals, care is aimed not only at controlling symptoms but also at restoring hormonal balance and preventing long-term complications.</p><p>Treatment follows a patient-centred approach combining laboratory evaluation, advanced imaging, medication management, lifestyle guidance, and continuous monitoring. Each care plan is individualised based on age, gender, lifestyle, and the specific hormonal condition.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:459:\"<p>This specialty (Endocrinology) deals with disorders of hormone-producing glands such as the pancreas, thyroid, adrenal glands, pituitary gland, and reproductive glands. Early detection of hormonal imbalance is essential, as many endocrine conditions silently damage organs over time.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early screening, precise diagnosis, personalised medication plans, and long-term follow-up to maintain metabolic and hormonal stability.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:1017:\"<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Diabetes management with oral medications and insulin therapy</p></li><li><p>Continuous glucose monitoring guidance</p></li><li><p>Thyroid disorder management (hypothyroidism and hyperthyroidism)</p></li><li><p>Hormone therapy for adrenal and pituitary disorders</p></li><li><p>Lifestyle and dietary counselling for metabolic health</p></li><li><p>Bone health and osteoporosis management</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Fine-needle aspiration (FNA) for thyroid nodules</p></li><li><p>Hormone level testing with dynamic endocrine evaluations</p></li><li><p>Image-guided procedures for certain gland-related conditions</p></li></ul><h3>Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Thyroid surgery for nodules, goiter, or thyroid cancer</p></li><li><p>Adrenal gland surgery for hormone-secreting tumors</p></li><li><p>Pituitary gland surgery (in coordination with neurosurgery)</p></li><li><p>Parathyroid surgery for calcium imbalance disorder</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:407:\"<ul><li><p>Advanced hormone laboratory testing</p></li><li><p>Continuous glucose monitoring systems</p></li><li><p>Thyroid ultrasound imaging</p></li><li><p>CT Scan and MRI for endocrine gland evaluation</p></li><li><p>Bone density scan (DEXA) for osteoporosis detection</p></li><li><p>Dedicated diabetes education and counselling support</p></li><li><p>Long-term metabolic monitoring programs</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:440:\"<ul><li><p>Type 1 and Type 2 Diabetes</p></li><li><p>Gestational diabetes</p></li><li><p>Thyroid disorders (hypothyroidism, hyperthyroidism, nodules)</p></li><li><p>Polycystic Ovary Syndrome (PCOS)</p></li><li><p>Obesity and metabolic syndrome</p></li><li><p>Osteoporosis and calcium disorders</p></li><li><p>Pituitary gland disorders</p></li><li><p>Adrenal gland disorders</p></li><li><p>Hormonal growth and puberty disorders</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:302:\"<ul><li><p>Organ damage from uncontrolled diabetes</p></li><li><p>Heart, kidney, and nerve complications</p></li><li><p>Hormonal imbalances affecting fertility and growth</p></li><li><p>Bone loss leading to fractures</p></li><li><p>Lifelong monitoring needed for many endocrine conditions</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:233:\"<ul><li><p>Diabetology and Metabolic Care</p></li><li><p>Thyroid and Parathyroid Disorders</p></li><li><p>Reproductive Endocrinology</p></li><li><p>Pediatric Endocrinology</p></li><li><p>Bone and Mineral Metabolism Care</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:57:\"Diabetology & Endocrinology in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:160:\"Nano Hospitals offers expert diabetes and hormone care in Bangalore with specialized endocrinologists for diabetes, thyroid, PCOS, and other hormonal disorders.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:32:01\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 13:06:53\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/ad21344f-1601-4dfa-bb47-5105d2c9beed.webp\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}i:3;O:21:\"App\\Models\\Speciality\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:12:\"specialities\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:25;s:4:\"name\";s:33:\"Diagnostics & Laboratory Medicine\";s:4:\"slug\";s:31:\"diagnostics-laboratory-medicine\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/d383c009-5e44-4dc8-b4ff-06e4c1410d62.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8VQJ2WPB7YF4X2BVPE170.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:300:\"<p>Diagnostics &amp; Laboratory Medicine at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> provide accurate and timely testing that supports disease detection, treatment planning, and health monitoring. These services form the foundation of modern medical care, helping clinicians make evidence-based decisions.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:556:\"<p>Many illnesses show internal changes before symptoms become obvious. Laboratory testing helps detect infections, metabolic disorders, organ dysfunction, nutritional deficiencies, and chronic diseases at early stages. At Nano Hospitals, diagnostic services focus on precision, reliability, and quick turnaround times.</p><p>All tests are conducted using standardised protocols, automated analyzers, and strict quality control measures. Reports are interpreted by qualified pathologists and shared securely with treating physicians for integrated care</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:341:\"<p>Diagnostic laboratories analyze blood, urine, tissue, and other body samples to assess overall health and identify disease. Regular testing is essential for preventive care, chronic disease monitoring, and emergency evaluation.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises accuracy, hygiene, and fast reporting to support prompt medical decisions.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:850:\"<h3>Routine Laboratory Tests</h3><ul><li><p>Complete Blood Count (CBC)</p></li><li><p>Blood sugar and diabetes testing</p></li><li><p>Liver and kidney function tests</p></li><li><p>Lipid profile for cholesterol levels</p></li><li><p>Urine analysis</p></li></ul><h3>Specialized Diagnostic Tests</h3><ul><li><p>Thyroid and hormone testing</p></li><li><p>Vitamin and nutritional deficiency tests</p></li><li><p>Infection screening (viral, bacterial, parasitic)</p></li><li><p>Allergy testing</p></li><li><p>Autoimmune disorder panels</p></li></ul><h3>Advanced Diagnostic Services</h3><ul><li><p>Histopathology and biopsy analysis</p></li><li><p>Cytology testing (Pap smear, fluid analysis)</p></li><li><p>Microbiology cultures and sensitivity testing</p></li><li><p>Molecular diagnostics and PCR testing</p></li><li><p>Tumor marker testing</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:349:\"<ul><li><p>Fully automated biochemistry and hematology analyzers</p></li><li><p>Microbiology and pathology laboratories</p></li><li><p>Molecular diagnostic testing equipment</p></li><li><p>Sample collection and processing units</p></li><li><p>Barcode-based sample tracking systems</p></li><li><p>Digital reporting and record management</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:361:\"<ul><li><p>Infections and inflammatory diseases</p></li><li><p>Diabetes and metabolic disorders</p></li><li><p>Liver and kidney diseases</p></li><li><p>Hormonal imbalances</p></li><li><p>Nutritional deficiencies</p></li><li><p>Blood disorders such as anemia</p></li><li><p>Cancer indicators through tumor markers</p></li><li><p>Autoimmune diseases</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:305:\"<ul><li><p>Strict sterilisation and infection control</p></li><li><p>Regular calibration of laboratory equipment</p></li><li><p>Internal and external quality assurance programs</p></li><li><p>Accurate sample identification and tracking</p></li><li><p>Confidential handling of patient reports</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:191:\"<ul><li><p>Clinical Biochemistry</p></li><li><p>Hematology</p></li><li><p>Microbiology</p></li><li><p>Histopathology</p></li><li><p>Cytology</p></li><li><p>Molecular Diagnostics</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:72:\"Advanced Diagnostics & Laboratory Medicine in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:131:\"Get comprehensive diagnostic lab services in Bangalore at Nano Hospitals. Timely and precise testing for better treatment planning.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 18:18:41\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 13:18:15\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/c7c14599-24ae-4195-a683-a5a2b466188b.webp\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:25;s:4:\"name\";s:33:\"Diagnostics & Laboratory Medicine\";s:4:\"slug\";s:31:\"diagnostics-laboratory-medicine\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/d383c009-5e44-4dc8-b4ff-06e4c1410d62.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8VQJ2WPB7YF4X2BVPE170.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:300:\"<p>Diagnostics &amp; Laboratory Medicine at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> provide accurate and timely testing that supports disease detection, treatment planning, and health monitoring. These services form the foundation of modern medical care, helping clinicians make evidence-based decisions.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:556:\"<p>Many illnesses show internal changes before symptoms become obvious. Laboratory testing helps detect infections, metabolic disorders, organ dysfunction, nutritional deficiencies, and chronic diseases at early stages. At Nano Hospitals, diagnostic services focus on precision, reliability, and quick turnaround times.</p><p>All tests are conducted using standardised protocols, automated analyzers, and strict quality control measures. Reports are interpreted by qualified pathologists and shared securely with treating physicians for integrated care</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:341:\"<p>Diagnostic laboratories analyze blood, urine, tissue, and other body samples to assess overall health and identify disease. Regular testing is essential for preventive care, chronic disease monitoring, and emergency evaluation.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises accuracy, hygiene, and fast reporting to support prompt medical decisions.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:850:\"<h3>Routine Laboratory Tests</h3><ul><li><p>Complete Blood Count (CBC)</p></li><li><p>Blood sugar and diabetes testing</p></li><li><p>Liver and kidney function tests</p></li><li><p>Lipid profile for cholesterol levels</p></li><li><p>Urine analysis</p></li></ul><h3>Specialized Diagnostic Tests</h3><ul><li><p>Thyroid and hormone testing</p></li><li><p>Vitamin and nutritional deficiency tests</p></li><li><p>Infection screening (viral, bacterial, parasitic)</p></li><li><p>Allergy testing</p></li><li><p>Autoimmune disorder panels</p></li></ul><h3>Advanced Diagnostic Services</h3><ul><li><p>Histopathology and biopsy analysis</p></li><li><p>Cytology testing (Pap smear, fluid analysis)</p></li><li><p>Microbiology cultures and sensitivity testing</p></li><li><p>Molecular diagnostics and PCR testing</p></li><li><p>Tumor marker testing</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:349:\"<ul><li><p>Fully automated biochemistry and hematology analyzers</p></li><li><p>Microbiology and pathology laboratories</p></li><li><p>Molecular diagnostic testing equipment</p></li><li><p>Sample collection and processing units</p></li><li><p>Barcode-based sample tracking systems</p></li><li><p>Digital reporting and record management</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:361:\"<ul><li><p>Infections and inflammatory diseases</p></li><li><p>Diabetes and metabolic disorders</p></li><li><p>Liver and kidney diseases</p></li><li><p>Hormonal imbalances</p></li><li><p>Nutritional deficiencies</p></li><li><p>Blood disorders such as anemia</p></li><li><p>Cancer indicators through tumor markers</p></li><li><p>Autoimmune diseases</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:305:\"<ul><li><p>Strict sterilisation and infection control</p></li><li><p>Regular calibration of laboratory equipment</p></li><li><p>Internal and external quality assurance programs</p></li><li><p>Accurate sample identification and tracking</p></li><li><p>Confidential handling of patient reports</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:191:\"<ul><li><p>Clinical Biochemistry</p></li><li><p>Hematology</p></li><li><p>Microbiology</p></li><li><p>Histopathology</p></li><li><p>Cytology</p></li><li><p>Molecular Diagnostics</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:72:\"Advanced Diagnostics & Laboratory Medicine in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:131:\"Get comprehensive diagnostic lab services in Bangalore at Nano Hospitals. Timely and precise testing for better treatment planning.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 18:18:41\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 13:18:15\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/c7c14599-24ae-4195-a683-a5a2b466188b.webp\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}}s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;}s:10:\"procedures\";O:39:\"Illuminate\\Database\\Eloquent\\Collection\":2:{s:8:\"\0*\0items\";a:4:{i:0;O:20:\"App\\Models\\Procedure\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:10:\"procedures\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:26:{s:2:\"id\";i:329;s:5:\"title\";s:54:\"Abdominal Aortic Aneurysm Repair (Open / Endovascular)\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:60:\"procedures/banners/807c5f3e-bd4d-4ba5-aeae-64c42e87e85e.webp\";s:13:\"related_image\";N;s:4:\"slug\";s:50:\"abdominal-aortic-aneurysm-repair-open-endovascular\";s:12:\"introduction\";s:262:\"Abdominal Aortic Aneurysm (AAA) repair is a major vascular procedure performed to treat dangerous enlargement of the abdominal aorta and prevent life-threatening rupture. Repair may be performed through open surgery or minimally invasive endovascular techniques.\";s:7:\"what_is\";s:462:\"An abdominal aortic aneurysm develops when the aortic wall weakens and enlarges over time. Treatment options include: Open surgical aneurysm repair Endovascular aneurysm repair (EVAR) The procedure involves: Replacing or reinforcing the weakened aorta Restoring safe blood flow Preventing rupture and internal bleeding EVAR generally offers: Smaller incisions Faster recovery Reduced hospital stay Large or symptomatic aneurysms usually require urgent treatment.\";s:8:\"symptoms\";s:206:\"[{\"value\":\"Pulsating abdominal swelling\"},{\"value\":\"Abdominal or back pain\"},{\"value\":\"Sudden severe pain in rupture cases\"},{\"value\":\"Dizziness or collapse\"},{\"value\":\"Reduced blood circulation symptoms\"}]\";s:6:\"causes\";s:2:\"[]\";s:15:\"condition_risks\";s:178:\"[{\"value\":\"Major bleeding\"},{\"value\":\"Graft complications or leakage\"},{\"value\":\"Infection or blood clots\"},{\"value\":\"Kidney complications\"},{\"value\":\"Rare aneurysm recurrence\"}]\";s:11:\"preventions\";s:2:\"[]\";s:15:\"diagnosis_tests\";s:2:\"[]\";s:18:\"treatment_overview\";s:0:\"\";s:13:\"surgery_types\";s:2:\"[]\";s:17:\"recovery_timeline\";s:2:\"[]\";s:12:\"post_op_care\";s:242:\"[{\"value\":\"Maintain strict blood pressure control\"},{\"value\":\"Avoid smoking completely\"},{\"value\":\"Attend regular imaging follow-up visits\"},{\"value\":\"Take medications as prescribed\"},{\"value\":\"Report abdominal pain or weakness immediately\"}]\";s:13:\"surgery_risks\";s:178:\"[{\"value\":\"Major bleeding\"},{\"value\":\"Graft complications or leakage\"},{\"value\":\"Infection or blood clots\"},{\"value\":\"Kidney complications\"},{\"value\":\"Rare aneurysm recurrence\"}]\";s:17:\"long_term_outlook\";s:109:\"Early aneurysm repair significantly reduces rupture risk and improves long-term survival and vascular health.\";s:10:\"conclusion\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"seo_title\";s:54:\"Abdominal Aortic Aneurysm Repair (Open / Endovascular)\";s:15:\"seo_description\";s:262:\"Abdominal Aortic Aneurysm (AAA) repair is a major vascular procedure performed to treat dangerous enlargement of the abdominal aorta and prevent life-threatening rupture. Repair may be performed through open surgery or minimally invasive endovascular techniques.\";s:12:\"seo_keywords\";s:0:\"\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-05-18 07:03:51\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-09 05:52:03\";s:2:\"h1\";N;}s:11:\"\0*\0original