 Dr. M.G.R. Medical University in 2019, and DNB in Orthopedics/Orthopedic Surgery from National Board of Examinations in 2019. He is known for providing patient-focused spine care using advanced orthopedic and minimally invasive treatment approaches.\";s:13:\"speciality_id\";i:1;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-05-14 13:16:47\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-05-14 13:16:57\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:14:{s:2:\"id\";i:81;s:15:\"practitioner_id\";N;s:4:\"name\";s:17:\"Dr Sharan Achar T\";s:4:\"slug\";s:17:\"dr-sharan-achar-t\";s:5:\"photo\";s:49:\"doctors/c1538d8c-cad4-4d80-b0f4-6297b1941d9a.webp\";s:13:\"qualification\";s:31:\"MBBS, MS Ortho, DNB, FASSI, FAO\";s:11:\"designation\";s:36:\"Consultant Orthopaedic Spine Surgeon\";s:10:\"kmc_number\";s:6:\"109282\";s:8:\"location\";s:4:\"Both\";s:16:\"experience_years\";i:11;s:5:\"about\";s:632:\"Dr. Sharan Achar T is an experienced Orthopedic Spine Surgeon practicing at Nano Hospitals. He specializes in the diagnosis and treatment of spine disorders, back pain, neck pain, slipped disc, spinal injuries, and degenerative spine conditions. Dr. Sharan Achar T completed his MBBS from Mysore Medical College and Research Institute in 2015, MS in Orthopaedics from The Tamil Nadu Dr. M.G.R. Medical University in 2019, and DNB in Orthopedics/Orthopedic Surgery from National Board of Examinations in 2019. He is known for providing patient-focused spine care using advanced orthopedic and minimally invasive treatment approaches.\";s:13:\"speciality_id\";i:1;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-05-14 13:16:47\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-05-14 13:16:57\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:1:{s:10:\"speciality\";O:21:\"App\\Models\\Speciality\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:12:\"specialities\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:1;s:4:\"name\";s:31:\"Orthopedics (Bone & Joint Care)\";s:4:\"slug\";s:15:\"bone-joint-care\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:52:\"specialities/banners/01KGMKN5FEYX8P8GB8RAD96TMK.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:60:\"specialities/icons/c4b1f738-80ac-49b3-9524-3d66b841373a.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:418:\"<p>Nano Hospitals is one of the trusted orthopedic hospitals in Bangalore, offering specialised care for all conditions affecting the bones, joints, muscles, ligaments, tendons, and spine. The department treats a wide range of musculoskeletal problems — from fractures, knee pain, and arthritis to spine disorders and sports injuries — with a focus on accurate diagnosis, early treatment, and lasting recovery.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:1027:\"<p>Bone and joint problems often start with mild symptoms like knee stiffness, back pain, or reduced flexibility. Without timely treatment, these conditions can worsen and affect your ability to walk, work, and carry out everyday activities. At Nano Hospitals Bangalore, our orthopedic specialists are trained to identify the root cause and provide the right treatment at the right time — whether it is non-surgical management, physiotherapy, or advanced <a href=\"/procedures/knee-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">knee replacement</a> and <a href=\"/procedures/hip-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">hip replacement</a> surgery.</p><p>Our approach is patient-centred and personalised. Every treatment plan is built around the individual&#039;s age, activity level, severity of the condition, and overall health. From first consultation to post-surgery rehabilitation, our team ensures you receive consistent, compassionate, and clinically sound care.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:393:\"<p>Bone and Joint Care focuses on diagnosing and managing musculoskeletal conditions that affect mobility, strength, and daily function. Early symptoms such as joint pain, stiffness, or restricted movement can progress if left untreated.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early diagnosis, personalised treatment planning, and long-term rehabilitation to improve mobility and quality of life.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:1201:\"<h3><strong>Non-Surgical Treatments</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Medical management of joint pain and inflammation</p></li><li><p>Pain relief protocols and mobility support</p></li><li><p>Physiotherapy and rehabilitation programs</p></li><li><p>Posture correction and ergonomic guidance</p></li><li><p>Bone health evaluation and <a href=\"/conditions/osteoporosis\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Osteoporosis</a> management</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Minimally Invasive Procedures</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Arthroscopy for knee, shoulder, and other joints</p></li><li><p>Image-guided joint injections</p></li><li><p>Sports injury repair with minimal tissue damage</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Surgical Treatments</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Fracture fixation and trauma surgery</p></li><li><p><a href=\"/procedures/knee-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Knee replacement</a>, <a href=\"/procedures/hip-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">hip replacement</a>, and shoulder joint replacement surgeries</p></li><li><p>Spine surgeries for nerve compression or instability</p></li><li><p>Corrective surgeries for deformities</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:339:\"<ul><li><p>Digital X-Ray for rapid diagnosis</p></li><li><p>CT Scan and MRI for joint and spine evaluation</p></li><li><p>C-Arm for precision-guided procedures</p></li><li><p>Dedicated Orthopaedic ICU support</p></li><li><p>Post-operative recovery and monitoring units</p></li><li><p>Rehabilitation and physiotherapy services</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:726:\"<ul><li><p><a href=\"/conditions/osteoarthritis\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Osteoarthritis</a> and degenerative joint disease</p></li><li><p>Degenerative disc disease and spondylosis</p></li><li><p>Fractures, dislocations, and trauma injuries</p></li><li><p>Sports injuries and ligament tears</p></li><li><p>Chronic back pain, <a href=\"/conditions/back-and-neck-pain\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">sciatica</a>, and <a href=\"/conditions/back-and-neck-pain\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">slipped disc</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/conditions/osteoporosis\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Osteoporosis</a> and inflammatory joint conditions</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:297:\"<ul><li><p>Progressive degeneration if untreated</p></li><li><p>Reduced mobility and chronic pain</p></li><li><p>Risk of fractures in <a href=\"/conditions/osteoporosis\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Osteoporosis</a></p></li><li><p>Need for long-term rehabilitation</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:443:\"<ul><li><p><a href=\"/procedures/knee-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Knee replacement</a> and <a href=\"/procedures/hip-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">hip replacement</a> surgery</p></li><li><p>Spine Care and Back Pain Management</p></li><li><p>Sports Medicine and Arthroscopy</p></li><li><p>Orthopaedic Trauma Care</p></li><li><p>Geriatric Orthopaedics</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:84:\"Best Bone & Joint Care Hospital in Bangalore | Orthopedic Treatment | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:262:\"Looking for the best orthopedic hospital in Bangalore? Nano Hospitals offers expert bone and joint care for knee pain, joint replacement, fractures, arthritis, spine disorders, and sports injuries — with experienced orthopedic surgeons and advanced facilities.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-01-26 12:18:30\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-07-22 11:24:41\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:65:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/01KGM4QHD24NE3KGT2PWJVTGJS.jpg\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:1;s:4:\"name\";s:31:\"Orthopedics (Bone & Joint Care)\";s:4:\"slug\";s:15:\"bone-joint-care\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:52:\"specialities/banners/01KGMKN5FEYX8P8GB8RAD96TMK.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:60:\"specialities/icons/c4b1f738-80ac-49b3-9524-3d66b841373a.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:418:\"<p>Nano Hospitals is one of the trusted orthopedic hospitals in Bangalore, offering specialised care for all conditions affecting the bones, joints, muscles, ligaments, tendons, and spine. The department treats a wide range of musculoskeletal problems — from fractures, knee pain, and arthritis to spine disorders and sports injuries — with a focus on accurate diagnosis, early treatment, and lasting recovery.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:1027:\"<p>Bone and joint problems often start with mild symptoms like knee stiffness, back pain, or reduced flexibility. Without timely treatment, these conditions can worsen and affect your ability to walk, work, and carry out everyday activities. At Nano Hospitals Bangalore, our orthopedic specialists are trained to identify the root cause and provide the right treatment at the right time — whether it is non-surgical management, physiotherapy, or advanced <a href=\"/procedures/knee-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">knee replacement</a> and <a href=\"/procedures/hip-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">hip replacement</a> surgery.</p><p>Our approach is patient-centred and personalised. Every treatment plan is built around the individual&#039;s age, activity level, severity of the condition, and overall health. From first consultation to post-surgery rehabilitation, our team ensures you receive consistent, compassionate, and clinically sound care.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:393:\"<p>Bone and Joint Care focuses on diagnosing and managing musculoskeletal conditions that affect mobility, strength, and daily function. Early symptoms such as joint pain, stiffness, or restricted movement can progress if left untreated.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early diagnosis, personalised treatment planning, and long-term rehabilitation to improve mobility and quality of life.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:1201:\"<h3><strong>Non-Surgical Treatments</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Medical management of joint pain and inflammation</p></li><li><p>Pain relief protocols and mobility support</p></li><li><p>Physiotherapy and rehabilitation programs</p></li><li><p>Posture correction and ergonomic guidance</p></li><li><p>Bone health evaluation and <a href=\"/conditions/osteoporosis\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Osteoporosis</a> management</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Minimally Invasive Procedures</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Arthroscopy for knee, shoulder, and other joints</p></li><li><p>Image-guided joint injections</p></li><li><p>Sports injury repair with minimal tissue damage</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Surgical Treatments</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Fracture fixation and trauma surgery</p></li><li><p><a href=\"/procedures/knee-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Knee replacement</a>, <a href=\"/procedures/hip-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">hip replacement</a>, and shoulder joint replacement surgeries</p></li><li><p>Spine surgeries for nerve compression or instability</p></li><li><p>Corrective surgeries for deformities</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:339:\"<ul><li><p>Digital X-Ray for rapid diagnosis</p></li><li><p>CT Scan and MRI for joint and spine evaluation</p></li><li><p>C-Arm for precision-guided procedures</p></li><li><p>Dedicated Orthopaedic ICU support</p></li><li><p>Post-operative recovery and monitoring units</p></li><li><p>Rehabilitation and physiotherapy services</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:726:\"<ul><li><p><a href=\"/conditions/osteoarthritis\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Osteoarthritis</a> and degenerative joint disease</p></li><li><p>Degenerative disc disease and spondylosis</p></li><li><p>Fractures, dislocations, and trauma injuries</p></li><li><p>Sports injuries and ligament tears</p></li><li><p>Chronic back pain, <a href=\"/conditions/back-and-neck-pain\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">sciatica</a>, and <a href=\"/conditions/back-and-neck-pain\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">slipped disc</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/conditions/osteoporosis\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Osteoporosis</a> and inflammatory joint conditions</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:297:\"<ul><li><p>Progressive degeneration if untreated</p></li><li><p>Reduced mobility and chronic pain</p></li><li><p>Risk of fractures in <a href=\"/conditions/osteoporosis\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Osteoporosis</a></p></li><li><p>Need for long-term rehabilitation</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:443:\"<ul><li><p><a href=\"/procedures/knee-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Knee replacement</a> and <a href=\"/procedures/hip-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">hip replacement</a> surgery</p></li><li><p>Spine Care and Back Pain Management</p></li><li><p>Sports Medicine and Arthroscopy</p></li><li><p>Orthopaedic Trauma Care</p></li><li><p>Geriatric Orthopaedics</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:84:\"Best Bone & Joint Care Hospital in Bangalore | Orthopedic Treatment | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:262:\"Looking for the best orthopedic hospital in Bangalore? Nano Hospitals offers expert bone and joint care for knee pain, joint replacement, fractures, arthritis, spine disorders, and sports injuries — with experienced orthopedic surgeons and advanced facilities.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-01-26 12:18:30\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-07-22 11:24:41\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:65:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/01KGM4QHD24NE3KGT2PWJVTGJS.jpg\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:11:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:15:\"practitioner_id\";i:2;s:4:\"slug\";i:3;s:5:\"photo\";i:4;s:13:\"qualification\";i:5;s:11:\"designation\";i:6;s:10:\"kmc_number\";i:7;s:8:\"location\";i:8;s:16:\"experience_years\";i:9;s:5:\"about\";i:10;s:13:\"speciality_id\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}i:2;O:17:\"App\\Models\\Doctor\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:7:\"doctors\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:14:{s:2:\"id\";i:80;s:15:\"practitioner_id\";N;s:4:\"name\";s:15:\"Dr kirthi kiran\";s:4:\"slug\";s:15:\"dr-kirthi-kiran\";s:5:\"photo\";s:49:\"doctors/e91f1303-3f9f-41c5-b623-9d53e0893653.webp\";s:13:\"qualification\";s:8:\"MBBS, MS\";s:11:\"designation\";s:33:\"CONSULTANT ENT &HEAD NECK SURGEON\";s:10:\"kmc_number\";s:6:\"112127\";s:8:\"location\";s:8:\"Hulimavu\";s:16:\"experience_years\";i:6;s:5:\"about\";s:538:\"Dr. Kirthi Kiran is an experienced ENT Surgeon practicing at Nano Hospitals, BG Road branch, Hulimavu, Bengaluru. He specializes in the diagnosis and treatment of ear, nose, throat, head, and neck conditions using advanced medical and surgical techniques. Dr. Kirthi Kiran is known for providing patient-focused care with expertise in managing sinus disorders, throat infections, hearing problems, and ENT-related surgeries. He is committed to delivering comprehensive and effective treatment with a focus on long-term patient well-being.\";s:13:\"speciality_id\";i:15;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-05-14 13:08:19\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-05-14 13:12:55\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:14:{s:2:\"id\";i:80;s:15:\"practitioner_id\";N;s:4:\"name\";s:15:\"Dr kirthi kiran\";s:4:\"slug\";s:15:\"dr-kirthi-kiran\";s:5:\"photo\";s:49:\"doctors/e91f1303-3f9f-41c5-b623-9d53e0893653.webp\";s:13:\"qualification\";s:8:\"MBBS, MS\";s:11:\"designation\";s:33:\"CONSULTANT ENT &HEAD NECK SURGEON\";s:10:\"kmc_number\";s:6:\"112127\";s:8:\"location\";s:8:\"Hulimavu\";s:16:\"experience_years\";i:6;s:5:\"about\";s:538:\"Dr. Kirthi Kiran is an experienced ENT Surgeon practicing at Nano Hospitals, BG Road branch, Hulimavu, Bengaluru. He specializes in the diagnosis and treatment of ear, nose, throat, head, and neck conditions using advanced medical and surgical techniques. Dr. Kirthi Kiran is known for providing patient-focused care with expertise in managing sinus disorders, throat infections, hearing problems, and ENT-related surgeries. He is committed to delivering comprehensive and effective treatment with a focus on long-term patient well-being.\";s:13:\"speciality_id\";i:15;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-05-14 13:08:19\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-05-14 13:12:55\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:1:{s:10:\"speciality\";O:21:\"App\\Models\\Speciality\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:12:\"specialities\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:15;s:4:\"name\";s:24:\"ENT (Ear, Nose & Throat)\";s:4:\"slug\";s:19:\"ent-ear-nose-throat\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/81e37695-8ad3-421b-820b-a3803c1c26a6.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:60:\"specialities/icons/584ecd7e-f9da-4310-b634-97d42b2226a1.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:216:\"<p>ENT Care at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> focuses on the diagnosis, treatment, and long-term management of disorders affecting the ear, nose, throat, sinuses, voice box, and related head and neck structures.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:691:\"<p>ENT problems often begin with common symptoms such as ear pain, hearing difficulty, nasal blockage, sinus headaches, sore throat, or voice changes. While many issues are mild, persistent or recurrent symptoms can indicate infections, structural problems, allergies, or more serious conditions. At Nano Hospitals, care is directed toward relieving symptoms, restoring normal function, and preventing complications.</p><p>Treatment follows a patient-centred approach combining clinical evaluation, endoscopic assessment, hearing tests, imaging, and when needed, medical or surgical intervention. Care plans are tailored according to age, symptom severity, lifestyle, and overall health.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:401:\"<p>Otolaryngology (ENT) deals with conditions of hearing, balance, breathing, speech, and swallowing. Early symptoms such as persistent nasal congestion, frequent throat infections, dizziness, or hearing loss should not be ignored.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early diagnosis using endoscopy, audiology testing, and imaging, followed by personalised treatment and rehabilitation when required.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:943:\"<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Medical treatment for ear, sinus, and throat infections</p></li><li><p>Allergy management and nasal spray therapy</p></li><li><p>Hearing aid fitting and hearing rehabilitation</p></li><li><p>Voice therapy for vocal strain or hoarseness</p></li><li><p>Management of vertigo and balance disorders</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Nasal endoscopy for sinus and nasal evaluation</p></li><li><p>Ear microsuction and minor ear procedures</p></li><li><p>Endoscopic sinus procedures</p></li><li><p>Injection therapy for vocal cord disorders</p></li></ul><h3>Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Tonsillectomy and adenoidectomy</p></li><li><p>Functional Endoscopic Sinus Surgery (FESS)</p></li><li><p>Ear surgeries including eardrum repair</p></li><li><p>Thyroid and salivary gland surgeries</p></li><li><p>Head and neck tumor surgeries (in coordination with oncology)</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:332:\"<ul><li><p>Nasal endoscopy and laryngoscopy systems</p></li><li><p>Audiometry and hearing assessment labs</p></li><li><p>CT Scan for sinus and temporal bone imaging</p></li><li><p>Microscopic ear surgery equipment</p></li><li><p>Voice analysis and speech therapy support</p></li><li><p>Dedicated ENT operation theatres</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:394:\"<ul><li><p>Sinusitis and nasal polyps</p></li><li><p>Allergic rhinitis</p></li><li><p>Hearing loss and ear infections</p></li><li><p>Tinnitus (ringing in ears)</p></li><li><p>Tonsillitis and throat infections</p></li><li><p>Voice disorders</p></li><li><p>Vertigo and balance disorders</p></li><li><p>Deviated nasal septum (DNS)</p></li><li><p>Thyroid and salivary gland conditions</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:293:\"<ul><li><p>Chronic sinus infections affecting breathing and sleep</p></li><li><p>Progressive hearing loss if untreated</p></li><li><p>Recurrent throat infections in children</p></li><li><p>Voice strain impacting communication</p></li><li><p>Balance disorders increasing fall risk</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:219:\"<ul><li><p>Otology (Ear and Hearing Care)</p></li><li><p>Rhinology (Nose and Sinus Care)</p></li><li><p>Laryngology (Voice and Throat Care)</p></li><li><p>Head and Neck Surgery</p></li><li><p>Pediatric ENT</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:74:\"ENT Specialist in Bangalore | Ear Nose Throat Treatment – Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:160:\"Consult experienced ENT specialists in Bangalore at Nano Hospitals for sinus issues, ear infections, hearing problems, and throat conditions with advanced care.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:51:52\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 13:15:20\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/8b867e2e-4698-4bcf-a6c3-e53687f62a85.webp\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:15;s:4:\"name\";s:24:\"ENT (Ear, Nose & Throat)\";s:4:\"slug\";s:19:\"ent-ear-nose-throat\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/81e37695-8ad3-421b-820b-a3803c1c26a6.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:60:\"specialities/icons/584ecd7e-f9da-4310-b634-97d42b2226a1.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:216:\"<p>ENT Care at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> focuses on the diagnosis, treatment, and long-term management of disorders affecting the ear, nose, throat, sinuses, voice box, and related head and neck structures.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:691:\"<p>ENT problems often begin with common symptoms such as ear pain, hearing difficulty, nasal blockage, sinus headaches, sore throat, or voice changes. While many issues are mild, persistent or recurrent symptoms can indicate infections, structural problems, allergies, or more serious conditions. At Nano Hospitals, care is directed toward relieving symptoms, restoring normal function, and preventing complications.</p><p>Treatment follows a patient-centred approach combining clinical evaluation, endoscopic assessment, hearing tests, imaging, and when needed, medical or surgical intervention. Care plans are tailored according to age, symptom severity, lifestyle, and overall health.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:401:\"<p>Otolaryngology (ENT) deals with conditions of hearing, balance, breathing, speech, and swallowing. Early symptoms such as persistent nasal congestion, frequent throat infections, dizziness, or hearing loss should not be ignored.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early diagnosis using endoscopy, audiology testing, and imaging, followed by personalised treatment and rehabilitation when required.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:943:\"<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Medical treatment for ear, sinus, and throat infections</p></li><li><p>Allergy management and nasal spray therapy</p></li><li><p>Hearing aid fitting and hearing rehabilitation</p></li><li><p>Voice therapy for vocal strain or hoarseness</p></li><li><p>Management of vertigo and balance disorders</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Nasal endoscopy for sinus and nasal evaluation</p></li><li><p>Ear microsuction and minor ear procedures</p></li><li><p>Endoscopic sinus procedures</p></li><li><p>Injection therapy for vocal cord disorders</p></li></ul><h3>Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Tonsillectomy and adenoidectomy</p></li><li><p>Functional Endoscopic Sinus Surgery (FESS)</p></li><li><p>Ear surgeries including eardrum repair</p></li><li><p>Thyroid and salivary gland surgeries</p></li><li><p>Head and neck tumor surgeries (in coordination with oncology)</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:332:\"<ul><li><p>Nasal endoscopy and laryngoscopy systems</p></li><li><p>Audiometry and hearing assessment labs</p></li><li><p>CT Scan for sinus and temporal bone imaging</p></li><li><p>Microscopic ear surgery equipment</p></li><li><p>Voice analysis and speech therapy support</p></li><li><p>Dedicated ENT operation theatres</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:394:\"<ul><li><p>Sinusitis and nasal polyps</p></li><li><p>Allergic rhinitis</p></li><li><p>Hearing loss and ear infections</p></li><li><p>Tinnitus (ringing in ears)</p></li><li><p>Tonsillitis and throat infections</p></li><li><p>Voice disorders</p></li><li><p>Vertigo and balance disorders</p></li><li><p>Deviated nasal septum (DNS)</p></li><li><p>Thyroid and salivary gland conditions</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:293:\"<ul><li><p>Chronic sinus infections affecting breathing and sleep</p></li><li><p>Progressive hearing loss if untreated</p></li><li><p>Recurrent throat infections in children</p></li><li><p>Voice strain impacting communication</p></li><li><p>Balance disorders increasing fall risk</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:219:\"<ul><li><p>Otology (Ear and Hearing Care)</p></li><li><p>Rhinology (Nose and Sinus Care)</p></li><li><p>Laryngology (Voice and Throat Care)</p></li><li><p>Head and Neck Surgery</p></li><li><p>Pediatric ENT</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:74:\"ENT Specialist in Bangalore | Ear Nose Throat Treatment – Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:160:\"Consult experienced ENT specialists in Bangalore at Nano Hospitals for sinus issues, ear infections, hearing problems, and throat conditions with advanced care.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:51:52\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 13:15:20\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/8b867e2e-4698-4bcf-a6c3-e53687f62a85.webp\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s: