ation</p></li><li><p>Carotid artery disease</p></li><li><p>Aortic aneurysms</p></li><li><p>Non-healing vascular ulcers</p></li><li><p>Blood vessel blockages in limbs</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:300:\"<ul><li><p>Risk of stroke from untreated carotid disease</p></li><li><p>Limb loss due to severe arterial blockage</p></li><li><p>Recurrent clots in high-risk patients</p></li><li><p>Chronic pain and mobility limitations</p></li><li><p>Long-term care needed for diabetic vascular disease</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:238:\"<ul><li><p>Endovascular Surgery</p></li><li><p>Peripheral Arterial Disease Management</p></li><li><p>Venous Disorders and Varicose Vein Care</p></li><li><p>Diabetic Limb Salvage</p></li><li><p>Aortic and Major Vessel Surgery</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:104:\"Best Vascular Surgery Hospital in Bangalore | Varicose Veins & Blocked Artery Treatment | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:272:\"Nano Hospitals is a trusted vascular surgery hospital in Bangalore offering expert treatment for varicose veins, blocked arteries, diabetic foot, DVT, peripheral artery disease, and non-healing ulcers. Consult experienced vascular surgeons — book your appointment today.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:43:28\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-12 13:18:10\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/bc161b15-e5eb-478c-8622-64722d0c1e94.webp\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{