 and individualized treatment plans to help patients breathe freely and live without limitations.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:321:\"<p>Asthma triggered by allergens, pollution, and respiratory infections can severely disrupt daily life if not managed proactively. At Nano Hospitals Bangalore, we combine the best pulmonary diagnostics with proven therapeutic protocols to bring lasting relief and improved lung function to every patient we care for.</p>\";s:8:\"overview\";s:7:\"<p></p>\";s:8:\"symptoms\";s:122:\"[{\"value\":\"Wheezing\"},{\"value\":\"Shortness of breath\"},{\"value\":\"Chest tightness\"},{\"value\":\"Cough (especially at night)\"}]\";s:6:\"causes\";s:122:\"[{\"value\":\"Allergens (dust, pollen, pets)\"},{\"value\":\"Pollution\"},{\"value\":\"Respiratory infections\"},{\"value\":\"Genetics\"}]\";s:5:\"risks\";s:103:\"[{\"value\":\"Severe asthma attacks\"},{\"value\":\"Respiratory failure\"},{\"value\":\"Reduced quality of life\"}]\";s:9:\"diagnosis\";s:106:\"[{\"value\":\"Spirometry (lung function test)\"},{\"value\":\"Peak flow monitoring\"},{\"value\":\"Allergy testing\"}]\";s:9:\"treatment\";s:147:\"[{\"value\":\"Inhalers (bronchodilators, corticosteroids)\"},{\"value\":\"Oral medications (leukotriene inhibitors)\"},{\"value\":\"Lifestyle modifications\"}]\";s:8:\"recovery\";s:79:\"<p>Asthma can be controlled with treatment; patients live normal lives.<br></p>\";s:10:\"sort_order\";i:0;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-03 06:39:58\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-13 18:03:19\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:94:\"Best Asthma Treatment in Bangalore | Top Respiratory Specialists in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:210:\"Nano Hospitals is one of the best asthma treatment hospitals in Bangalore. Our expert pulmonologists provide advanced respiratory care for children and adults for better breathing and improved quality of life.\n\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";N;s:2:\"h1\";s:43:\"Best Asthma Treatment Hospital In Bangalo