nd comprehensive spine care for patients suffering from chronic back pain, cervical spondylosis, herniated discs, sciatica, and other spinal conditions across Bengaluru. Our best team of spine surgeons, orthopedic specialists, neurologists, and physiotherapists collaborates closely to deliver precise diagnosis and personalized treatment plans to help every patient achieve lasting pain relief and restored mobility.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:593:\"<p>Back and neck pain are among the most commonly reported musculoskeletal complaints affecting working professionals, elderly individuals, and athletes across Bangalore and Bengaluru — often caused by poor posture, sedentary lifestyles, degenerative disc disease, or spinal injuries. At Nano Hospitals Bangalore, we are equipped with the best state-of-the-art spinal diagnostic and interventional infrastructure, combining advanced imaging technology with evidence-based surgical and non-surgical treatment protocols to help every patient live pain-free and regain full quality of life.</p>\";s:8:\"overview\";s:130:\"<p>Back and neck pain are common musculoskeletal issues. A slipped disc occurs when spinal<br>disc material presses on nerves.</p>\";s:8:\"symptoms\";s:126:\"[{\"value\":\"Pain in back\\/neck\"},{\"value\":\"Numbness or tingling\"},{\"value\":\"Weakness in limbs\"},{\"value\":\"Difficulty walking\"}]\";s:6:\"causes\";s:89:\"[{\"value\":\"Poor posture\"},{\"value\":\"Heavy lifting\"},{\"value\":\"Aging\"},{\"value\":\"Trauma\"}]\";s:5:\"risks\";s:16:\"[{\"value\":null}]\";s:9:\"diagnosis\";s:78:\"[{\"value\":\"Chronic pain\"},{\"value\":\"Paralysis (rare)\"},{\"value\":\"Disability\"}]\";s:9:\"treatment\";s:102:\"[{\"value\":\"Pain medications\"},{\"value\":\"Physiotherapy\"},{\"value\":\"Surgery (discectomy, laminectomy)\"}]\";s:8:\"recovery\";s:97:\"<p>Most cases improve with conservative treatment; surgery restores function in severe cases.</p>\";s:10:\"sort_order\";i:0;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"created_at\";s: