-reflux\";s:4:\"icon\";N;s:8:\"cta_text\";N;s:8:\"cta_link\";N;s:5:\"about\";s:499:\"<p>Nano Hospitals is one of the best acid reflux treatment hospitals in Bangalore, providing advanced and comprehensive gastroenterology care for patients suffering from chronic acid reflux, GERD, heartburn, and gastritis across Bengaluru. Our best team of gastroenterologists, digestive health specialists, and dietary experts collaborates closely to deliver precise diagnosis and personalized treatment plans to help every patient achieve lasting digestive relief and improved quality of life.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:657:\"<p>Acid reflux occurs when stomach acid flows back into the esophagus causing persistent heartburn, chest discomfort, and digestive distress — a condition increasingly affecting working professionals, students, and elderly individuals across Bangalore and Bengaluru due to irregular eating habits, stress, and sedentary lifestyles. At Nano Hospitals Bangalore, we are equipped with the best state-of-the-art gastrointestinal diagnostic and treatment infrastructure, combining advanced endoscopic technology with evidence-based medical and surgical protocols to help every patient find permanent relief from acid reflux and related digestive disorders.</p>\";s:8:\"overview\";s:7:\"<p></p>\";s:8:\"symptoms\";s:93:\"[{\"value\":\"Heartburn\"},{\"value\":\"Indigestion\"},{\"value\":\"Nausea\"},{\"value\":\"Abdominal pain\"}]\";s:6:\"causes\";s:120:\"[{\"value\":\"Spicy\\/fatty foods\"},{\"value\":\"Alcohol\"},{\"value\":\"Smoking\"},{\"value\":\"pylori infection\"},{\"value\":\"Stress\"}]\";s:5:\"risks\";s:84:\"[{\"value\":\"Ulcers\"},{\"value\":\"Esophageal damage\"},{\"value\":\"Stomach cancer (rare)\"}]\";s:9:\"diagnosis\";s:49:\"[{\"value\":\"Endoscopy\"},{\"value\":\"pH monitoring\"}]\";s:9:\"treatment\";s:134:\"[{\"value\":\"Antacids\"},{\"value\":\"Proton pump inhibitors (PPIs)\"},{\"value\":\"Antibiotics (for H. pylori)\"},{\"value\":\"Lifestyle changes\"}]\";s:8:\"r