 untreated. At Nano Hospitals Bangalore, we are equipped with the best state-of-the-art urological diagnostic and surgical infrastructure, combining advanced minimally invasive technology with evidence-based treatment protocols to help every patient restore normal urinary function and reclaim their quality of life.</p>\";s:8:\"overview\";s:7:\"<p></p>\";s:8:\"symptoms\";s:187:\"[{\"value\":\"Frequent urination\"},{\"value\":\"Weak urine stream\"},{\"value\":\"Difficulty starting urination\"},{\"value\":\"Nighttime urination\"},{\"value\":\"Feeling of incomplete bladder emptying\"}]\";s:6:\"causes\";s:445:\"[{\"value\":\"Aging \\u2013 The risk of prostate enlargement increases as men grow older\"},{\"value\":\"Hormonal Changes \\u2013 Changes in male hormones such as testosterone and dihydrotestosterone (DHT) can stimulate prostate growth.\"},{\"value\":\"Family History \\u2013 Men with relatives who have BPH may have a higher risk of developing the condition.\"},{\"value\":\"Obesity \\u2013 Being overweight can increase the likelihood of prostate enlargement.\"}]\";s:5:\"risks\";s:400:\"[{\"value\":\"Age above 50 years \\u2013 BPH is uncommon in younger men but becomes more common with age.\"},{\"value\":\"Family History of Prostate Problems \\u2013 Genetic factors may increase the risk.\"},{\"value\":\"Obesity and Metabolic Syndrome \\u2013 Excess body weight can affect hormone levels and prostate health.\"},{\"value\":\"Diabetes \\u2013 Men with diabetes have a higher chance of developing BPH.\"}]\";s:9:\"diagnosis\";s:494:\"[{\"value\":\"Digital Rectal Examination (DRE) \\u2013 The doctor checks the size and shape of the prostate by inserting a gloved finger into the rectum.\"},{\"value\":\"Prostate-Specific Antigen (PSA) Test \\u2013 A blood test used to measure PSA levels and assess prostate health.\"},{\"value\":\"Urine Test (Urinalysis) \\u2013 Helps detect infections, blood, or other urinary abnormalities.\"},{\"value\":\"Ultrasound \\u2013 Imaging used to evaluate prostate size and check for bladder or kidney problems.\"}]\";s:9:\"treatment\";s:107:\"[{\"value\":\"Antibiotic medications\"},{\"value\":\"Increased water intake\"},{\"value\":\"Pain relief medications\"}]\";s:8:\"recovery\";s:470:\"<p>UTIs usually respond quickly to antibiotics when treated early. Symptoms typically improve within a few days of starting treatment. Drinking plenty of water helps flush bacteria from the urinary tract and speeds recovery. Maintaining proper hygiene and hydration can help prevent recurrent infections. Some patients may require longer treatment if infections recur frequently. With proper care and early treatment, most UTIs heal completely without complications.</p>\";s:10:\"sort_order\";i:0;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-03-16 18:09:52\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-15 13:43:07\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:48:\"Best BPH Treatment in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:141:\"Get the best BPH & Prostate Enlargement treatment at Nano Hospitals Bangalore from expert urologists for complete and lasting urinary relief.\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";N;s:2:\"h1\";s:65:\"Best Benign Prostatic Hyperplasia Treatment Hospital In Bangalore\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";i:21;s:4:\"name\";s:29:\"Benign Prostatic Hyperplasia \";s:4:\"slug\";s:28:\"benign-prostatic-hyperplasia\";s:4:\"icon\";N;s:8:\"cta_text\";N;s:8:\"cta_link\";N;s:5:\"about\";s:574:\"<p>Nano Hospitals is one of the best Benign Prostatic Hyperplasia (BPH) treatment hospitals in Bangalore, providing advanced and comprehensive urological care for men suffering from prostate enlargement, urinary obstruction, and related bladder conditions across Bengaluru. Our best team of experienced urologists, uro-surgeons, and bladder health specialists collaborates closely to deliver precise diagnosis and personalized treatment plans, ensuring every patient achieves complete urinary relief, restored prostate health, and significantly impr