and Bengaluru due to sedentary lifestyles and unhealthy dietary habits. Often progressing silently without noticeable symptoms until serious liver damage develops, fatty liver disease demands early detection and timely medical intervention to prevent progression to liver fibrosis, cirrhosis, and liver failure. At Nano Hospitals Bangalore, we are equipped with the best state-of-the-art hepatological diagnostic and treatment infrastructure, combining advanced liver imaging technology with evidence-based medical and lifestyle intervention protocols to help every patient restore healthy liver function and prevent long-term complications.</p>\";s:8:\"overview\";s:7:\"<p></p>\";s:8:\"symptoms\";s:112:\"[{\"value\":\"Often asymptomatic\"},{\"value\":\"Fatigue\"},{\"value\":\"Abdominal discomfort\"},{\"value\":\"Enlarged liver\"}]\";s:6:\"causes\";s:96:\"[{\"value\":\"Obesity\"},{\"value\":\"Obesity\"},{\"value\":\"Alcohol abuse\"},{\"value\":\"High cholesterol\"}]\";s:5:\"risks\";s:74:\"[{\"value\":\"Cirrhosis\"},{\"value\":\"Liver cancer\"},{\"value\":\"Liver failure\"}]\";s:9:\"diagnosis\";s:76:\"[{\"value\":\"Ultrasound\"},{\"value\":\"Liver function tests\"},{\"value\":\"Biopsy\"}]\";s:9:\"treatment\";s:115:\"[{\"value\":\"Lifestyle modification\"},{\"value\":\"Medications (experimental for NAFLD)\"},{\"value\":\"Alcohol cessation\"}]\";s:8:\"recovery\";s:70:\"<p>Reversible in early stages; advanced cases need transplant.<br></p>\";s:10:\"sort_order\";i:0;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-03 06:57:26\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-15 14:06:22\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:56:\"Best Fatty Liver Treatment in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:160:\"Diagnosed with fatty liver or NAFLD? Get the best Fatty Liver Disease treatment at Nano Hospitals Bangalore from expert hepatologists for complete liver health.\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";N;s:2:\"h1\";s:56:\"Best Fatty Liver Disease Treatment Hospital In Bangalore\";}s:11:\"\0*\0origi