ealing. From simple hairline fractures to complex multi-fragment and open fractures, delayed or improper treatment can lead to permanent disability, chronic pain, and long-term functional limitations. At Nano Hospitals Bangalore, we are equipped with the best state-of-the-art orthopedic and trauma surgical infrastructure, combining advanced imaging technology, minimally invasive fixation techniques, and evidence-based rehabilitation protocols to help every patient recover faster, stronger, and more completely.</p>\";s:8:\"overview\";s:7:\"<p></p>\";s:8:\"symptoms\";s:97:\"[{\"value\":\"Severe pain\"},{\"value\":\"Swelling\"},{\"value\":\"Deformity\"},{\"value\":\"Loss of function\"}]\";s:6:\"causes\";s:107:\"[{\"value\":\"Falls\"},{\"value\":\"Accidents\"},{\"value\":\"Sports injuries\"},{\"value\":\"Weak bones (osteoporosis)\"}]\";s:5:\"risks\";s:81:\"[{\"value\":\"Permanent deformity\"},{\"value\":\"Disability\"},{\"value\":\"Chronic pain\"}]\";s:9:\"diagnosis\";s:40:\"[{\"value\":\"X-rays\"},{\"value\":\"CT\\/MRI\"}]\";s:9:\"treatment\";s:103:\"[{\"value\":\"Casting or splinting\"},{\"value\":\"Surgery (plates, screws, rods)\"},{\"value\":\"Physiotherapy\"}]\";s:8:\"recovery\";s:81:\"<p>Most fractures heal in 6–12 weeks; rehabilitation restores mobility.<br></p>\";s:10:\"sort_order\";i:0;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-03 06:38:02\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-15 14:00:01\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:62:\"Best Fracture & Trauma Treatment in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:158:\"Injured or dealing with a fracture? Get the best Fractures and Trauma treatment at Nano Hospitals Bangalore from expert orthopedic surgeons for fast recovery.\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";N;s:2:\"h1\";s:64:\"Best Fractures and Injury Trauma Treatment Hospital In Bangalore\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:23:{s:2:\"id\";i:9;s:4:\"name\";s:27:\"Fractures and Injury Trauma\";s:4:\"slug\";s:27:\"fractures-and-injury-trauma\";s:4:\"icon\";N;s:8:\"cta_text\";N;s:8:\"cta_link\";N;s:5:\"about\";s:652:\"<p>Nano Hospitals is one of the best fractures and injury trauma treatment hospitals in Bangalore, providing advanced and comprehensive orthopedic and trauma care for patients suffering from bone fractures, sports injuries, road accident trauma, and complex musculoskeletal injuries across Bengaluru. Our best team of experienced orthopedic surgeons, trauma specialists, physiotherapists, and rehabilitation experts collaborates closely to deliver the fastest possible diagnosis and most effective personalized treatment plans, ensuring every patient achieves complete fracture healing, restored mobility, and the best possible functional recovery.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:817:\"<p>Fractures are breaks or cracks in bones resulting from trauma, accidents, sports injuries, falls, or underlying conditions like osteoporosis — affecting individuals of all ages across Bangalore and Bengaluru and often requiring immediate and expert medical intervention for safe and complete healing. From simple hairline fractures to complex multi-fragment and open fractures, delayed or improper treatment can lead to permanent disability, chronic pain, and long-term functional limitations. At Nano Hospitals Bangalore, we are equipped with the best state-of-the-art orthopedic and trauma surgical infrastructure, combining advanced imaging technology, minimally invasive fixation techniques, and evidence-based rehabilitation protocols to help every patient recover faster, stronger, and more completely.</p>\";s:8:\"overview\";s:7:\"<p></p>\";s:8:\"symptoms\";s:97:\"[{\"value\":\"Severe pain\"},{\"value\":\"Swelling\"},{\"value\":\"Deformity\"},{\"value\":\"Loss of function\"}]\";s:6:\"causes\";s:107:\"[{\"value\":\"Falls\"},{\"value\":\"Accidents\"},{\"value\":\"Sports injuries\"},{\"value\":\"Weak bones (osteoporosis)\"}]\";s:5:\"risks\";s:81:\"[{\"value\":\"Permanent deformity\"},{\"value\":\"Disability\"},{\"value\":\"Chronic pain\"}]\";s:9:\"diagnosis\";s:40:\"[{\"value\":\"X-rays\"},{\"value\":\"CT\\/MRI\"}]\";s:9:\"treatment\";s:103:\"[{\"value\":\"Casting or splinting\"},{\"value\":\"Surgery (plates, screws, rods)\"},{\"value\":\"Physiotherapy\"}]\";s:8:\"recovery\";s:81:\"<p>Most fractures heal in 6–12 weeks; rehabilitation restores mobility.<br></p>\";s:10:\"sort_order\";i:0;s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-03 06:38:02\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-15 14:00:01\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:62:\"Best Fracture & Trauma Treatment in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:158:\"Injured or dealing with a fracture? Get the best Fractures and Trauma treatment at Nano Hospitals Bangalore from expert orthopedic surgeons for fast recovery.\";s:13:\"meta_keywords\";N;s:2:\"h1\";s:64:\"Best Fractures and Injury Trauma Treatment Hospital In Bangalore\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:6:{s:8:\"symptoms\";s:5:\"array\";s:6:\"causes\";s:5:\"array\";s:5:\"risks\";s:5:\"array\";s:9:\"diagnosis\";s:5:\"array\";s:9:\"treatment\";s:5:\"array\";s:9:\"is_active\";s:7:\"boolean\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:20:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:2:\"h1\";i:2;s:4:\"slug\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:8:\"cta_text\";i:5;s:8:\"cta_link\";i:6;s:5:\"about\";i:7;s:10:\"about_more\";i:8;s:8:\"overview\";i:9;s:8:\"symptoms\";i:10;s:6:\"causes\";i:11;s:5:\"risks\";i:12;s:9:\"diagnosis\";i:13;s:9:\"treatment\";i:14;s:8:\"recovery\";i:15;s:10:\"sort_order\";i:16;s:9:\"is_active\";i:17;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:18;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:19;s:13:\"meta_keywords\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}}s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;}s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:10;s:14:\"\0*\0currentPage\";i:1;s:7:\"\0*\0path\";s:32:\"http://127.0.0.1:8000/conditions\";s:8:\"\0*\0query\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fragment\";N;s:11:\"\0*\0pageName\";s:4:\"page\";s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:10:\"onEachSide\";i:3;s:10:\"\0*\0options\";a:2:{s:4:\"path\";s:32:\"http://127.0.0.1:8000/conditions\";s:8:\"pageName\";s:4:\"page\";}s:8:\"\0*\0total\";i:870;s:11:\"\0*\0lastPage\";i:87;}',1785306089),('laravel-cache-content:v17:procedure:achilles-tendon-repair','O:20:\"App\\Models\\Procedure\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:10:\"procedures\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:26:{s:2:\"id\";i:58;s:5:\"title\";s:22:\"Achilles Tendon Repair\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:60:\"procedures/banners/c87010c4-485d-4fef-8ff2-38eb8b97fb2e.webp\";s:13:\"related_image\";N;s:4:\"slug\";s:22:\"achilles-tendon-repair\";s:12:\"introduction\";s:186:\"<p>Achilles tendon repair is a surgical procedure used to treat a torn or ruptured Achilles tendon, which connects the calf muscles to the heel bone and helps in walking and running.</p>\";s:7:\"what_is\";s:315:\"<p>Achilles tendon repair is a surgical procedure performed to repair a torn or ruptured Achilles tendon. The Achilles tendon is the largest tendon in the body and plays an essential role in walking, running, and jumping. Surgery restores tendon continuity and strength so the ankle can function normally again.</p>\";s:8:\"symptoms\";s:123:\"[\"Sudden pain in the back of the ankle\", \"Difficulty walking\", \"Swelling near the heel\", \"Weakness while pushing the foot\"]\";s:6:\"causes\";s:90:\"[\"Sports injuries\", \"Sudden increase in physical activity\", \"Direct trauma to the tendon\"]\";s:15:\"condition_risks\";s:135:\"[\"High-impact sports activities\", \"Sudden strain on calf muscles\", \"Previous Achilles tendon injuries\", \"Poor warm-up before exercise\"]\";s:11:\"preventions\";s:181:\"[\"Warm up properly before physical activity\", \"Gradually increase intensity of exercise\", \"Perform calf strengthening and stretching exercises\", \"Use proper footwear during sports\"]\";s:15:\"diagnosis_tests\";s:153:\"[\"Physical examination of the ankle\", \"Ultrasound imaging of the tendon\", \"MRI scan to assess tendon rupture\", \"Functional assessment of ankle movement\"]\";s:18:\"treatment_overview\";s:270:\"<p>During Achilles tendon repair surgery, the torn ends of the tendon are stitched together using strong sutures. In some cases, tendon grafts may be used if the rupture is severe. The goal of the surgery is to restore tendon strength, stability, and ankle function.</p>\";s:13:\"surgery_types\";s:299:\"[{\"name\": \"1. Open Achilles Tendon Repair\", \"description\": \"A traditional surgical approach using an incision to repair the torn tendon.\"}, {\"name\": \"2. Minimally Invasive Achilles Repair\", \"description\": \"A modern technique using small incisions and specialized instruments to repair the tendon.\"}]\";s:17:\"recovery_timeline\";s:2:\"[]\";s:12:\"post_op_care\";s:239:\"[\"Wear protective braces or casts as advised\", \"Follow physiotherapy and rehabilitation exercises\", \"Avoid high-impact activities during recovery\", \"Take prescribed medications for pain and inflammation\", \"Attend regular follow-up visits\"]\";s:13:\"surgery_risks\";s:81:\"[\"Infection\", \"Tendon stiffness\", \"Re-rupture of the tendon\", \"Nerve irritation\"]\";s:17:\"long_term_outlook\";s:332:\"<p>Achilles tendon repair helps restore strength and flexibility in the ankle. With proper rehabilitation, most patients regain normal walking and athletic ability. Physiotherapy exercises improve muscle strength and balance. Avoiding excessive strain during recovery is important. Long-term results are usually very successful.</p>\";s:10:\"conclusion\";s:228:\"<p>Achilles tendon repair surgery is an effective treatment for ruptured tendons and helps restore ankle stability and movement. With proper rehabilitation and care, patients can return to normal daily activities and sports.</p>\";s:9:\"seo_title\";s:57:\"Achilles Tendon Repair Surgery & Recovery | Nano Hospital\";s:15:\"seo_description\";s:160:\"Expert Achilles tendon rupture treatment at Nano Hospital. Learn about our advanced surgery options, diagnosis, recovery timelines, and expert care to get you b\";s:12:\"seo_keywords\";s:155:\"achilles tendon repair surgery, achilles tendon rupture treatment, ankle tendon repair, achilles surgery, Nano Hospital orthopedics, torn achilles recovery\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-03-17 13:39:48\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-13 16:55:20\";s:2:\"h1\";N;}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:26:{s:2:\"id\";i:58;s:5:\"title\";s:22:\"Achilles Tendon Repair\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:60:\"procedures/banners/c87010c4-485d-4fef-8ff2-38eb8b97fb2e.webp\";s:13:\"related_image\";N;s:4:\"slug\";s:22:\"achilles-tendon-repair\";s:12:\"introduction\";s:186:\"<p>Achilles tendon repair is a surgical procedure used to treat a torn or ruptured Achilles tendon, which connects the calf muscles to the heel bone and helps in walking and running.</p>\";s:7:\"what_is\";s:315:\"<p>Achilles tendon repair is a surgical procedure performed to repair a torn or ruptured Achilles tendon. The Achilles tendon is the largest tendon in the body and plays an essential role in walking, running, and jumping. Surgery restores tendon continuity and strength so the ankle can function normally again.</p>\";s:8:\"symptoms\";s:123:\"[\"Sudden pain in the back of the ankle\", \"Diffi