y in the ankle. With proper rehabilitation, most patients regain normal walking and athletic ability. Physiotherapy exercises improve muscle strength and balance. Avoiding excessive strain during recovery is important. Long-term results are usually very successful.</p>\";s:10:\"conclusion\";s:228:\"<p>Achilles tendon repair surgery is an effective treatment for ruptured tendons and helps restore ankle stability and movement. With proper rehabilitation and care, patients can return to normal daily activities and sports.</p>\";s:9:\"seo_title\";s:57:\"Achilles Tendon Repair Surgery & Recovery | Nano Hospital\";s:15:\"seo_description\";s:160:\"Expert Achilles tendon rupture treatment at Nano Hospital. Learn about our advanced surgery options, diagnosis, recovery timelines, and expert care to get you b\";s:12:\"seo_keywords\";s:155:\"achilles tendon repair surgery, achilles tendon rupture treatment, ankle tendon repair, achilles surgery, Nano Hospital orthopedics, torn achilles recovery\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-03-17 13:39:48\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-13 16:55:20\";s:2:\"h1\";N;}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:10:{s:8:\"symptoms\";s:5:\"array\";s:6:\"causes\";s:5:\"array\";s:15:\"condition_risks\";s:5:\"array\";s:11:\"preventions\";s:5:\"array\";s:15:\"diagnosis_tests\";s:5:\"array\";s:13:\"surgery_types\";s:5:\"array\";s:17:\"recovery_timeline\";s:5:\"array\";s:12:\"post_op_care\";s:5:\"array\";s:13:\"surgery_risks\";s:5:\"array\";s:9:\"is_active\";s:7:\"boolean\";}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:1:{s:4:\"faqs\";O:39:\"Illuminate\\Database\\Eloquent\\Collection\":2:{s:8:\"\0*\0items\";a:0:{}s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;}}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCal