></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:414:\"<ul><li><p>Acid reflux (GERD) and gastritis</p></li><li><p>Peptic ulcers</p></li><li><p>Irritable Bowel Syndrome (IBS)</p></li><li><p>Inflammatory Bowel Disease (IBD)</p></li><li><p>Gallstones and bile duct disorders</p></li><li><p>Liver diseases including fatty liver and hepatitis</p></li><li><p>Pancreatitis</p></li><li><p>Constipation and chronic diarrhea</p></li><li><p>Gastrointestinal bleeding</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:351:\"<ul><li><p>Chronic inflammation leading to long-term damage</p></li><li><p>Nutritional deficiencies due to poor absorption</p></li><li><p>Risk of bleeding or obstruction in untreated conditions</p></li><li><p>Liver damage if metabolic or viral diseases are not managed</p></li><li><p>Recurrence of symptoms without lifestyle modification</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:214:\"<ul><li><p>Gastroenterology</p></li><li><p>Hepatology (Liver Care)</p></li><li><p>Pancreatic Disorders Management</p></li><li><p>Advanced Endoscopy</p></li><li><p>GI Oncology (Digestive System Tumors)</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:106:\"Best Gastroenterology Hospital in Bangalore | Digestive Care, Endoscopy & Liver Treatment | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:273:\"Nano Hospitals is a trusted gastroenterology hospital in Bangalore offering expert treatment for acidity, GERD, IBS, gallstones, liver disease, pancreatitis, and digestive disorders. Experienced gastroenterologists with DM Gastroenterology — book your appointment today.\n\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:28:42\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-12 13:42:49\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/696ceeb8-be1b-4ef3-adae-fee0989cdcda.webp\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}i:7;O:21:\"App\\Models\\Speciality\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:12:\"specialities\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:4;s:4:\"name\";s:16:\"General Medicine\";s:4:\"slug\";s:16:\"general-medicine\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/c722a471-d790-4f97-b241-93335a9a9b2f.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:60:\"specialities/icons/4391236c-b190-4044-8e18-6fcf4d9e7cbb.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:375:\"<p>General Medicine &amp; Allied Specialties at Nano Hospitals forms the core foundation of adult patient care, serving as the first and most crucial point of contact for individuals experiencing acute illness, chronic disease, or unexplained symptoms. The department focuses on holistic diagnosis, medical management, disease prevention, and long-term health monitoring.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:419:\"<p>Many medical conditions begin subtly—fatigue, fever, breathlessness, weight changes, or body pain may signal deeper issues. General Medicine specialists are trained to assess the body as a whole, identify root causes, and coordinate care across specialties when required.</p><p>Care is continuous, evidence-based, and personalised—supporting patients through illness, recovery, and long-term disease control.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:317:\"<p>General Medicine focuses on comprehensive adult healthcare, from diagnosis of acute illnesses to long-term management of chronic and complex conditions.</p><p>At Nano Hospitals, the department plays a pivotal role in early detection, coordinated treatment, and timely referral to super-specialties when needed.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:913:\"<h3><strong>Diagnostic &amp; Evaluation Services</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Detailed medical consultation and physical examination</p></li><li><p>Systematic evaluation of unexplained symptoms</p></li><li><p>Risk assessment for lifestyle and metabolic diseases</p></li><li><p>Coordination of diagnostic investigations</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Medical Management</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Treatment of acute infections and illnesses</p></li><li><p>Long-term management of chronic diseases</p></li><li><p>Medication optimisation and monitoring</p></li><li><p>Supportive care during hospitalisation</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Preventive &amp; Inpatient Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Preventive health check-ups and adult vaccinations</p></li><li><p>Lifestyle modification and nutritional counselling</p></li><li><p>Management of hospitalised patients</p></li><li><p>ICU coordination and post-discharge follow-up</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:344:\"<ul><li><p>Advanced laboratory medicine for accurate diagnostics</p></li><li><p>ECG, Digital X-Ray, CT Scan, and MRI</p></li><li><p>2D Echocardiography when cardiac assessment is required</p></li><li><p>24×7 pharmacy support</p></li><li><p>ICU and emergency services</p></li><li><p>Electronic monitoring and documentation systems</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:450:\"<ul><li><p>Fever of unknown origin and acute infections</p></li><li><p>Respiratory and gastrointestinal illnesses</p></li><li><p>Diabetes, hypertension, and thyroid disorders</p></li><li><p>Chronic kidney and liver disease (medical management)</p></li><li><p>Obesity, dyslipidaemia, and metabolic syndrome</p></li><li><p>Geriatric conditions and multiple co-morbidities</p></li><li><p>Undiagnosed fatigue, weight loss, pain, or weakness</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:288:\"<ul><li><p>Thorough clinical evaluation, not assumptions</p></li><li><p>Early diagnosis to prevent complications</p></li><li><p>Rational, evidence-based treatment</p></li><li><p>Clear communication and patient education</p></li><li><p>Long-term disease control and follow-up</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:209:\"<ul><li><p>Internal Medicine</p></li><li><p>Preventive Medicine</p></li><li><p>Geriatric Medicine</p></li><li><p>Infectious Disease Management</p></li><li><p>Lifestyle and Metabolic Disorder Care</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:60:\"Best General Medicine Hospital in Bangalore | Nano hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:170:\"Nano Hospitals offers expert general medicine care in Bangalore with experienced physicians for diagnosis, treatment, and prevention of a wide range of health conditions.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:11:51\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 13:15:56\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/4b17feda-73bd-4d51-a61e-89312fe7b056.webp\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:4;s:4:\"name\";s:16:\"General Medicine\";s:4:\"slug\";s:16:\"general-medicine\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/c722a471-d790-4f97-b241-93335a9a9b2f.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:60:\"specialities/icons/4391236c-b190-4044-8e18-6fcf4d9e7cbb.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:375:\"<p>General Medicine &amp; Allied Specialties at Nano Hospitals forms the core foundation of adult patient care, serving as the first and most crucial point of contact for individuals experiencing acute illness, chronic disease, or unexplained symptoms. The department focuses on holistic diagnosis, medical management, disease prevention, and long-term health monitoring.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:419:\"<p>Many medical conditions begin subtly—fatigue, fever, breathlessness, weight changes, or body pain may signal deeper issues. General Medicine specialists are trained to assess the body as a whole, identify root causes, and coordinate care across specialties when required.</p><p>Care is continuous, evidence-based, and personalised—supporting patients through illness, recovery, and long-term disease control.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:317:\"<p>General Medicine focuses on comprehensive adult healthcare, from diagnosis of acute illnesses to long-term management of chronic and complex conditions.</p><p>At Nano Hospitals, the department plays a pivotal role in early detection, coordinated treatment, and timely referral to super-specialties when needed.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:913:\"<h3><strong>Diagnostic &amp; Evaluation Services</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Detailed medical consultation and physical examination</p></li><li><p>Systematic evaluation of unexplained symptoms</p></li><li><p>Risk assessment for lifestyle and metabolic diseases</p></li><li><p>Coordination of diagnostic investigations</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Medical Management</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Treatment of acute infections and illnesses</p></li><li><p>Long-term management of chronic diseases</p></li><li><p>Medication optimisation and monitoring</p></li><li><p>Supportive care during hospitalisation</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Preventive &amp; Inpatient Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Preventive health check-ups and adult vaccinations</p></li><li><p>Lifestyle modification and nutritional counselling</p></li><li><p>Management of hospitalised patients</p></li><li><p>ICU coordination and post-discharge follow-up</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:344:\"<ul><li><p>Advanced laboratory medicine for accurate diagnostics</p></li><li><p>ECG, Digital X-Ray, CT Scan, and MRI</p></li><li><p>2D Echocardiography when cardiac assessment is required</p></li><li><p>24×7 pharmacy support</p></li><li><p>ICU and emergency services</p></li><li><p>Electronic monitoring and documentation systems</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:450:\"<ul><li><p>Fever of unknown origin and acute infections</p></li><li><p>Respiratory and gastrointestinal illnesses</p></li><li><p>Diabetes, hypertension, and thyroid disorders</p></li><li><p>Chronic kidney and liver disease (medical management)</p></li><li><p>Obesity, dyslipidaemia, and metabolic syndrome</p></li><li><p>Geriatric conditions and multiple co-morbidities</p></li><li><p>Undiagnosed fatigue, weight loss, pain, or weakness</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:288:\"<ul><li><p>Thorough clinical evaluation, not assumptions</p></li><li><p>Early diagnosis to prevent complications</p></li><li><p>Rational, evidence-based treatment</p></li><li><p>Clear communication and patient education</p></li><li><p>Long-term disease control and follow-up</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:209:\"<ul><li><p>Internal Medicine</p></li><li><p>Preventive Medicine</p></li><li><p>Geriatric Medicine</p></li><li><p>Infectious Disease Management</p></li><li><p>Lifestyle and Metabolic Disorder Care</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:60:\"Best General Medicine Hospital in Bangalore | Nano hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:170:\"Nano Hospitals offers expert general medicine care in Bangalore with experienced physicians for diagnosis, treatment, and prevention of a wide range of health conditions.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:11:51\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 13:15:56\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/4b17feda-73bd-4d51-a61e-89312fe7b056.webp\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}i:8;O:21:\"App\\Models\\Speciality\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:12:\"specialities\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:20;s:4:\"name\";s:15:\"General Surgery\";s:4:\"slug\";s:15:\"general-surgery\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/b2ff2995-3f03-4edb-b01d-745873f23215.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:60:\"specialities/icons/743532e5-1351-4c45-b9b9-0d681d1876c8.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:306:\"<p>General Surgery at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> focuses on the surgical management of a wide range of conditions affecting the abdomen, digestive tract, soft tissues, skin, and certain endocrine organs. It is one of the core surgical specialties, addressing both emergency and planned procedures.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:717:\"<p>Surgical conditions may present with symptoms such as persistent abdominal pain, swelling, lumps, hernias, infections, or digestive complications. Some conditions require urgent intervention, while others can be treated electively using minimally invasive techniques. At Nano Hospitals, care aims to provide safe surgery, faster recovery, minimal scarring, and reduced hospital stay whenever possible.</p><p>Treatment follows a patient-centred approach combining clinical evaluation, imaging, laboratory tests, anesthesia support, advanced laparoscopic techniques, and structured post-operative care. Each surgical plan is personalised based on the patient’s condition, age, overall health, and risk factors.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:446:\"<p>General Surgery deals with diseases that often require operative treatment, particularly those involving the abdomen and soft tissues. Early symptoms like severe abdominal pain, vomiting, swelling in the groin, or unexplained lumps should be medically evaluated without delay.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises timely diagnosis, minimally invasive approaches, infection control, and enhanced recovery protocols for improved patient outcomes.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:844:\"<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Initial management of infections and abscesses</p></li><li><p>Medical management of early-stage surgical conditions</p></li><li><p>Wound care and dressing</p></li><li><p>Pre-surgical evaluation and stabilization</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Laparoscopic appendectomy</p></li><li><p>Laparoscopic gallbladder removal</p></li><li><p>Laparoscopic hernia repair</p></li><li><p>Diagnostic laparoscopy</p></li><li><p>Minimally invasive abscess drainage</p></li></ul><h3>Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Appendectomy for appendicitis</p></li><li><p>Hernia repair surgery</p></li><li><p>Gallbladder removal for gallstones</p></li><li><p>Intestinal obstruction surgery</p></li><li><p>Thyroid and breast lump surgeries</p></li><li><p>Emergency abdominal surgeries</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:317:\"<ul><li><p>Advanced laparoscopic surgery systems</p></li><li><p>High-definition imaging equipment</p></li><li><p>Modular operation theatres</p></li><li><p>Intensive Care Unit (ICU) support</p></li><li><p>Post-operative monitoring units</p></li><li><p>Sterile surgical environments with infection control</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:370:\"<ul><li><p>Appendicitis</p></li><li><p>Hernias (inguinal, umbilical, incisional)</p></li><li><p>Gallstones and gallbladder disease</p></li><li><p>Piles (hemorrhoids) and anal fissures</p></li><li><p>Breast lumps and infections</p></li><li><p>Thyroid nodules and goiter</p></li><li><p>Abdominal infections and abscesses</p></li><li><p>Intestinal obstruction</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:336:\"<ul><li><p>Risk of complications in emergency surgeries</p></li><li><p>Infection risk if wounds are not properly managed</p></li><li><p>Delayed treatment leading to severe complications</p></li><li><p>Need for post-operative lifestyle adjustments</p></li><li><p>Possibility of recurrence in certain conditions like hernias</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:215:\"<ul><li><p>Laparoscopic (Minimally Invasive) Surgery</p></li><li><p>Gastrointestinal Surgery</p></li><li><p>Breast Surgery</p></li><li><p>Thyroid and Endocrine Surgery</p></li><li><p>Colorectal Surgery</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:59:\"Comprehensive General Surgery in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:134:\"Trusted general surgery services at Nano Hospitals, Bangalore. Expert surgeons for a wide range of conditions and surgical treatments.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 18:04:07\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-07 14:05:37\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/38da333d-f9cb-4879-af67-1e028b207439.webp\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:20;s:4:\"name\";s:15:\"General Surgery\";s:4:\"slug\";s:15:\"general-surgery\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/b2ff2995-3f03-4edb-b01d-745873f23215.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:60:\"specialities/icons/743532e5-1351-4c45-b9b9-0d681d1876c8.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:306:\"<p>General Surgery at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> focuses on the surgical management of a wide range of conditions affecting the abdomen, digestive tract, soft tissues, skin, and certain endocrine organs. It is one of the core surgical specialties, addressing both emergency and planned procedures.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:717:\"<p>Surgical conditions may present with symptoms such as persistent abdominal pain, swelling, lumps, hernias, infections, or digestive complications. Some conditions require urgent intervention, while others can be treated electively using minimally invasive techniques. At Nano Hospitals, care aims to provide safe surgery, faster recovery, minimal scarring, and reduced hospital stay whenever possible.</p><p>Treatment follows a patient-centred approach combining clinical evaluation, imaging, laboratory tests, anesthesia support, advanced laparoscopic techniques, and structured post-operative care. Each surgical plan is personalised based on the patient’s condition, age, overall health, and risk factors.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:446:\"<p>General Surgery deals with diseases that often require operative treatment, particularly those involving the abdomen and soft tissues. Early symptoms like severe abdominal pain, vomiting, swelling in the groin, or unexplained lumps should be medically evaluated without delay.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises timely diagnosis, minimally invasive approaches, infection control, and enhanced recovery protocols for improved patient outcomes.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:844:\"<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Initial management of infections and abscesses</p></li><li><p>Medical management of early-stage surgical conditions</p></li><li><p>Wound care and dressing</p></li><li><p>Pre-surgical evaluation and stabilization</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Laparoscopic appendectomy</p></li><li><p>Laparoscopic gallbladder removal</p></li><li><p>Laparoscopic hernia repair</p></li><li><p>Diagnostic laparoscopy</p></li><li><p>Minimally invasive abscess drainage</p></li></ul><h3>Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Appendectomy for appendicitis</p></li><li><p>Hernia repair surgery</p></li><li><p>Gallbladder removal for gallstones</p></li><li><p>Intestinal obstruction surgery</p></li><li><p>Thyroid and breast lump surgeries</p></li><li><p>Emergency abdominal surgeries</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:317:\"<ul><li><p>Advanced laparoscopic surgery systems</p></li><li><p>High-definition imaging equipment</p></li><li><p>Modular operation theatres</p></li><li><p>Intensive Care Unit (ICU) support</p></li><li><p>Post-operative monitoring units</p></li><li><p>Sterile surgical environments with infection control</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:370:\"<ul><li><p>Appendicitis</p></li><li><p>Hernias (inguinal, umbilical, incisional)</p></li><li><p>Gallstones and gallbladder disease</p></li><li><p>Piles (hemorrhoids) and anal fissures</p></li><li><p>Breast lumps and infections</p></li><li><p>Thyroid nodules and goiter</p></li><li><p>Abdominal infections and abscesses</p></li><li><p>Intestinal obstruction</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:336:\"<ul><li><p>Risk of complications in emergency surgeries</p></li><li><p>Infection risk if wounds are not properly managed</p></li><li><p>Delayed treatment leading to severe complications</p></li><li><p>Need for post-operative lifestyle adjustments</p></li><li><p>Possibility of recurrence in certain conditions like hernias</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:215:\"<ul><li><p>Laparoscopic (Minimally Invasive) Surgery</p></li><li><p>Gastrointestinal Surgery</p></li><li><p>Breast Surgery</p></li><li><p>Thyroid and Endocrine Surgery</p></li><li><p>Colorectal Surgery</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:59:\"Comprehensive General Surgery in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:134:\"Trusted general surgery services at Nano Hospitals, Bangalore. Expert surgeons for a wide range of conditions and surgical treatments.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 18:04:07\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-07 14:05:37\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/38da333d-f9cb-4879-af67-1e028b207439.webp\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}i:9;O:21:\"App\\Models\\Speciality\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:12:\"specialities\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:23;s:4:\"name\";s:23:\"Geriatrics (Elder Care)\";s:4:\"slug\";s:10:\"geriatrics\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/0d72e63e-fd1d-427c-a360-747430272bc4.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8RK6FVB8NJHQ6KGJH998F.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:292:\"<p>Elder Care at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> focuses on the comprehensive healthcare needs of older adults. This specialty addresses age-related medical conditions, mobility challenges, memory concerns, and overall well-being to help seniors maintain independence and quality of life.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:719:\"<p>As people age, they may experience multiple health issues such as joint pain, balance problems, memory decline, vision or hearing loss, and chronic illnesses like diabetes or heart disease. These conditions often require coordinated care rather than treatment of a single problem. At Nano Hospitals, elder care is designed to provide holistic, respectful, and continuous support tailored to the unique needs of senior patients.</p><p>Care follows a patient-centred and family-inclusive approach, combining medical management, rehabilitation, nutritional guidance, mental health support, and preventive care. Treatment plans are personalised according to functional ability, lifestyle, and long-term health goals.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:389:\"<p>Geriatric care focuses on preventing, diagnosing, and managing health conditions common in older adults. Early recognition of mobility decline, memory changes, or increased fall risk can significantly improve long-term outcomes.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises preventive screenings, chronic disease management, fall prevention, and rehabilitation to support safe and active ageing.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:843:\"<h3>Medical Care</h3><ul><li><p>Management of chronic diseases (diabetes, hypertension, arthritis)</p></li><li><p>Medication review to prevent side effects and interactions</p></li><li><p>Memory and cognitive health evaluation</p></li><li><p>Vaccination and preventive health screening</p></li></ul><h3>Supportive Therapies</h3><ul><li><p>Physiotherapy for mobility and balance</p></li><li><p>Nutritional counselling for age-related needs</p></li><li><p>Pain management programs</p></li><li><p>Mental health support for depression, anxiety, and loneliness</p></li></ul><h3>Functional and Home Support</h3><ul><li><p>Fall risk assessment and prevention strategies</p></li><li><p>Home care guidance and caregiver education</p></li><li><p>Post-hospitalisation recovery programs</p></li><li><p>Palliative and comfort care when needed</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:355:\"<ul><li><p>Senior-friendly consultation areas</p></li><li><p>Multidisciplinary geriatric assessment services</p></li><li><p>Rehabilitation and physiotherapy units</p></li><li><p>Cognitive screening and mental health support</p></li><li><p>Nutrition and lifestyle counselling services</p></li><li><p>Coordination with home healthcare services</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:381:\"<ul><li><p>Arthritis and joint degeneration</p></li><li><p>Osteoporosis and fracture risk</p></li><li><p>Memory disorders and dementia</p></li><li><p>Balance disorders and frequent falls</p></li><li><p>Hearing and vision-related difficulties</p></li><li><p>Chronic heart, lung, and metabolic diseases</p></li><li><p>Urinary incontinence</p></li><li><p>Sleep disorders</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:288:\"<ul><li><p>Increased risk of falls and fractures</p></li><li><p>Multiple medications causing side effects</p></li><li><p>Memory decline affecting daily independence</p></li><li><p>Social isolation impacting mental health</p></li><li><p>Slow recovery after illness or surgery</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:220:\"<ul><li><p>Geriatric Medicine</p></li><li><p>Memory and Cognitive Health Care</p></li><li><p>Geriatric Rehabilitation</p></li><li><p>Palliative and Supportive Care</p></li><li><p>Preventive Geriatric Health</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:63:\"Comprehensive Elder & Senior Care in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:130:\"Get specialized geriatric care in Bangalore at Nano Hospitals. Support for senior health, memory concerns, and independent living.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 18:13:23\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 13:11:14\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/fe45f2bc-389d-4ec0-afce-faac4e823222.webp\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:23;s:4:\"name\";s:23:\"Geriatrics (Elder Care)\";s:4:\"slug\";s:10:\"geriatrics\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/0d72e63e-fd1d-427c-a360-747430272bc4.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8RK6FVB8NJHQ6KGJH998F.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:292:\"<p>Elder Care at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> focuses on the comprehensive healthcare needs of older adults. This specialty addresses age-related medical conditions, mobility challenges, memory concerns, and overall well-being to help seniors maintain independence and quality of life.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:719:\"<p>As people age, they may experience multiple health issues such as joint pain, balance problems, memory decline, vision or hearing loss, and chronic illnesses like diabetes or heart disease. These conditions often require coordinated care rather than treatment of a single problem. At Nano Hospitals, elder care is designed to provide holistic, respectful, and continuous support tailored to the unique needs of senior patients.</p><p>Care follows a patient-centred and family-inclusive approach, combining medical management, rehabilitation, nutritional guidance, mental health support, and preventive care. Treatment plans are personalised according to functional ability, lifestyle, and long-term health goals.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:389:\"<p>Geriatric care focuses on preventing, diagnosing, and managing health conditions common in older adults. Early recognition of mobility decline, memory changes, or increased fall risk can significantly improve long-term outcomes.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises preventive screenings, chronic disease management, fall prevention, and rehabilitation to support safe and active ageing.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:843:\"<h3>Medical Care</h3><ul><li><p>Management of chronic diseases (diabetes, hypertension, arthritis)</p></li><li><p>Medication review to prevent side effects and interactions</p></li><li><p>Memory and cognitive health evaluation</p></li><li><p>Vaccination and preventive health screening</p></li></ul><h3>Supportive Therapies</h3><ul><li><p>Physiotherapy for mobility and balance</p></li><li><p>Nutritional counselling for age-related needs</p></li><li><p>Pain management programs</p></li><li><p>Mental health support for depression, anxiety, and loneliness</p></li></ul><h3>Functional and Home Support</h3><ul><li><p>Fall risk assessment and prevention strategies</p></li><li><p>Home care guidance and caregiver education</p></li><li><p>Post-hospitalisation recovery programs</p></li><li><p>Palliative and comfort care when needed</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:355:\"<ul><li><p>Senior-friendly consultation areas</p></li><li><p>Multidisciplinary geriatric assessment services</p></li><li><p>Rehabilitation and physiotherapy units</p></li><li><p>Cognitive screening and mental health support</p></li><li><p>Nutrition and lifestyle counselling services</p></li><li><p>Coordination with home healthcare services</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:381:\"<ul><li><p>Arthritis and joint degeneration</p></li><li><p>Osteoporosis and fracture risk</p></li><li><p>Memory disorders and dementia</p></li><li><p>Balance disorders and frequent falls</p></li><li><p>Hearing and vision-related difficulties</p></li><li><p>Chronic heart, lung, and metabolic diseases</p></li><li><p>Urinary incontinence</p></li><li><p>Sleep disorders</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:288:\"<ul><li><p>Increased risk of falls and fractures</p></li><li><p>Multiple medications causing side effects</p></li><li><p>Memory decline affecting daily independence</p></li><li><p>Social isolation impacting mental health</p></li><li><p>Slow recovery after illness or surgery</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:220:\"<ul><li><p>Geriatric Medicine</p></li><li><p>Memory and Cognitive Health Care</p></li><li><p>Geriatric Rehabilitation</p></li><li><p>Palliative and Supportive Care</p></li><li><p>Preventive Geriatric Health</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:63:\"Comprehensive Elder & Senior Care in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:130:\"Get specialized geriatric care in Bangalore at Nano Hospitals. Support for senior health, memory concerns, and independent living.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 18:13:23\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 13:11:14\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/fe45f2bc-389d-4ec0-afce-faac4e823222.webp\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}i:10;O:21:\"App\\Models\\Speciality\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:12:\"specialities\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:3;s:4:\"name\";s:24:\"Gynaecology (Women care)\";s:4:\"slug\";s:21:\"women-care-obstetrics\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/9e11e61f-65dc-4fcc-a31a-b6da65c0a508.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ87T8219AQDKPMNBFTX08S.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:314:\"<p>Women Care at Nano Hospitals is dedicated to supporting women through every stage of life—adolescence, reproductive years, pregnancy, childbirth, and menopause. Women’s health needs are complex and dynamic, influenced by hormonal changes, lifestyle, family planning choices, and age-related transitions.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:516:\"<p>From preventive screenings and menstrual health to safe motherhood and advanced gynaecological care, the department emphasises early diagnosis, informed decision-making, and respectful care. During pregnancy and childbirth, special focus is placed on maternal safety and newborn wellbeing, supported by integrated neonatal services and emergency preparedness.</p><p>Care is delivered in partnership with women and their families—ensuring clarity, dignity, and emotional support alongside medical excellence.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:345:\"<p>Women Care focuses on preventive health, reproductive wellbeing, safe motherhood, and gynaecological care across all life stages. Early diagnosis and continuity of care help women make informed health decisions.</p><p>Nano Hospitals combines clinical expertise with respectful, compassionate care to support women’s long-term wellbeing.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:866:\"<h3><strong>Preventive &amp; Outpatient Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Adolescent gynaecology counselling</p></li><li><p>Menstrual health evaluation and management</p></li><li><p>Family planning and contraception guidance</p></li><li><p>Routine gynaecological check-ups and screenings</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Antenatal &amp; Pregnancy Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Preconception counselling</p></li><li><p>Antenatal check-ups and fetal monitoring</p></li><li><p>Management of pregnancy-related conditions</p></li><li><p>High-risk pregnancy monitoring and care</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Labour, Delivery &amp; Gynaecological Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Normal and assisted vaginal deliveries</p></li><li><p>Emergency obstetric interventions</p></li><li><p>Immediate newborn assessment and care</p></li><li><p>Medical and surgical gynaecological treatments</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:332:\"<ul><li><p>Advanced labour room with continuous monitoring</p></li><li><p>Neonatal resuscitation setup within delivery areas</p></li><li><p>NICU for immediate newborn support</p></li><li><p>Ultrasound and imaging services</p></li><li><p>Advanced laboratory diagnostics</p></li><li><p>Emergency operation theatre access</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:333:\"<ul><li><p>Irregular or painful periods, PCOS, and hormonal imbalances</p></li><li><p>High-risk pregnancies and gestational complications</p></li><li><p>Anaemia during pregnancy</p></li><li><p>Uterine fibroids, ovarian cysts, and pelvic infections</p></li><li><p>Adolescent and menopause-related gynaecological concerns</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:227:\"<ul><li><p>Respectful, woman-centred care</p></li><li><p>Clear communication and shared decision-making</p></li><li><p>Safety-first clinical protocols</p></li><li><p>Emotional support during sensitive life moments</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:183:\"<ul><li><p>Obstetrics and Maternity Care</p></li><li><p>High-Risk Pregnancy Management</p></li><li><p>Preventive Gynaecology</p></li><li><p>Adolescent and Menopause Care</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:56:\"Best Gynaecology  Hospital in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:140:\"Complete women’s healthcare in Bangalore at Nano Hospitals. Specialized care for hormonal health, pregnancy, and all life stages of women.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:08:53\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 10:45:10\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/dec66dd4-c88d-472c-8ace-35341787b1bb.webp\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:3;s:4:\"name\";s:24:\"Gynaecology (Women care)\";s:4:\"slug\";s:21:\"women-care-obstetrics\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/9e11e61f-65dc-4fcc-a31a-b6da65c0a508.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ87T8219AQDKPMNBFTX08S.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:314:\"<p>Women Care at Nano Hospitals is dedicated to supporting women through every stage of life—adolescence, reproductive years, pregnancy, childbirth, and menopause. Women’s health needs are complex and dynamic, influenced by hormonal changes, lifestyle, family planning choices, and age-related transitions.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:516:\"<p>From preventive screenings and menstrual health to safe motherhood and advanced gynaecological care, the department emphasises early diagnosis, informed decision-making, and respectful care. During pregnancy and childbirth, special focus is placed on maternal safety and newborn wellbeing, supported by integrated neonatal services and emergency preparedness.</p><p>Care is delivered in partnership with women and their families—ensuring clarity, dignity, and emotional support alongside medical excellence.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:345:\"<p>Women Care focuses on preventive health, reproductive wellbeing, safe motherhood, and gynaecological care across all life stages. Early diagnosis and continuity of care help women make informed health decisions.</p><p>Nano Hospitals combines clinical expertise with respectful, compassionate care to support women’s long-term wellbeing.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:866:\"<h3><strong>Preventive &amp; Outpatient Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Adolescent gynaecology counselling</p></li><li><p>Menstrual health evaluation and management</p></li><li><p>Family planning and contraception guidance</p></li><li><p>Routine gynaecological check-ups and screenings</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Antenatal &amp; Pregnancy Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Preconception counselling</p></li><li><p>Antenatal check-ups and fetal monitoring</p></li><li><p>Management of pregnancy-related conditions</p></li><li><p>High-risk pregnancy monitoring and care</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Labour, Delivery &amp; Gynaecological Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Normal and assisted vaginal deliveries</p></li><li><p>Emergency obstetric interventions</p></li><li><p>Immediate newborn assessment and care</p></li><li><p>Medical and surgical gynaecological treatments</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:332:\"<ul><li><p>Advanced labour room with continuous monitoring</p></li><li><p>Neonatal resuscitation setup within delivery areas</p></li><li><p>NICU for immediate newborn support</p></li><li><p>Ultrasound and imaging services</p></li><li><p>Advanced laboratory diagnostics</p></li><li><p>Emergency operation theatre access</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:333:\"<ul><li><p>Irregular or painful periods, PCOS, and hormonal imbalances</p></li><li><p>High-risk pregnancies and gestational complications</p></li><li><p>Anaemia during pregnancy</p></li><li><p>Uterine fibroids, ovarian cysts, and pelvic infections</p></li><li><p>Adolescent and menopause-related gynaecological concerns</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:227:\"<ul><li><p>Respectful, woman-centred care</p></li><li><p>Clear communication and shared decision-making</p></li><li><p>Safety-first clinical protocols</p></li><li><p>Emotional support during sensitive life moments</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:183:\"<ul><li><p>Obstetrics and Maternity Care</p></li><li><p>High-Risk Pregnancy Management</p></li><li><p>Preventive Gynaecology</p></li><li><p>Adolescent and Menopause Care</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:56:\"Best Gynaecology  Hospital in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:140:\"Complete women’s healthcare in Bangalore at Nano Hospitals. Specialized care for hormonal health, pregnancy, and all life stages of women.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:08:53\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 10:45:10\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/dec66dd4-c88d-472c-8ace-35341787b1bb.webp\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"