ring dental implants</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:310:\"<ul><li><p>Pain and swelling affecting eating and speech</p></li><li><p>Risk of infection in untreated oral conditions</p></li><li><p>Facial asymmetry from trauma or deformity</p></li><li><p>Difficulty chewing due to jaw misalignment</p></li><li><p>Need for staged reconstruction in complex cases</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:216:\"<ul><li><p>Facial Trauma Surgery</p></li><li><p>Orthognathic (Jaw Correction) Surgery</p></li><li><p>Oral Tumor and Cyst Surgery</p></li><li><p>Dental Implantology</p></li><li><p>TMJ Disorder Management</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:64:\"Best Oral & Maxillofacial Surgeons in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:135:\"Get specialized maxillofacial treatment in Bangalore at Nano Hospitals. Expert care for facial trauma, jaw disorders, and oral surgery.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 18:01:44\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-20 18:22:37\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/eae281cc-d631-4030-8448-5c6c6cd9a2b4.webp\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}i:16;O:21:\"App\\Models\\Speciality\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:12:\"specialities\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:1;s:4:\"name\";s:31:\"Orthopedics (Bone & Joint Care)\";s:4:\"slug\";s:15:\"bone-joint-care\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:52:\"specialities/banners/01KGMKN5FEYX8P8GB8RAD96TMK.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:60:\"specialities/icons/c4b1f738-80ac-49b3-9524-3d66b841373a.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:418:\"<p>Nano Hospitals is one of the trusted orthopedic hospitals in Bangalore, offering specialised care for all conditions affecting the bones, joints, muscles, ligaments, tendons, and spine. The department treats a wide range of musculoskeletal problems — from fractures, knee pain, and arthritis to spine disorders and sports injuries — with a focus on accurate diagnosis, early treatment, and lasting recovery.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:1027:\"<p>Bone and joint problems often start with mild symptoms like knee stiffness, back pain, or reduced flexibility. Without timely treatment, these conditions can worsen and affect your ability to walk, work, and carry out everyday activities. At Nano Hospitals Bangalore, our orthopedic specialists are trained to identify the root cause and provide the right treatment at the right time — whether it is non-surgical management, physiotherapy, or advanced <a href=\"/procedures/knee-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">knee replacement</a> and <a href=\"/procedures/hip-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">hip replacement</a> surgery.</p><p>Our approach is patient-centred and personalised. Every treatment plan is built around the individual&#039;s age, activity level, severity of the condition, and overall health. From first consultation to post-surgery rehabilitation, our team ensures you receive consistent, compassionate, and clinically sound care.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:393:\"<p>Bone and Joint Care focuses on diagnosing and managing musculoskeletal conditions that affect mobility, strength, and daily function. Early symptoms such as joint pain, stiffness, or restricted movement can progress if left untreated.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early diagnosis, personalised treatment planning, and long-term rehabilitation to improve mobility and quality of life.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:1201:\"<h3><strong>Non-Surgical Treatments</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Medical management of joint pain and inflammation</p></li><li><p>Pain relief protocols and mobility support</p></li><li><p>Physiotherapy and rehabilitation programs</p></li><li><p>Posture correction and ergonomic guidance</p></li><li><p>Bone health evaluation and <a href=\"/conditions/osteoporosis\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Osteoporosis</a> management</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Minimally Invasive Procedures</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Arthroscopy for knee, shoulder, and other joints</p></li><li><p>Image-guided joint injections</p></li><li><p>Sports injury repair with minimal tissue damage</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Surgical Treatments</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Fracture fixation and trauma surgery</p></li><li><p><a href=\"/procedures/knee-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Knee replacement</a>, <a href=\"/procedures/hip-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">hip replacement</a>, and shoulder joint replacement surgeries</p></li><li><p>Spine surgeries for nerve compression or instability</p></li><li><p>Corrective surgeries for deformities</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:339:\"<ul><li><p>Digital X-Ray for rapid diagnosis</p></li><li><p>CT Scan and MRI for joint and spine evaluation</p></li><li><p>C-Arm for precision-guided procedures</p></li><li><p>Dedicated Orthopaedic ICU support</p></li><li><p>Post-operative recovery and monitoring units</p></li><li><p>Rehabilitation and physiotherapy services</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:726:\"<ul><li><p><a href=\"/conditions/osteoarthritis\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Osteoarthritis</a> and degenerative joint disease</p></li><li><p>Degenerative disc disease and spondylosis</p></li><li><p>Fractures, dislocations, and trauma injuries</p></li><li><p>Sports injuries and ligament tears</p></li><li><p>Chronic back pain, <a href=\"/conditions/back-and-neck-pain\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">sciatica</a>, and <a href=\"/conditions/back-and-neck-pain\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">slipped disc</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/conditions/osteoporosis\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Osteoporosis</a> and inflammatory joint conditions</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:297:\"<ul><li><p>Progressive degeneration if untreated</p></li><li><p>Reduced mobility and chronic pain</p></li><li><p>Risk of fractures in <a href=\"/conditions/osteoporosis\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Osteoporosis</a></p></li><li><p>Need for long-term rehabilitation</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:443:\"<ul><li><p><a href=\"/procedures/knee-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Knee replacement</a> and <a href=\"/procedures/hip-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">hip replacement</a> surgery</p></li><li><p>Spine Care and Back Pain Management</p></li><li><p>Sports Medicine and Arthroscopy</p></li><li><p>Orthopaedic Trauma Care</p></li><li><p>Geriatric Orthopaedics</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:84:\"Best Bone & Joint Care Hospital in Bangalore | Orthopedic Treatment | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:262:\"Looking for the best orthopedic hospital in Bangalore? Nano Hospitals offers expert bone and joint care for knee pain, joint replacement, fractures, arthritis, spine disorders, and sports injuries — with experienced orthopedic surgeons and advanced facilities.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-01-26 12:18:30\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-07-22 11:24:41\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:65:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/01KGM4QHD24NE3KGT2PWJVTGJS.jpg\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:1;s:4:\"name\";s:31:\"Orthopedics (Bone & Joint Care)\";s:4:\"slug\";s:15:\"bone-joint-care\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:52:\"specialities/banners/01KGMKN5FEYX8P8GB8RAD96TMK.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:60:\"specialities/icons/c4b1f738-80ac-49b3-9524-3d66b841373a.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:418:\"<p>Nano Hospitals is one of the trusted orthopedic hospitals in Bangalore, offering specialised care for all conditions affecting the bones, joints, muscles, ligaments, tendons, and spine. The department treats a wide range of musculoskeletal problems — from fractures, knee pain, and arthritis to spine disorders and sports injuries — with a focus on accurate diagnosis, early treatment, and lasting recovery.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:1027:\"<p>Bone and joint problems often start with mild symptoms like knee stiffness, back pain, or reduced flexibility. Without timely treatment, these conditions can worsen and affect your ability to walk, work, and carry out everyday activities. At Nano Hospitals Bangalore, our orthopedic specialists are trained to identify the root cause and provide the right treatment at the right time — whether it is non-surgical management, physiotherapy, or advanced <a href=\"/procedures/knee-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">knee replacement</a> and <a href=\"/procedures/hip-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">hip replacement</a> surgery.</p><p>Our approach is patient-centred and personalised. Every treatment plan is built around the individual&#039;s age, activity level, severity of the condition, and overall health. From first consultation to post-surgery rehabilitation, our team ensures you receive consistent, compassionate, and clinically sound care.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:393:\"<p>Bone and Joint Care focuses on diagnosing and managing musculoskeletal conditions that affect mobility, strength, and daily function. Early symptoms such as joint pain, stiffness, or restricted movement can progress if left untreated.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early diagnosis, personalised treatment planning, and long-term rehabilitation to improve mobility and quality of life.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:1201:\"<h3><strong>Non-Surgical Treatments</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Medical management of joint pain and inflammation</p></li><li><p>Pain relief protocols and mobility support</p></li><li><p>Physiotherapy and rehabilitation programs</p></li><li><p>Posture correction and ergonomic guidance</p></li><li><p>Bone health evaluation and <a href=\"/conditions/osteoporosis\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Osteoporosis</a> management</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Minimally Invasive Procedures</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Arthroscopy for knee, shoulder, and other joints</p></li><li><p>Image-guided joint injections</p></li><li><p>Sports injury repair with minimal tissue damage</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Surgical Treatments</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Fracture fixation and trauma surgery</p></li><li><p><a href=\"/procedures/knee-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Knee replacement</a>, <a href=\"/procedures/hip-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">hip replacement</a>, and shoulder joint replacement surgeries</p></li><li><p>Spine surgeries for nerve compression or instability</p></li><li><p>Corrective surgeries for deformities</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:339:\"<ul><li><p>Digital X-Ray for rapid diagnosis</p></li><li><p>CT Scan and MRI for joint and spine evaluation</p></li><li><p>C-Arm for precision-guided procedures</p></li><li><p>Dedicated Orthopaedic ICU support</p></li><li><p>Post-operative recovery and monitoring units</p></li><li><p>Rehabilitation and physiotherapy services</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:726:\"<ul><li><p><a href=\"/conditions/osteoarthritis\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Osteoarthritis</a> and degenerative joint disease</p></li><li><p>Degenerative disc disease and spondylosis</p></li><li><p>Fractures, dislocations, and trauma injuries</p></li><li><p>Sports injuries and ligament tears</p></li><li><p>Chronic back pain, <a href=\"/conditions/back-and-neck-pain\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">sciatica</a>, and <a href=\"/conditions/back-and-neck-pain\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">slipped disc</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/conditions/osteoporosis\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Osteoporosis</a> and inflammatory joint conditions</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:297:\"<ul><li><p>Progressive degeneration if untreated</p></li><li><p>Reduced mobility and chronic pain</p></li><li><p>Risk of fractures in <a href=\"/conditions/osteoporosis\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Osteoporosis</a></p></li><li><p>Need for long-term rehabilitation</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:443:\"<ul><li><p><a href=\"/procedures/knee-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Knee replacement</a> and <a href=\"/procedures/hip-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">hip replacement</a> surgery</p></li><li><p>Spine Care and Back Pain Management</p></li><li><p>Sports Medicine and Arthroscopy</p></li><li><p>Orthopaedic Trauma Care</p></li><li><p>Geriatric Orthopaedics</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:84:\"Best Bone & Joint Care Hospital in Bangalore | Orthopedic Treatment | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:262:\"Looking for the best orthopedic hospital in Bangalore? Nano Hospitals offers expert bone and joint care for knee pain, joint replacement, fractures, arthritis, spine disorders, and sports injuries — with experienced orthopedic surgeons and advanced facilities.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-01-26 12:18:30\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-07-22 11:24:41\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:65:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/01KGM4QHD24NE3KGT2PWJVTGJS.jpg\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}i:17;O:21:\"App\\Models\\Speciality\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:12:\"specialities\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:2;s:4:\"name\";s:25:\"Paediatrics  (child-care)\";s:4:\"slug\";s:22:\"child-care-paediatrics\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:65:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/01KGM51DNYKVRMJF5TBN76MB1F.jpg\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ875T3JSGCM1CPJ0KKC78K.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:326:\"<p>Child Care at Nano Hospitals is dedicated to providing comprehensive, compassionate, and age-appropriate medical care for newborns, infants, children, and adolescents. Children are not just small adults—their bodies, immunity, growth patterns, and emotional needs are unique and require specialised medical expertise.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:541:\"<p>From the first moments of life to the critical years of growth and development, the department focuses on early detection, timely treatment, and preventive healthcare. Whether it is a premature newborn, a child with recurrent infections, or an adolescent with developmental concerns, care is delivered with equal emphasis on medical accuracy and emotional comfort.</p><p>The department works closely with parents and caregivers, ensuring they are informed, supported, and actively involved at every stage of the child’s care journey</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:368:\"<p>Child Care services focus on the medical, developmental, and emotional needs of children from birth through adolescence. Early diagnosis and timely intervention play a vital role in ensuring healthy growth and long-term wellbeing.</p><p>Nano Hospitals combines paediatric expertise with a child-friendly approach to deliver safe, effective, and reassuring care.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:926:\"<h3><strong>Neonatal Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Immediate newborn assessment and stabilisation</p></li><li><p>Care for premature and low-birth-weight babies</p></li><li><p>Thermal care, feeding support, and infection prevention</p></li><li><p>Neonatal resuscitation when required</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Paediatric Medical Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Diagnosis and treatment of childhood illnesses</p></li><li><p>Management of infections and respiratory conditions</p></li><li><p>Nutritional assessment and growth monitoring</p></li><li><p>Developmental screening and follow-up</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Paediatric Emergency &amp; Preventive Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Emergency stabilisation of sick children</p></li><li><p>Management of dehydration, breathing difficulty, and infections</p></li><li><p>Immunisation and regular health check-ups</p></li><li><p>Parental guidance on nutrition and development</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:289:\"<ul><li><p>Neonatal Intensive Care Unit (NICU)</p></li><li><p>Neonatal resuscitation setup within delivery areas</p></li><li><p>Advanced laboratory diagnostics</p></li><li><p>Imaging support (X-ray, ultrasound, CT when indicated)</p></li><li><p>24×7 emergency and ICU backup</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:378:\"<ul><li><p>Prematurity and low birth weight</p></li><li><p>Neonatal infections and breathing difficulties</p></li><li><p>Fever, respiratory and gastrointestinal infections</p></li><li><p>Nutritional deficiencies and feeding difficulties</p></li><li><p>Delayed milestones and poor weight gain</p></li><li><p>Paediatric emergencies including seizures and dehydration</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:246:\"<ul><li><p>Early diagnosis and timely intervention</p></li><li><p>Family-centred communication and involvement</p></li><li><p>Gentle handling and emotional reassurance</p></li><li><p>Long-term focus on healthy growth and development</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:151:\"<ul><li><p>Neonatology</p></li><li><p>General Paediatrics</p></li><li><p>Preventive Child Health</p></li><li><p>Developmental Paediatrics</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:72:\"Best Child Care Hospital in Bangalore | Pediatric Care at Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:170:\"Nano Hospitals provides expert child care in Bangalore with experienced pediatricians, advanced facilities, and compassionate care for infants, children, and adolescents.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-01-26 12:30:01\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 10:33:40\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:65:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/01KGM51DNYKVRMJF5TBN76MB1F.jpg\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:2;s:4:\"name\";s:25:\"Paediatrics  (child-care)\";s:4:\"slug\";s:22:\"child-care-paediatrics\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:65:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/01KGM51DNYKVRMJF5TBN76MB1F.jpg\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ875T3JSGCM1CPJ0KKC78K.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:326:\"<p>Child Care at Nano Hospitals is dedicated to providing comprehensive, compassionate, and age-appropriate medical care for newborns, infants, children, and adolescents. Children are not just small adults—their bodies, immunity, growth patterns, and emotional needs are unique and require specialised medical expertise.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:541:\"<p>From the first moments of life to the critical years of growth and development, the department focuses on early detection, timely treatment, and preventive healthcare. Whether it is a premature newborn, a child with recurrent infections, or an adolescent with developmental concerns, care is delivered with equal emphasis on medical accuracy and emotional comfort.</p><p>The department works closely with parents and caregivers, ensuring they are informed, supported, and actively involved at every stage of the child’s care journey</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:368:\"<p>Child Care services focus on the medical, developmental, and emotional needs of children from birth through adolescence. Early diagnosis and timely intervention play a vital role in ensuring healthy growth and long-term wellbeing.</p><p>Nano Hospitals combines paediatric expertise with a child-friendly approach to deliver safe, effective, and reassuring care.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:926:\"<h3><strong>Neonatal Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Immediate newborn assessment and stabilisation</p></li><li><p>Care for premature and low-birth-weight babies</p></li><li><p>Thermal care, feeding support, and infection prevention</p></li><li><p>Neonatal resuscitation when required</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Paediatric Medical Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Diagnosis and treatment of childhood illnesses</p></li><li><p>Management of infections and respiratory conditions</p></li><li><p>Nutritional assessment and growth monitoring</p></li><li><p>Developmental screening and follow-up</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Paediatric Emergency &amp; Preventive Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Emergency stabilisation of sick children</p></li><li><p>Management of dehydration, breathing difficulty, and infections</p></li><li><p>Immunisation and regular health check-ups</p></li><li><p>Parental guidance on nutrition and development</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:289:\"<ul><li><p>Neonatal Intensive Care Unit (NICU)</p></li><li><p>Neonatal resuscitation setup within delivery areas</p></li><li><p>Advanced laboratory diagnostics</p></li><li><p>Imaging support (X-ray, ultrasound, CT when indicated)</p></li><li><p>24×7 emergency and ICU backup</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:378:\"<ul><li><p>Prematurity and low birth weight</p></li><li><p>Neonatal infections and breathing difficulties</p></li><li><p>Fever, respiratory and gastrointestinal infections</p></li><li><p>Nutritional deficiencies and feeding difficulties</p></li><li><p>Delayed milestones and poor weight gain</p></li><li><p>Paediatric emergencies including seizures and dehydration</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:246:\"<ul><li><p>Early diagnosis and timely intervention</p></li><li><p>Family-centred communication and involvement</p></li><li><p>Gentle handling and emotional reassurance</p></li><li><p>Long-term focus on healthy growth and development</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:151:\"<ul><li><p>Neonatology</p></li><li><p>General Paediatrics</p></li><li><p>Preventive Child Health</p></li><li><p>Developmental Paediatrics</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:72:\"Best Child Care Hospital in Bangalore | Pediatric Care at Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:170:\"Nano Hospitals provides expert child care in Bangalore with experienced pediatricians, advanced facilities, and compassionate care for infants, children, and adolescents.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-01-26 12:30:01\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 10:33:40\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:65:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/01KGM51DNYKVRMJF5TBN76MB1F.jpg\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}i:18;O:21:\"App\\Models\\Speciality\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:12:\"specialities\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:22;s:4:\"name\";s:30:\"Physiotherapy & Rehabilitation\";s:4:\"slug\";s:28:\"physiotherapy-rehabilitation\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/43756dac-13b5-424c-8ce1-b001fd1d95e9.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8QX4QDCRW1FTYQ6JMG75F.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:332:\"<p>Physiotherapy &amp; Rehabilitation at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> focuses on restoring movement, strength, function, and independence after injury, surgery, illness, or long-term medical conditions. The department supports recovery for patients of all ages experiencing physical limitations, pain, or mobility challenges.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:703:\"<p>Physical problems may arise from fractures, joint surgeries, stroke, nerve injuries, chronic back pain, sports injuries, or prolonged bed rest. Without structured rehabilitation, stiffness, muscle weakness, and loss of function can persist. At Nano Hospitals, care is aimed not only at pain relief but also at rebuilding physical ability, improving balance, and enabling patients to return to daily activities safely.</p><p>Care is delivered through a patient-centred approach combining physiotherapy, exercise therapy, electrotherapy, occupational rehabilitation, and long-term recovery planning. Each program is personalised based on diagnosis, physical capacity, lifestyle, and recovery goals.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:388:\"<p>Rehabilitation medicine focuses on improving physical function and quality of life after injury or illness. Early physiotherapy intervention often shortens recovery time and prevents long-term disability.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises structured rehabilitation programs, functional training, and continuous progress monitoring to help patients regain independence and confidence.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:886:\"<h3>Non-Invasive Therapies</h3><ul><li><p>Therapeutic exercise programs</p></li><li><p>Manual therapy and joint mobilisation</p></li><li><p>Pain relief through electrotherapy modalities</p></li><li><p>Heat and cold therapy</p></li><li><p>Posture correction and ergonomic training</p></li></ul><h3>Specialized Rehabilitation Programs</h3><ul><li><p>Post-surgical rehabilitation (joint replacement, spine surgery)</p></li><li><p>Stroke and neurological rehabilitation</p></li><li><p>Sports injury rehabilitation</p></li><li><p>Pediatric physiotherapy</p></li><li><p>Geriatric mobility and balance training</p></li></ul><h3>Advanced Supportive Care</h3><ul><li><p>Gait training and mobility aid support</p></li><li><p>Occupational therapy for daily living skills</p></li><li><p>Respiratory physiotherapy for lung conditions</p></li><li><p>Chronic pain rehabilitation programs</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:356:\"<ul><li><p>Exercise therapy and strength training equipment</p></li><li><p>Electrotherapy units (TENS, ultrasound therapy)</p></li><li><p>Balance and gait training systems</p></li><li><p>Parallel bars and mobility training aids</p></li><li><p>Neurological rehabilitation equipment</p></li><li><p>Dedicated physiotherapy and rehabilitation gym</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:391:\"<ul><li><p>Post-fracture stiffness and weakness</p></li><li><p>Post-surgical recovery</p></li><li><p>Chronic back and neck pain</p></li><li><p>Stroke-related weakness and paralysis</p></li><li><p>Sports injuries</p></li><li><p>Arthritis-related mobility problems</p></li><li><p>Neurological disorders affecting movement</p></li><li><p>Balance disorders and fall risk in elderly</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:283:\"<ul><li><p>Delayed recovery without guided rehabilitation</p></li><li><p>Muscle wasting due to inactivity</p></li><li><p>Persistent pain limiting movement</p></li><li><p>Risk of falls in elderly without balance training</p></li><li><p>Reduced independence in daily life</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:256:\"<ul><li><p>Orthopaedic Rehabilitation</p></li><li><p>Neurological Rehabilitation</p></li><li><p>Sports Physiotherapy</p></li><li><p>Pediatric Physiotherapy</p></li><li><p>Geriatric Rehabilitation</p></li><li><p>Cardio-pulmonary Rehabilitation</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";N;s:16:\"meta_description\";N;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 18:10:05\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 13:26:15\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/6dea5a6a-a6a0-4248-a12f-663e20bd865f.webp\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:22;s:4:\"name\";s:30:\"Physiotherapy & Rehabilitation\";s:4:\"slug\";s:28:\"physiotherapy-rehabilitation\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/43756dac-13b5-424c-8ce1-b001fd1d95e9.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8QX4QDCRW1FTYQ6JMG75F.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:332:\"<p>Physiotherapy &amp; Rehabilitation at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> focuses on restoring movement, strength, function, and independence after injury, surgery, illness, or long-term medical conditions. The department supports recovery for patients of all ages experiencing physical limitations, pain, or mobility challenges.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:703:\"<p>Physical problems may arise from fractures, joint surgeries, stroke, nerve injuries, chronic back pain, sports injuries, or prolonged bed rest. Without structured rehabilitation, stiffness, muscle weakness, and loss of function can persist. At Nano Hospitals, care is aimed not only at pain relief but also at rebuilding physical ability, improving balance, and enabling patients to return to daily activities safely.</p><p>Care is delivered through a patient-centred approach combining physiotherapy, exercise therapy, electrotherapy, occupational rehabilitation, and long-term recovery planning. Each program is personalised based on diagnosis, physical capacity, lifestyle, and recovery goals.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:388:\"<p>Rehabilitation medicine focuses on improving physical function and quality of life after injury or illness. Early physiotherapy intervention often shortens recovery time and prevents long-term disability.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises structured rehabilitation programs, functional training, and continuous progress monitoring to help patients regain independence and confidence.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:886:\"<h3>Non-Invasive Therapies</h3><ul><li><p>Therapeutic exercise programs</p></li><li><p>Manual therapy and joint mobilisation</p></li><li><p>Pain relief through electrotherapy modalities</p></li><li><p>Heat and cold therapy</p></li><li><p>Posture correction and ergonomic training</p></li></ul><h3>Specialized Rehabilitation Programs</h3><ul><li><p>Post-surgical rehabilitation (joint replacement, spine surgery)</p></li><li><p>Stroke and neurological rehabilitation</p></li><li><p>Sports injury rehabilitation</p></li><li><p>Pediatric physiotherapy</p></li><li><p>Geriatric mobility and balance training</p></li></ul><h3>Advanced Supportive Care</h3><ul><li><p>Gait training and mobility aid support</p></li><li><p>Occupational therapy for daily living skills</p></li><li><p>Respiratory physiotherapy for lung conditions</p></li><li><p>Chronic pain rehabilitation programs</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:356:\"<ul><li><p>Exercise therapy and strength training equipment</p></li><li><p>Electrotherapy units (TENS, ultrasound therapy)</p></li><li><p>Balance and gait training systems</p></li><li><p>Parallel bars and mobility training aids</p></li><li><p>Neurological rehabilitation equipment</p></li><li><p>Dedicated physiotherapy and rehabilitation gym</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:391:\"<ul><li><p>Post-fracture stiffness and weakness</p></li><li><p>Post-surgical recovery</p></li><li><p>Chronic back and neck pain</p></li><li><p>Stroke-related weakness and paralysis</p></li><li><p>Sports injuries</p></li><li><p>Arthritis-related mobility problems</p></li><li><p>Neurological disorders affecting movement</p></li><li><p>Balance disorders and fall risk in elderly</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:283:\"<ul><li><p>Delayed recovery without guided rehabilitation</p></li><li><p>Muscle wasting due to inactivity</p></li><li><p>Persistent pain limiting movement</p></li><li><p>Risk of falls in elderly without balance training</p></li><li><p>Reduced independence in daily life</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:256:\"<ul><li><p>Orthopaedic Rehabilitation</p></li><li><p>Neurological Rehabilitation</p></li><li><p>Sports Physiotherapy</p></li><li><p>Pediatric Physiotherapy</p></li><li><p>Geriatric Rehabilitation</p></li><li><p>Cardio-pulmonary Rehabilitation</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";N;s:16:\"meta_description\";N;s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 18:10:05\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 13:26:15\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/6dea5a6a-a6a0-4248-a12f-663e20bd865f.webp\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}i:19;O:21:\"App\\Models\\Speciality\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:12:\"specialities\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:18;s:4:\"name\";s:32:\"Plastic & Reconstructive Surgery\";s:4:\"slug\";s:30:\"plastic-reconstructive-surgery\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/5102b3da-190c-461c-bbc9-b051a86ac4b5.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8M7573M9XC6H79NT928AP.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:310:\"<p>Plastic &amp; Reconstructive Surgery at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> focuses on restoring form, function, and appearance affected by injury, congenital conditions, burns, cancer surgery, or trauma. The specialty combines surgical precision with an understanding of aesthetics and functional recovery.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:646:\"<p>Reconstructive needs may arise after accidents, tumor removal, birth defects, or severe infections. These conditions can impact not only physical health but also confidence, speech, movement, and quality of life. At Nano Hospitals, care is aimed at rebuilding damaged tissues, improving function, and supporting emotional well-being alongside physical recovery.</p><p>Treatment follows a patient-centred, multidisciplinary approach involving plastic surgeons, anesthetists, physiotherapists, and rehabilitation specialists. Each surgical plan is tailored based on medical need, functional goals, tissue condition, and patient expectations.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:468:\"<p>Plastic and reconstructive surgery deals with repairing defects of the skin, soft tissues, and underlying structures. It addresses both functional restoration and appearance improvement. Early intervention can significantly improve recovery outcomes, especially in trauma and burn cases.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises detailed surgical planning, advanced microsurgical techniques, and structured post-operative rehabilitation for optimal healing and function.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:915:\"<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Scar management therapies</p></li><li><p>Wound care and advanced dressings</p></li><li><p>Post-surgical rehabilitation and physiotherapy</p></li><li><p>Non-invasive cosmetic skin procedures</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Minor skin lesion and cyst removal</p></li><li><p>Scar revision procedures</p></li><li><p>Injectable treatments for facial symmetry correction</p></li><li><p>Laser therapy for scars and skin texture</p></li></ul><h3>Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Trauma reconstruction (face, limbs, soft tissue)</p></li><li><p>Burn reconstruction and contracture release</p></li><li><p>Cleft lip and palate repair</p></li><li><p>Breast reconstruction after mastectomy</p></li><li><p>Hand and nerve reconstruction</p></li><li><p>Skin grafting and flap surgeries</p></li><li><p>Reconstructive surgery after tumor removal</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:378:\"<ul><li><p>Advanced operation theatres with microsurgical equipment</p></li><li><p>Surgical loupes and operating microscopes</p></li><li><p>Laser systems for scar and skin treatment</p></li><li><p>Burn care and wound management units</p></li><li><p>Post-operative recovery and rehabilitation support</p></li><li><p>Physiotherapy and functional restoration services</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:362:\"<ul><li><p>Facial injuries and deformities</p></li><li><p>Burn injuries and post-burn deformities</p></li><li><p>Congenital anomalies (cleft lip, cleft palate)</p></li><li><p>Hand injuries and nerve damage</p></li><li><p>Post-cancer reconstructive needs</p></li><li><p>Non-healing wounds and tissue loss</p></li><li><p>Severe scars and contractures</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:314:\"<ul><li><p>Complex healing in large tissue injuries</p></li><li><p>Risk of infection in major reconstructive surgeries</p></li><li><p>Need for staged procedures in severe cases</p></li><li><p>Functional limitations if untreated</p></li><li><p>Emotional and psychological impact of visible deformities</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:208:\"<ul><li><p>Trauma Reconstruction</p></li><li><p>Burn and Scar Reconstruction</p></li><li><p>Hand and Microsurgery</p></li><li><p>Craniofacial Surgery</p></li><li><p>Post-Oncologic Reconstruction</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:71:\"Advanced Plastic & Reconstructive Surgery in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:146:\"Comprehensive plastic surgery services at Nano Hospitals, Bangalore. Specialized care for reconstruction, burns, trauma, and aesthetic procedures.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:59:10\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 13:19:50\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/e84a7b64-9e20-43cf-9f88-fa18dac89b36.webp\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:18;s:4:\"name\";s:32:\"Plastic & Reconstructive Surgery\";s:4:\"slug\";s:30:\"plastic-reconstructive-surgery\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/5102b3da-190c-461c-bbc9-b051a86ac4b5.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8M7573M9XC6H79NT928AP.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:310:\"<p>Plastic &amp; Reconstructive Surgery at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> focuses on restoring form, function, and appearance affected by injury, congenital conditions, burns, cancer surgery, or trauma. The specialty combines surgical precision with an understanding of aesthetics and functional recovery.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:646:\"<p>Reconstructive needs may arise after accidents, tumor removal, birth defects, or severe infections. These conditions can impact not only physical health but also confidence, speech, movement, and quality of life. At Nano Hospitals, care is aimed at rebuilding damaged tissues, improving function, and supporting emotional well-being alongside physical recovery.</p><p>Treatment follows a patient-centred, multidisciplinary approach involving plastic surgeons, anesthetists, physiotherapists, and rehabilitation specialists. Each surgical plan is tailored based on medical need, functional goals, tissue condition, and patient expectations.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:468:\"<p>Plastic and reconstructive surgery deals with repairing defects of the skin, soft tissues, and underlying structures. It addresses both functional restoration and appearance improvement. Early intervention can significantly improve recovery outcomes, especially in trauma and burn cases.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises detailed surgical planning, advanced microsurgical techniques, and structured post-operative rehabilitation for optimal healing and function.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:915:\"<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Scar management therapies</p></li><li><p>Wound care and advanced dressings</p></li><li><p>Post-surgical rehabilitation and physiotherapy</p></li><li><p>Non-invasive cosmetic skin procedures</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Minor skin lesion and cyst removal</p></li><li><p>Scar revision procedures</p></li><li><p>Injectable treatments for facial symmetry correction</p></li><li><p>Laser therapy for scars and skin texture</p></li></ul><h3>Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Trauma reconstruction (face, limbs, soft tissue)</p></li><li><p>Burn reconstruction and contracture release</p></li><li><p>Cleft lip and palate repair</p></li><li><p>Breast reconstruction after mastectomy</p></li><li><p>Hand and nerve reconstruction</p></li><li><p>Skin grafting and flap surgeries</p></li><li><p>Reconstructive surgery after tumor removal</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:378:\"<ul><li><p>Advanced operation theatres with microsurgical equipment</p></li><li><p>Surgical loupes and operating microscopes</p></li><li><p>Laser systems for scar and skin treatment</p></li><li><p>Burn care and wound management units</p></li><li><p>Post-operative recovery and rehabilitation support</p></li><li><p>Physiotherapy and functional restoration services</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:362:\"<ul><li><p>Facial injuries and deformities</p></li><li><p>Burn injuries and post-burn deformities</p></li><li><p>Congenital anomalies (cleft lip, cleft palate)</p></li><li><p>Hand injuries and nerve damage</p></li><li><p>Post-cancer reconstructive needs</p></li><li><p>Non-healing wounds and tissue loss</p></li><li><p>Severe scars and contractures</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:314:\"<ul><li><p>Complex healing in large tissue injuries</p></li><li><p>Risk of infection in major reconstructive surgeries</p></li><li><p>Need for staged procedures in severe cases</p></li><li><p>Functional limitations if untreated</p></li><li><p>Emotional and psychological impact of visible deformities</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:208:\"<ul><li><p>Trauma Reconstruction</p></li><li><p>Burn and Scar Reconstruction</p></li><li><p>Hand and Microsurgery</p></li><li><p>Craniofacial Surgery</p></li><li><p>Post-Oncologic Reconstruction</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:71:\"Advanced Plastic & Reconstructive Surgery in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:146:\"Comprehensive plastic surgery services at Nano Hospitals, Bangalore. Specialized care for reconstruction, burns, trauma, and aesthetic procedures.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:59:10\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 13:19:50\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/e84a7b64-9e20-43cf-9f88-fa18dac89b36.webp\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}i:20;O:21:\"App\\Models\\Speciality\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:12:\"specialities\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:16;s:4:\"name\";s:10:\"Psychiatry\";s:4:\"slug\";s:10:\"psychiatry\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/681b1fd5-4b29-44d4-b38d-5e4678c0cc16.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8JN4V85FV52HK507DG7C1.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:303:\"<p>Psychiatry at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> focuses on the diagnosis, treatment, and long-term support of emotional, psychological, and behavioral health conditions. The department addresses challenges that affect mood, thinking, stress management, relationships, and overall mental well-being.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:786:\"<p>Psychiatry concerns may begin with subtle signs such as persistent stress, sleep disturbances, mood swings, difficulty concentrating, social withdrawal, or loss of interest in daily activities. If not addressed early, these issues can interfere with work performance, relationships, physical health, and quality of life. At Nano Hospitals, care is aimed not only at symptom relief but also at helping individuals regain emotional balance, resilience, and confidence.</p><p>Care is delivered through a compassionate, patient-centred approach that combines psychiatric evaluation, psychological therapies, medication when needed, and lifestyle-based mental wellness strategies. Each care plan is personalised based on age, life circumstances, medical history, and individual goals.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:451:\"<p>Psychiatry involves understanding how thoughts, emotions, and behaviors influence overall well-being. Early signs such as prolonged sadness, excessive worry, panic attacks, changes in appetite, or difficulty coping with daily stress should not be ignored.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early identification, confidential consultations, structured therapy programs, and long-term follow-up to support emotional stability and mental resilience.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:873:\"<h3>Non-Medication Therapies</h3><ul><li><p>Individual psychotherapy (talk therapy)</p></li><li><p>Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT)</p></li><li><p>Stress management and relaxation therapy</p></li><li><p>Family and relationship counseling</p></li><li><p>Behavioral therapy for children and adolescents</p></li></ul><h3>Medication-Based Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Antidepressant and anti-anxiety medications</p></li><li><p>Mood stabilisers for bipolar disorder</p></li><li><p>Medication management for psychotic disorders</p></li><li><p>Sleep disorder treatment</p></li></ul><h3>Supportive and Advanced Care</h3><ul><li><p>De-addiction and substance use rehabilitation programs</p></li><li><p>Crisis intervention and emergency mental health care</p></li><li><p>Mindfulness and coping skill training</p></li><li><p>Occupational and social rehabilitation support</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:339:\"<ul><li><p>Private and confidential consultation rooms</p></li><li><p>Psychological testing and assessment tools</p></li><li><p>Therapy and counseling suites</p></li><li><p>Day-care mental health programs</p></li><li><p>Inpatient mental health support (when required)</p></li><li><p>Rehabilitation and follow-up care services</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:430:\"<ul><li><p>Depression and mood disorders</p></li><li><p>Anxiety disorders and panic attacks</p></li><li><p>Stress-related disorders</p></li><li><p>Obsessive-Compulsive Disorder (OCD)</p></li><li><p>Bipolar disorder</p></li><li><p>Schizophrenia and psychotic disorders</p></li><li><p>Sleep disorders</p></li><li><p>Substance use and addiction</p></li><li><p>Emotional and behavioral issues in children and adolescents</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:298:\"<ul><li><p>Impact on work, studies, and relationships</p></li><li><p>Physical health problems linked to chronic stress</p></li><li><p>Social withdrawal and isolation</p></li><li><p>Risk of self-harm if severe symptoms are untreated</p></li><li><p>Stigma preventing timely help-seeking</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:206:\"<ul><li><p>Adult Psychiatry</p></li><li><p>Child and Adolescent Psychiatry</p></li><li><p>Clinical Psychology</p></li><li><p>De-addiction Psychiatry</p></li><li><p>Geriatric Mental Health Care</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:71:\"Best Mental Health Hospital in Bangalore | Psychiatry at Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:143:\"Get comprehensive psychiatry support in Bangalore at Nano Hospitals. Expert care for anxiety, depression, and overall psychological well-being.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:54:19\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-05-12 15:33:10\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/60a96ce2-5665-4524-9924-43b042a8ca6c.webp\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:16;s:4:\"name\";s:10:\"Psychiatry\";s:4:\"slug\";s:10:\"psychiatry\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/681b1fd5-4b29-44d4-b38d-5e4678c0cc16.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8JN4V85FV52HK507DG7C1.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:303:\"<p>Psychiatry at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> focuses on the diagnosis, treatment, and long-term support of emotional, psychological, and behavioral health conditions. The department addresses challenges that affect mood, thinking, stress management, relationships, and overall mental well-being.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:786:\"<p>Psychiatry concerns may begin with subtle signs such as persistent stress, sleep disturbances, mood swings, difficulty concentrating, social withdrawal, or loss of interest in daily activities. If not addressed early, these issues can interfere with work performance, relationships, physical health, and quality of life. At Nano Hospitals, care is aimed not only at symptom relief but also at helping individuals regain emotional balance, resilience, and confidence.</p><p>Care is delivered through a compassionate, patient-centred approach that combines psychiatric evaluation, psychological therapies, medication when needed, and lifestyle-based mental wellness strategies. Each care plan is personalised based on age, life circumstances, medical history, and individual goals.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:451:\"<p>Psychiatry involves understanding how thoughts, emotions, and behaviors influence overall well-being. Early signs such as prolonged sadness, excessive worry, panic attacks, changes in appetite, or difficulty coping with daily stress should not be ignored.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early identification, confidential consultations, structured therapy programs, and long-term follow-up to support emotional stability and mental resilience.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:873:\"<h3>Non-Medication Therapies</h3><ul><li><p>Individual psychotherapy (talk therapy)</p></li><li><p>Cognitive Behavioral Therapy (CBT)</p></li><li><p>Stress management and relaxation therapy</p></li><li><p>Family and relationship counseling</p></li><li><p>Behavioral therapy for children and adolescents</p></li></ul><h3>Medication-Based Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Antidepressant and anti-anxiety medications</p></li><li><p>Mood stabilisers for bipolar disorder</p></li><li><p>Medication management for psychotic disorders</p></li><li><p>Sleep disorder treatment</p></li></ul><h3>Supportive and Advanced Care</h3><ul><li><p>De-addiction and substance use rehabilitation programs</p></li><li><p>Crisis intervention and emergency mental health care</p></li><li><p>Mindfulness and coping skill training</p></li><li><p>Occupational and social rehabilitation support</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:339:\"<ul><li><p>Private and confidential consultation rooms</p></li><li><p>Psychological testing and assessment tools</p></li><li><p>Therapy and counseling suites</p></li><li><p>Day-care mental health programs</p></li><li><p>Inpatient mental health support (when required)</p></li><li><p>Rehabilitation and follow-up care services</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:430:\"<ul><li><p>Depression and mood disorders</p></li><li><p>Anxiety disorders and panic attacks</p></li><li><p>Stress-related disorders</p></li><li><p>Obsessive-Compulsive Disorder (OCD)</p></li><li><p>Bipolar disorder</p></li><li><p>Schizophrenia and psychotic disorders</p></li><li><p>Sleep disorders</p></li><li><p>Substance use and addiction</p></li><li><p>Emotional and behavioral issues in children and adolescents</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:298:\"<ul><li><p>Impact on work, studies, and relationships</p></li><li><p>Physical health problems linked to chronic stress</p></li><li><p>Social withdrawal and isolation</p></li><li><p>Risk of self-harm if severe symptoms are untreated</p></li><li><p>Stigma preventing timely help-seeking</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:206:\"<ul><li><p>Adult Psychiatry</p></li><li><p>Child and Adolescent Psychiatry</p></li><li><p>Clinical Psychology</p></li><li><p>De-addiction Psychiatry</p></li><li><p>Geriatric Mental Health Care</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:71:\"Best Mental Health Hospital in Bangalore | Psychiatry at Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:143:\"Get comprehensive psychiatry support in Bangalore at Nano Hospitals. Expert care for anxiety, depression, and overall psychological well-being.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:54:19\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-05-12 15:33:10\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/60a96ce2-5665-4524-9924-43b042a8ca6c.webp\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}i:21;O:21:\"App\\Models\\Speciality\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:12:\"specialities\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:7;s:4:\"name\";s:23:\"Pulmonology (Lung Care)\";s:4:\"slug\";s:9:\"lung-care\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/2eb47bd3-8740-4bf3-afb9-441228a04ded.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ89VSJPF5RRSXWXGPP1CB1.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:240:\"<p>Lung Care at Nano Hospitals focuses on the diagnosis, treatment, and long-term management of respiratory and lung-related conditions. Breathing problems may range from mild, recurrent symptoms to sudden, life-threatening emergencies.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:419:\"<p>Conditions such as asthma, chronic bronchitis, respiratory infections, or lung complications related to other medical illnesses can significantly affect daily life if not addressed early.</p><p>The department emphasises early intervention, accurate diagnosis, patient education, and continuity of care, supported by emergency and critical care services to prevent disease progression and reduce hospitalisations.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:318:\"<p>Lung Care focuses on early identification and structured management of respiratory conditions to improve breathing comfort and prevent complications.</p><p>At Nano Hospitals, pulmonology services are closely integrated with emergency and ICU teams to ensure timely escalation and continuous respiratory support.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:941:\"<h3><strong>Diagnostic &amp; Evaluation Services</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Detailed respiratory history and clinical examination</p></li><li><p>Assessment of breathlessness, cough, and chest symptoms</p></li><li><p>Chest imaging coordination (X-ray, CT scan when required)</p></li><li><p>Laboratory investigations for infections and inflammation</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Medical Respiratory Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Management of asthma and COPD</p></li><li><p>Treatment of respiratory infections</p></li><li><p>Oxygen therapy for breathing difficulty</p></li><li><p>Medical management of airway and lung inflammation</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Emergency &amp; Long-Term Lung Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Stabilisation of acute respiratory distress</p></li><li><p>Ventilatory and oxygen support when required</p></li><li><p>Respiratory monitoring in ICU and wards</p></li><li><p>Chronic disease monitoring and patient education</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:397:\"<ul><li><p>Digital X-Ray for rapid chest evaluation</p></li><li><p>CT Scan support for detailed lung imaging</p></li><li><p>Advanced laboratory medicine for respiratory diagnostics</p></li><li><p>ICU and emergency services for respiratory monitoring</p></li><li><p>Oxygen therapy and ventilatory support systems</p></li><li><p>24×7 pharmacy for uninterrupted respiratory medications</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:296:\"<ul><li><p>Asthma, COPD, and chronic bronchitis</p></li><li><p>Pneumonia, tuberculosis, and viral respiratory infections</p></li><li><p>Acute breathlessness and respiratory failure</p></li><li><p>Severe chest infections</p></li><li><p>Persistent cough, wheezing, and chest tightness</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:304:\"<ul><li><p>Early identification of respiratory symptoms</p></li><li><p>Accurate diagnosis of underlying causes</p></li><li><p>Preventive strategies to reduce flare-ups</p></li><li><p>Patient education for long-term control</p></li><li><p>Seamless integration with emergency and ICU services</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:184:\"<ul><li><p>Asthma and allergy care</p></li><li><p>Chronic lung disease management</p></li><li><p>Respiratory infection management</p></li><li><p>Critical respiratory care</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:69:\"Best Lung Care Hospital in Bangalore | Advanced Respiratory Treatment\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:159:\"Nano Hospitals offers advanced lung care services in Bangalore for asthma, breathing disorders, and critical respiratory conditions with expert pulmonologists.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:19:03\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 12:49:52\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/b7bc5299-eb9a-4ef8-ba7c-5990e97a552f.webp\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:7;s:4:\"name\";s:23:\"Pulmonology (Lung Care)\";s:4:\"slug\";s:9:\"lung-care\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/2eb47bd3-8740-4bf3-afb9-441228a04ded.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ89VSJPF5RRSXWXGPP1CB1.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:240:\"<p>Lung Care at Nano Hospitals focuses on the diagnosis, treatment, and long-term management of respiratory and lung-related conditions. Breathing problems may range from mild, recurrent symptoms to sudden, life-threatening emergencies.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:419:\"<p>Conditions such as asthma, chronic bronchitis, respiratory infections, or lung complications related to other medical illnesses can significantly affect daily life if not addressed early.</p><p>The department emphasises early intervention, accurate diagnosis, patient education, and continuity of care, supported by emergency and critical care services to prevent disease progression and reduce hospitalisations.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:318:\"<p>Lung Care focuses on early identification and structured management of respiratory conditions to improve breathing comfort and prevent complications.</p><p>At Nano Hospitals, pulmonology services are closely integrated with emergency and ICU teams to ensure timely escalation and continuous respiratory support.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:941:\"<h3><strong>Diagnostic &amp; Evaluation Services</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Detailed respiratory history and clinical examination</p></li><li><p>Assessment of breathlessness, cough, and chest symptoms</p></li><li><p>Chest imaging coordination (X-ray, CT scan when required)</p></li><li><p>Laboratory investigations for infections and inflammation</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Medical Respiratory Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Management of asthma and COPD</p></li><li><p>Treatment of respiratory infections</p></li><li><p>Oxygen therapy for breathing difficulty</p></li><li><p>Medical management of airway and lung inflammation</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Emergency &amp; Long-Term Lung Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Stabilisation of acute respiratory distress</p></li><li><p>Ventilatory and oxygen support when required</p></li><li><p>Respiratory monitoring in ICU and wards</p></li><li><p>Chronic disease monitoring and patient education</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:397:\"<ul><li><p>Digital X-Ray for rapid chest evaluation</p></li><li><p>CT Scan support for detailed lung imaging</p></li><li><p>Advanced laboratory medicine for respiratory diagnostics</p></li><li><p>ICU and emergency services for respiratory monitoring</p></li><li><p>Oxygen therapy and ventilatory support systems</p></li><li><p>24×7 pharmacy for uninterrupted respiratory medications</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:296:\"<ul><li><p>Asthma, COPD, and chronic bronchitis</p></li><li><p>Pneumonia, tuberculosis, and viral respiratory infections</p></li><li><p>Acute breathlessness and respiratory failure</p></li><li><p>Severe chest infections</p></li><li><p>Persistent cough, wheezing, and chest tightness</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:304:\"<ul><li><p>Early identification of respiratory symptoms</p></li><li><p>Accurate diagnosis of underlying causes</p></li><li><p>Preventive strategies to reduce flare-ups</p></li><li><p>Patient education for long-term control</p></li><li><p>Seamless integration with emergency and ICU services</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:184:\"<ul><li><p>Asthma and allergy care</p></li><li><p>Chronic lung disease management</p></li><li><p>Respiratory infection management</p></li><li><p>Critical respiratory care</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:69:\"Best Lung Care Hospital in Bangalore | Advanced Respiratory Treatment\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:159:\"Nano Hospitals offers advanced lung care services in Bangalore for asthma, breathing disorders, and critical respiratory conditions with expert pulmonologists.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:19:03\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 12:49:52\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/b7bc5299-eb9a-4ef8-ba7c-5990e97a552f.webp\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}i:22;O:21:\"App\\Models\\Speciality\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:12:\"specialities\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:24;s:4:\"name\";s:19:\"Radiology & Imaging\";s:4:\"slug\";s:17:\"radiology-imaging\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/3a8a2a3b-3aba-40bd-863e-2ba1d54e4d07.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8TZX2TB0DJZCJR59HVY23.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:345:\"<p>Radiology &amp; Imaging at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> provides advanced diagnostic and interventional imaging services that help detect, monitor, and guide treatment for a wide range of medical conditions. Imaging plays a critical role in early diagnosis, treatment planning, and follow-up care across nearly all medical specialties.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:578:\"<p>Many diseases may not show clear external symptoms in early stages. Imaging tests allow doctors to see inside the body safely and accurately, helping identify infections, fractures, tumors, organ disorders, and vascular conditions. At Nano Hospitals, radiology services focus on delivering precise imaging with minimal discomfort and radiation exposure.</p><p>Care is delivered by experienced radiologists and technologists using modern imaging technology and evidence-based protocols. Each imaging study is tailored to the patient’s symptoms, age, and medical history.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:349:\"<p>Radiology uses medical imaging techniques to diagnose and sometimes treat diseases. Imaging can detect problems early, often before symptoms become severe, allowing timely medical intervention.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises accurate image interpretation, fast reporting, and integration with clinical teams for effective patient management.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:775:\"<h3>Basic Imaging</h3><ul><li><p>Digital X-rays for bones, chest, and joints</p></li><li><p>Ultrasound for abdomen, pelvis, thyroid, and pregnancy scans</p></li><li><p>Doppler studies for blood flow evaluation</p></li></ul><h3>Advanced Imaging</h3><ul><li><p>CT Scan for detailed cross-sectional images of organs and bones</p></li><li><p>MRI for brain, spine, joints, and soft tissue evaluation</p></li><li><p>Mammography for breast screening</p></li><li><p>Bone density scan (DEXA) for osteoporosis assessment</p></li></ul><h3>Interventional Radiology</h3><ul><li><p>Image-guided biopsies</p></li><li><p>Drainage of fluid collections or abscesses</p></li><li><p>Vascular procedures such as angiography</p></li><li><p>Catheter-based minimally invasive treatment</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:377:\"<ul><li><p>High-resolution Digital X-ray systems</p></li><li><p>Multi-slice CT scanner</p></li><li><p>Advanced MRI scanner</p></li><li><p>3D/4D Ultrasound machines</p></li><li><p>Mammography units with low radiation dose</p></li><li><p>Picture Archiving and Communication System (PACS) for digital reporting</p></li><li><p>Dedicated interventional radiology suite</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:391:\"<ul><li><p>Bone fractures and joint disorders</p></li><li><p>Brain and spine conditions</p></li><li><p>Lung infections and chest diseases</p></li><li><p>Abdominal organ disorders</p></li><li><p>Tumors and abnormal growths</p></li><li><p>Kidney stones and urinary tract issues</p></li><li><p>Vascular blockages and clots</p></li><li><p>Pregnancy and fetal development monitoring</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:328:\"<ul><li><p>Minimising radiation exposure through safety protocols</p></li><li><p>Ensuring patient comfort during longer scans (e.g., MRI)</p></li><li><p>Need for contrast agents in some imaging studies</p></li><li><p>Claustrophobia concerns during MRI scans</p></li><li><p>Special precautions for pregnant patients</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:222:\"<ul><li><p>Diagnostic Radiology</p></li><li><p>Interventional Radiology</p></li><li><p>Neuroradiology</p></li><li><p>Musculoskeletal Imaging</p></li><li><p>Women’s Imaging</p></li><li><p>Pediatric Radiology</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:63:\"Advanced Radiology & Imaging Care in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:140:\"Expert radiology services at Nano Hospitals, Bangalore. Advanced imaging for diagnosis, monitoring, and guided treatment across specialties.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 18:15:59\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 13:20:40\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/c123a29f-f3b2-48d3-a6b6-65ae974e4725.webp\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:24;s:4:\"name\";s:19:\"Radiology & Imaging\";s:4:\"slug\";s:17:\"radiology-imaging\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/3a8a2a3b-3aba-40bd-863e-2ba1d54e4d07.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8TZX2TB0DJZCJR59HVY23.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:345:\"<p>Radiology &amp; Imaging at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> provides advanced diagnostic and interventional imaging services that help detect, monitor, and guide treatment for a wide range of medical conditions. Imaging plays a critical role in early diagnosis, treatment planning, and follow-up care across nearly all medical specialties.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:578:\"<p>Many diseases may not show clear external symptoms in early stages. Imaging tests allow doctors to see inside the body safely and accurately, helping identify infections, fractures, tumors, organ disorders, and vascular conditions. At Nano Hospitals, radiology services focus on delivering precise imaging with minimal discomfort and radiation exposure.</p><p>Care is delivered by experienced radiologists and technologists using modern imaging technology and evidence-based protocols. Each imaging study is tailored to the patient’s symptoms, age, and medical history.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:349:\"<p>Radiology uses medical imaging techniques to diagnose and sometimes treat diseases. Imaging can detect problems early, often before symptoms become severe, allowing timely medical intervention.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises accurate image interpretation, fast reporting, and integration with clinical teams for effective patient management.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:775:\"<h3>Basic Imaging</h3><ul><li><p>Digital X-rays for bones, chest, and joints</p></li><li><p>Ultrasound for abdomen, pelvis, thyroid, and pregnancy scans</p></li><li><p>Doppler studies for blood flow evaluation</p></li></ul><h3>Advanced Imaging</h3><ul><li><p>CT Scan for detailed cross-sectional images of organs and bones</p></li><li><p>MRI for brain, spine, joints, and soft tissue evaluation</p></li><li><p>Mammography for breast screening</p></li><li><p>Bone density scan (DEXA) for osteoporosis assessment</p></li></ul><h3>Interventional Radiology</h3><ul><li><p>Image-guided biopsies</p></li><li><p>Drainage of fluid collections or abscesses</p></li><li><p>Vascular procedures such as angiography</p></li><li><p>Catheter-based minimally invasive treatment</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:377:\"<ul><li><p>High-resolution Digital X-ray systems</p></li><li><p>Multi-slice CT scanner</p></li><li><p>Advanced MRI scanner</p></li><li><p>3D/4D Ultrasound machines</p></li><li><p>Mammography units with low radiation dose</p></li><li><p>Picture Archiving and Communication System (PACS) for digital reporting</p></li><li><p>Dedicated interventional radiology suite</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:391:\"<ul><li><p>Bone fractures and joint disorders</p></li><li><p>Brain and spine conditions</p></li><li><p>Lung infections and chest diseases</p></li><li><p>Abdominal organ disorders</p></li><li><p>Tumors and abnormal growths</p></li><li><p>Kidney stones and urinary tract issues</p></li><li><p>Vascular blockages and clots</p></li><li><p>Pregnancy and fetal development monitoring</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:328:\"<ul><li><p>Minimising radiation exposure through safety protocols</p></li><li><p>Ensuring patient comfort during longer scans (e.g., MRI)</p></li><li><p>Need for contrast agents in some imaging studies</p></li><li><p>Claustrophobia concerns during MRI scans</p></li><li><p>Special precautions for pregnant patients</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:222:\"<ul><li><p>Diagnostic Radiology</p></li><li><p>Interventional Radiology</p></li><li><p>Neuroradiology</p></li><li><p>Musculoskeletal Imaging</p></li><li><p>Women’s Imaging</p></li><li><p>Pediatric Radiology</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:63:\"Advanced Radiology & Imaging Care in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:140:\"Expert radiology services at Nano Hospitals, Bangalore. Advanced imaging for diagnosis, monitoring, and guided treatment across specialties.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 18:15:59\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 13:20:40\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/c123a29f-f3b2-48d3-a6b6-65ae974e4725.webp\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}i:23;O:21:\"App\\Models\\Speciality\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:12:\"specialities\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:17;s:4:\"name\";s:12:\"Rheumatology\";s:4:\"slug\";s:12:\"rheumatology\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/5caa94a9-dc01-41b9-9150-232f38ff5266.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8YH5EY1KCNNYK5PF1XCQF.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:226:\"<p>Rheumatology at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> focuses on the diagnosis, treatment, and long-term management of autoimmune and inflammatory diseases that primarily affect joints, muscles, bones, and connective tissues.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:757:\"<p>Rheumatologic conditions often begin gradually with symptoms such as joint pain, morning stiffness, swelling, fatigue, or muscle weakness. These disorders can be chronic and progressive, sometimes affecting internal organs like the lungs, heart, kidneys, or skin. At Nano Hospitals, care is aimed not only at controlling pain and inflammation but also at preventing joint damage, preserving mobility, and maintaining quality of life.</p><p>Care is delivered through a patient-centred, multidisciplinary approach combining clinical evaluation, laboratory testing, imaging, immunological assessment, medication therapy, and rehabilitation support. Each treatment plan is personalised based on disease type, severity, age, lifestyle, and overall health.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:456:\"<p>Rheumatology deals with autoimmune, inflammatory, and degenerative conditions of the musculoskeletal system and connective tissues. Early signs such as persistent joint stiffness (especially in the morning), symmetrical joint pain, or unexplained fatigue should be evaluated promptly.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early diagnosis, disease-modifying treatment, and long-term monitoring to prevent irreversible joint damage and organ complications.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:940:\"<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Disease-modifying anti-rheumatic drugs (DMARDs)</p></li><li><p>Biologic and targeted therapies for autoimmune diseases</p></li><li><p>Anti-inflammatory and pain management medications</p></li><li><p>Physiotherapy and joint mobility exercises</p></li><li><p>Lifestyle and dietary guidance for inflammation control</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Joint aspiration (removal of excess joint fluid)</p></li><li><p>Steroid injections for inflamed joints</p></li><li><p>Ultrasound-guided joint procedures</p></li><li><p>Minor procedures for soft tissue inflammation</p></li></ul><h3>Supportive and Advanced Care</h3><ul><li><p>Management of systemic autoimmune disorders</p></li><li><p>Bone protection therapy in inflammatory arthritis</p></li><li><p>Occupational therapy for joint function support</p></li><li><p>Rehabilitation programs for long-term mobility</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:366:\"<ul><li><p>Advanced autoimmune and inflammatory blood testing</p></li><li><p>Musculoskeletal ultrasound</p></li><li><p>Digital X-ray, CT Scan, and MRI for joint evaluation</p></li><li><p>Bone density scan (DEXA) for osteoporosis risk</p></li><li><p>Infusion therapy units for biologic treatments</p></li><li><p>Physiotherapy and rehabilitation services</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:336:\"<ul><li><p>Rheumatoid arthritis</p></li><li><p>Osteoarthritis</p></li><li><p>Ankylosing spondylitis</p></li><li><p>Psoriatic arthritis</p></li><li><p>Systemic lupus erythematosus (SLE)</p></li><li><p>Gout and crystal arthritis</p></li><li><p>Vasculitis</p></li><li><p>Fibromyalgia</p></li><li><p>Connective tissue diseases</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:339:\"<ul><li><p>Progressive joint damage without early treatment</p></li><li><p>Disability due to chronic pain and stiffness</p></li><li><p>Organ involvement in systemic autoimmune diseases</p></li><li><p>Need for lifelong monitoring and medication adjustment</p></li><li><p>Risk of osteoporosis in chronic inflammatory conditions</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:243:\"<ul><li><p>Inflammatory Arthritis Management</p></li><li><p>Autoimmune Connective Tissue Disorders</p></li><li><p>Pediatric Rheumatology</p></li><li><p>Osteoporosis and Bone Health</p></li><li><p>Vasculitis and Systemic Disorders</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:65:\"Best Rheumatology Hospital in Bangalore | Joint & Autoimmune Care\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:145:\"Get specialized rheumatology treatment in Bangalore at Nano Hospitals. Expert care for joint pain, autoimmune diseases, and chronic inflammation.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:56:48\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 13:28:31\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/06b63db8-2a15-41d5-a9c5-30a6e75d5fef.webp\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:17;s:4:\"name\";s:12:\"Rheumatology\";s:4:\"slug\";s:12:\"rheumatology\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/5caa94a9-dc01-41b9-9150-232f38ff5266.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8YH5EY1KCNNYK5PF1XCQF.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:226:\"<p>Rheumatology at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> focuses on the diagnosis, treatment, and long-term management of autoimmune and inflammatory diseases that primarily affect joints, muscles, bones, and connective tissues.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:757:\"<p>Rheumatologic conditions often begin gradually with symptoms such as joint pain, morning stiffness, swelling, fatigue, or muscle weakness. These disorders can be chronic and progressive, sometimes affecting internal organs like the lungs, heart, kidneys, or skin. At Nano Hospitals, care is aimed not only at controlling pain and inflammation but also at preventing joint damage, preserving mobility, and maintaining quality of life.</p><p>Care is delivered through a patient-centred, multidisciplinary approach combining clinical evaluation, laboratory testing, imaging, immunological assessment, medication therapy, and rehabilitation support. Each treatment plan is personalised based on disease type, severity, age, lifestyle, and overall health.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:456:\"<p>Rheumatology deals with autoimmune, inflammatory, and degenerative conditions of the musculoskeletal system and connective tissues. Early signs such as persistent joint stiffness (especially in the morning), symmetrical joint pain, or unexplained fatigue should be evaluated promptly.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early diagnosis, disease-modifying treatment, and long-term monitoring to prevent irreversible joint damage and organ complications.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:940:\"<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Disease-modifying anti-rheumatic drugs (DMARDs)</p></li><li><p>Biologic and targeted therapies for autoimmune diseases</p></li><li><p>Anti-inflammatory and pain management medications</p></li><li><p>Physiotherapy and joint mobility exercises</p></li><li><p>Lifestyle and dietary guidance for inflammation control</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Joint aspiration (removal of excess joint fluid)</p></li><li><p>Steroid injections for inflamed joints</p></li><li><p>Ultrasound-guided joint procedures</p></li><li><p>Minor procedures for soft tissue inflammation</p></li></ul><h3>Supportive and Advanced Care</h3><ul><li><p>Management of systemic autoimmune disorders</p></li><li><p>Bone protection therapy in inflammatory arthritis</p></li><li><p>Occupational therapy for joint function support</p></li><li><p>Rehabilitation programs for long-term mobility</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:366:\"<ul><li><p>Advanced autoimmune and inflammatory blood testing</p></li><li><p>Musculoskeletal ultrasound</p></li><li><p>Digital X-ray, CT Scan, and MRI for joint evaluation</p></li><li><p>Bone density scan (DEXA) for osteoporosis risk</p></li><li><p>Infusion therapy units for biologic treatments</p></li><li><p>Physiotherapy and rehabilitation services</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:336:\"<ul><li><p>Rheumatoid arthritis</p></li><li><p>Osteoarthritis</p></li><li><p>Ankylosing spondylitis</p></li><li><p>Psoriatic arthritis</p></li><li><p>Systemic lupus erythematosus (SLE)</p></li><li><p>Gout and crystal arthritis</p></li><li><p>Vasculitis</p></li><li><p>Fibromyalgia</p></li><li><p>Connective tissue diseases</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:339:\"<ul><li><p>Progressive joint damage without early treatment</p></li><li><p>Disability due to chronic pain and stiffness</p></li><li><p>Organ involvement in systemic autoimmune diseases</p></li><li><p>Need for lifelong monitoring and medication adjustment</p></li><li><p>Risk of osteoporosis in chronic inflammatory conditions</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:243:\"<ul><li><p>Inflammatory Arthritis Management</p></li><li><p>Autoimmune Connective Tissue Disorders</p></li><li><p>Pediatric Rheumatology</p></li><li><p>Osteoporosis and Bone Health</p></li><li><p>Vasculitis and Systemic Disorders</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:65:\"Best Rheumatology Hospital in Bangalore | Joint & Autoimmune Care\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:145:\"Get specialized rheumatology treatment in Bangalore at Nano Hospitals. Expert care for joint pain, autoimmune diseases, and chronic inflammation.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:56:48\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-04-21 13:28:31\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/06b63db8-2a15-41d5-a9c5-30a6e75d5fef.webp\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}i:24;O:21:\"App\\Models\\Speciality\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:12:\"specialities\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:8;s:4:\"name\";s:8:\"Urology \";s:4:\"slug\";s:7:\"urology\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/b8e58dfa-a18a-4a39-ab22-65895a9194f1.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8AFVQM21H9TWPK3ZVNB5Z.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:522:\"<p>Nano Hospitals is a leading urology hospital in Bangalore providing expert diagnosis and treatment for all urinary tract disorders in men and women, including kidney stones, prostate enlargement, urinary tract infections, bladder conditions, and male reproductive health problems. Our experienced urologists in Bangalore manage conditions affecting the kidneys, ureters, bladder, urethra, and prostate — using advanced endoscopic and minimally invasive surgical techniques for faster recovery and better outcomes.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:901:\"<p>Urological problems often begin with subtle symptoms — frequent urination, burning sensation, blood in urine, lower abdominal discomfort, or weak urinary flow — but can progress to kidney damage, urinary obstruction, or serious infection if left untreated. As a dedicated urology treatment centre in Bangalore, Nano Hospitals focuses on early detection, precise diagnosis, and timely intervention to protect kidney function and restore normal urinary health.</p><p>Every urology patient at Nano Hospitals receives a personalised treatment plan based on age, medical history, lifestyle, and condition severity — supported by advanced imaging, laser stone treatment, and structured post-treatment follow-up care. Patients across Bangalore trust Nano Hospitals for urology care because of the compassionate, patient-first approach at every stage — from first consultation to full recovery.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:516:\"<p>Urology focuses on diagnosing and managing disorders of the urinary system and male reproductive organs. Early signs such as painful urination, blood in urine, urinary leakage, or flank pain should not be ignored, as they may indicate infection, stones, prostate enlargement, or more serious conditions.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early detection, accurate imaging and laboratory evaluation, minimally invasive intervention whenever possible, and long-term monitoring to protect urinary and kidney health</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:1114:\"<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Medical management of urinary tract infections (UTIs)</p></li><li><p>Medications for prostate enlargement and urinary symptoms</p></li><li><p>Bladder control therapy for incontinence</p></li><li><p>Dietary and lifestyle guidance for kidney stone prevention</p></li><li><p>Hormonal and medication-based management for certain male reproductive disorders</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Cystoscopy for bladder and urethral evaluation</p></li><li><p>Ureteroscopy with laser treatment for kidney and ureteric stones</p></li><li><p>Endoscopic prostate procedures (TURP and laser prostate surgery)</p></li><li><p>Image-guided catheter placements and stenting</p></li><li><p>Minimally invasive treatment for urinary obstruction</p></li></ul><h3>Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Kidney stone removal surgeries</p></li><li><p>Prostate surgery for severe enlargement or obstruction</p></li><li><p>Bladder tumor surgery</p></li><li><p>Reconstructive urological surgeries</p></li><li><p>Treatment of congenital urinary tract abnormalitie</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:507:\"<h2>Facilities and Technologies Used</h2><ul><li><p>Advanced Ultrasound for kidney, bladder, and prostate evaluation</p></li><li><p>CT Scan for detailed stone and urinary tract imaging</p></li><li><p>MRI for complex urological assessments</p></li><li><p>Endoscopic urology equipment for minimally invasive procedures</p></li><li><p>Laser technology for stone and prostate treatment</p></li><li><p>Dedicated urology operation theatres</p></li><li><p>Post-operative monitoring and recovery units</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:380:\"<h2>Conditions and Ailments Treated</h2><ul><li><p>Kidney stones and ureteric stones</p></li><li><p>Urinary tract infections (UTIs)</p></li><li><p>Enlarged prostate (BPH)</p></li><li><p>Urinary incontinence and bladder control issues</p></li><li><p>Blood in urine (hematuria)</p></li><li><p>Bladder and kidney disorders</p></li><li><p>Male reproductive health issues</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:380:\"<h2>Risks and Challenges</h2><ul><li><p>Recurrent stone formation if preventive care is not followed</p></li><li><p>Kidney damage due to untreated obstruction or infection</p></li><li><p>Urinary retention affecting bladder function</p></li><li><p>Chronic discomfort impacting daily life</p></li><li><p>Need for long-term monitoring in prostate and bladder conditions</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:286:\"<h2>Sub-specialties in Urology</h2><ul><li><p>Endourology and Stone Management</p></li><li><p>Prostate Care and Male Urinary Disorders</p></li><li><p>Uro-Oncology (Urological Tumors)</p></li><li><p>Reconstructive Urology</p></li><li><p>Female Urology and Incontinence Care</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:87:\"Best Urology Hospital in Bangalore | Kidney Stone & Prostate Treatment | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:243:\"Nano Hospitals is a trusted urology hospital in Bangalore offering expert treatment for kidney stones, prostate enlargement, UTIs, bladder disorders, and male reproductive health. Consult experienced urologists — book your appointment today.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:25:57\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-12 13:17:17\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/50572282-7671-48f3-9be7-031c29c5a936.webp\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:8;s:4:\"name\";s:8:\"Urology \";s:4:\"slug\";s:7:\"urology\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/b8e58dfa-a18a-4a39-ab22-65895a9194f1.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8AFVQM21H9TWPK3ZVNB5Z.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:522:\"<p>Nano Hospitals is a leading urology hospital in Bangalore providing expert diagnosis and treatment for all urinary tract disorders in men and women, including kidney stones, prostate enlargement, urinary tract infections, bladder conditions, and male reproductive health problems. Our experienced urologists in Bangalore manage conditions affecting the kidneys, ureters, bladder, urethra, and prostate — using advanced endoscopic and minimally invasive surgical techniques for faster recovery and better outcomes.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:901:\"<p>Urological problems often begin with subtle symptoms — frequent urination, burning sensation, blood in urine, lower abdominal discomfort, or weak urinary flow — but can progress to kidney damage, urinary obstruction, or serious infection if left untreated. As a dedicated urology treatment centre in Bangalore, Nano Hospitals focuses on early detection, precise diagnosis, and timely intervention to protect kidney function and restore normal urinary health.</p><p>Every urology patient at Nano Hospitals receives a personalised treatment plan based on age, medical history, lifestyle, and condition severity — supported by advanced imaging, laser stone treatment, and structured post-treatment follow-up care. Patients across Bangalore trust Nano Hospitals for urology care because of the compassionate, patient-first approach at every stage — from first consultation to full recovery.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:516:\"<p>Urology focuses on diagnosing and managing disorders of the urinary system and male reproductive organs. Early signs such as painful urination, blood in urine, urinary leakage, or flank pain should not be ignored, as they may indicate infection, stones, prostate enlargement, or more serious conditions.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early detection, accurate imaging and laboratory evaluation, minimally invasive intervention whenever possible, and long-term monitoring to protect urinary and kidney health</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:1114:\"<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Medical management of urinary tract infections (UTIs)</p></li><li><p>Medications for prostate enlargement and urinary symptoms</p></li><li><p>Bladder control therapy for incontinence</p></li><li><p>Dietary and lifestyle guidance for kidney stone prevention</p></li><li><p>Hormonal and medication-based management for certain male reproductive disorders</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Cystoscopy for bladder and urethral evaluation</p></li><li><p>Ureteroscopy with laser treatment for kidney and ureteric stones</p></li><li><p>Endoscopic prostate procedures (TURP and laser prostate surgery)</p></li><li><p>Image-guided catheter placements and stenting</p></li><li><p>Minimally invasive treatment for urinary obstruction</p></li></ul><h3>Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Kidney stone removal surgeries</p></li><li><p>Prostate surgery for severe enlargement or obstruction</p></li><li><p>Bladder tumor surgery</p></li><li><p>Reconstructive urological surgeries</p></li><li><p>Treatment of congenital urinary tract abnormalitie</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:507:\"<h2>Facilities and Technologies Used</h2><ul><li><p>Advanced Ultrasound for kidney, bladder, and prostate evaluation</p></li><li><p>CT Scan for detailed stone and urinary tract imaging</p></li><li><p>MRI for complex urological assessments</p></li><li><p>Endoscopic urology equipment for minimally invasive procedures</p></li><li><p>Laser technology for stone and prostate treatment</p></li><li><p>Dedicated urology operation theatres</p></li><li><p>Post-operative monitoring and recovery units</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:380:\"<h2>Conditions and Ailments Treated</h2><ul><li><p>Kidney stones and ureteric stones</p></li><li><p>Urinary tract infections (UTIs)</p></li><li><p>Enlarged prostate (BPH)</p></li><li><p>Urinary incontinence and bladder control issues</p></li><li><p>Blood in urine (hematuria)</p></li><li><p>Bladder and kidney disorders</p></li><li><p>Male reproductive health issues</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:380:\"<h2>Risks and Challenges</h2><ul><li><p>Recurrent stone formation if preventive care is not followed</p></li><li><p>Kidney damage due to untreated obstruction or infection</p></li><li><p>Urinary retention affecting bladder function</p></li><li><p>Chronic discomfort impacting daily life</p></li><li><p>Need for long-term monitoring in prostate and bladder conditions</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:286:\"<h2>Sub-specialties in Urology</h2><ul><li><p>Endourology and Stone Management</p></li><li><p>Prostate Care and Male Urinary Disorders</p></li><li><p>Uro-Oncology (Urological Tumors)</p></li><li><p>Reconstructive Urology</p></li><li><p>Female Urology and Incontinence Care</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:87:\"Best Urology Hospital in Bangalore | Kidney Stone & Prostate Treatment | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:243:\"Nano Hospitals is a trusted urology hospital in Bangalore offering expert treatment for kidney stones, prostate enlargement, UTIs, bladder disorders, and male reproductive health. Consult experienced urologists — book your appointment today.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:25:57\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-12 13:17:17\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/50572282-7671-48f3-9be7-031c29c5a936.webp\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}i:25;O:21:\"App\\Models\\Speciality\":34:{s:13:\"\0*\0connection\";s:5:\"mysql\";s:8:\"\0*\0table\";s:12:\"specialities\";s:13:\"\0*\0primaryKey\";s:2:\"id\";s:10:\"\0*\0keyType\";s:3:\"int\";s:12:\"incrementing\";b:1;s:7:\"\0*\0with\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0withCount\";a:0:{}s:19:\"preventsLazyLoading\";b:0;s:10:\"\0*\0perPage\";i:15;s:6:\"exists\";b:1;s:18:\"wasRecentlyCreated\";b:0;s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;s:13:\"\0*\0attributes\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:12;s:4:\"name\";s:16:\"Vascular Surgery\";s:4:\"slug\";s:16:\"vascular-surgery\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/d2edb3ef-e297-4343-ace4-1bf8ab7ee0cb.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8F6F501HFEH5PB27Q2ZY3.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:512:\"<p>Nano Hospitals is a leading vascular surgery hospital in Bangalore, providing advanced diagnosis and treatment for all conditions affecting arteries, veins, and blood circulation. Our experienced vascular surgeons in Bangalore treat a wide range of disorders — from varicose veins and blocked arteries to diabetic foot, deep vein thrombosis (DVT), peripheral artery disease (PAD), and non-healing vascular ulcers — using the latest minimally invasive endovascular techniques for safe, faster recovery.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:1030:\"<p>Vascular disorders often begin with easily ignored symptoms — leg pain while walking, swollen feet, visible bulging veins, numbness, cold limbs, or slow-healing wounds. Without timely vascular treatment in Bangalore, these conditions can progress to dangerous complications including blood clots, gangrene, stroke, or limb loss. At Nano Hospitals, early detection through Doppler ultrasound and CT angiography ensures that circulation problems are identified and treated before they become life-threatening.</p><p>Every vascular patient at Nano Hospitals receives a personalised treatment plan based on disease severity, risk factors like diabetes and hypertension, and overall health. From medical management and compression therapy to endovascular stenting, laser varicose vein treatment, bypass surgery, and limb salvage procedures, Nano Hospitals offers complete vascular care under one roof — with expert surgeons, advanced imaging, and dedicated post-treatment follow-up across BG Road and Uttarahalli, Bangalore.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:409:\"<p>Vascular Surgery involves managing diseases of the circulatory system outside the heart and brain. Early symptoms such as leg cramps during walking, persistent swelling, skin discoloration, or cold extremities should be evaluated promptly.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early vascular screening, Doppler studies, and preventive care to reduce the risk of stroke, limb loss, and other severe outcomes.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:967:\"<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Medications to improve blood flow and prevent clots</p></li><li><p>Compression therapy for venous disorders</p></li><li><p>Lifestyle modification and smoking cessation support</p></li><li><p>Wound care for vascular ulcers</p></li><li><p>Diabetes and blood pressure management to protect vessels</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Angiography for vessel imaging</p></li><li><p>Angioplasty and stent placement to open blocked arteries</p></li><li><p>Endovenous laser treatment (EVLT) for varicose veins</p></li><li><p>Catheter-based clot removal procedures</p></li><li><p>Image-guided vascular interventions</p></li></ul><h3>Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Bypass surgery for blocked arteries</p></li><li><p>Varicose vein surgery</p></li><li><p>Carotid artery surgery to reduce stroke risk</p></li><li><p>Aneurysm repair surgeries</p></li><li><p>Limb-saving vascular reconstructions</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:405:\"<ul><li><p>Vascular Doppler Ultrasound</p></li><li><p>CT Angiography and MR Angiography</p></li><li><p>Digital Subtraction Angiography (DSA) suite</p></li><li><p>Endovascular catheterisation labs</p></li><li><p>Hybrid operation theatres for complex vascular procedures</p></li><li><p>Dedicated vascular ICU and recovery units</p></li><li><p>Advanced wound care and limb preservation services</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:372:\"<ul><li><p>Peripheral Artery Disease (PAD)</p></li><li><p>Varicose veins and chronic venous insufficiency</p></li><li><p>Deep Vein Thrombosis (DVT)</p></li><li><p>Diabetic foot with poor circulation</p></li><li><p>Carotid artery disease</p></li><li><p>Aortic aneurysms</p></li><li><p>Non-healing vascular ulcers</p></li><li><p>Blood vessel blockages in limbs</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:300:\"<ul><li><p>Risk of stroke from untreated carotid disease</p></li><li><p>Limb loss due to severe arterial blockage</p></li><li><p>Recurrent clots in high-risk patients</p></li><li><p>Chronic pain and mobility limitations</p></li><li><p>Long-term care needed for diabetic vascular disease</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:238:\"<ul><li><p>Endovascular Surgery</p></li><li><p>Peripheral Arterial Disease Management</p></li><li><p>Venous Disorders and Varicose Vein Care</p></li><li><p>Diabetic Limb Salvage</p></li><li><p>Aortic and Major Vessel Surgery</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:104:\"Best Vascular Surgery Hospital in Bangalore | Varicose Veins & Blocked Artery Treatment | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:272:\"Nano Hospitals is a trusted vascular surgery hospital in Bangalore offering expert treatment for varicose veins, blocked arteries, diabetic foot, DVT, peripheral artery disease, and non-healing ulcers. Consult experienced vascular surgeons — book your appointment today.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:43:28\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-12 13:18:10\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/bc161b15-e5eb-478c-8622-64722d0c1e94.webp\";}s:11:\"\0*\0original\";a:19:{s:2:\"id\";i:12;s:4:\"name\";s:16:\"Vascular Surgery\";s:4:\"slug\";s:16:\"vascular-surgery\";s:12:\"banner_image\";s:62:\"specialities/banners/d2edb3ef-e297-4343-ace4-1bf8ab7ee0cb.webp\";s:4:\"icon\";s:50:\"specialities/icons/01KGJ8F6F501HFEH5PB27Q2ZY3.webp\";s:9:\"is_active\";i:1;s:11:\"about_intro\";s:512:\"<p>Nano Hospitals is a leading vascular surgery hospital in Bangalore, providing advanced diagnosis and treatment for all conditions affecting arteries, veins, and blood circulation. Our experienced vascular surgeons in Bangalore treat a wide range of disorders — from varicose veins and blocked arteries to diabetic foot, deep vein thrombosis (DVT), peripheral artery disease (PAD), and non-healing vascular ulcers — using the latest minimally invasive endovascular techniques for safe, faster recovery.</p>\";s:10:\"about_more\";s:1030:\"<p>Vascular disorders often begin with easily ignored symptoms — leg pain while walking, swollen feet, visible bulging veins, numbness, cold limbs, or slow-healing wounds. Without timely vascular treatment in Bangalore, these conditions can progress to dangerous complications including blood clots, gangrene, stroke, or limb loss. At Nano Hospitals, early detection through Doppler ultrasound and CT angiography ensures that circulation problems are identified and treated before they become life-threatening.</p><p>Every vascular patient at Nano Hospitals receives a personalised treatment plan based on disease severity, risk factors like diabetes and hypertension, and overall health. From medical management and compression therapy to endovascular stenting, laser varicose vein treatment, bypass surgery, and limb salvage procedures, Nano Hospitals offers complete vascular care under one roof — with expert surgeons, advanced imaging, and dedicated post-treatment follow-up across BG Road and Uttarahalli, Bangalore.</p>\";s:16:\"overview_content\";s:409:\"<p>Vascular Surgery involves managing diseases of the circulatory system outside the heart and brain. Early symptoms such as leg cramps during walking, persistent swelling, skin discoloration, or cold extremities should be evaluated promptly.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early vascular screening, Doppler studies, and preventive care to reduce the risk of stroke, limb loss, and other severe outcomes.</p>\";s:18:\"treatments_content\";s:967:\"<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Medications to improve blood flow and prevent clots</p></li><li><p>Compression therapy for venous disorders</p></li><li><p>Lifestyle modification and smoking cessation support</p></li><li><p>Wound care for vascular ulcers</p></li><li><p>Diabetes and blood pressure management to protect vessels</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Angiography for vessel imaging</p></li><li><p>Angioplasty and stent placement to open blocked arteries</p></li><li><p>Endovenous laser treatment (EVLT) for varicose veins</p></li><li><p>Catheter-based clot removal procedures</p></li><li><p>Image-guided vascular interventions</p></li></ul><h3>Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Bypass surgery for blocked arteries</p></li><li><p>Varicose vein surgery</p></li><li><p>Carotid artery surgery to reduce stroke risk</p></li><li><p>Aneurysm repair surgeries</p></li><li><p>Limb-saving vascular reconstructions</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"facilities_content\";s:405:\"<ul><li><p>Vascular Doppler Ultrasound</p></li><li><p>CT Angiography and MR Angiography</p></li><li><p>Digital Subtraction Angiography (DSA) suite</p></li><li><p>Endovascular catheterisation labs</p></li><li><p>Hybrid operation theatres for complex vascular procedures</p></li><li><p>Dedicated vascular ICU and recovery units</p></li><li><p>Advanced wound care and limb preservation services</p></li></ul>\";s:18:\"conditions_content\";s:372:\"<ul><li><p>Peripheral Artery Disease (PAD)</p></li><li><p>Varicose veins and chronic venous insufficiency</p></li><li><p>Deep Vein Thrombosis (DVT)</p></li><li><p>Diabetic foot with poor circulation</p></li><li><p>Carotid artery disease</p></li><li><p>Aortic aneurysms</p></li><li><p>Non-healing vascular ulcers</p></li><li><p>Blood vessel blockages in limbs</p></li></ul>\";s:13:\"risks_content\";s:300:\"<ul><li><p>Risk of stroke from untreated carotid disease</p></li><li><p>Limb loss due to severe arterial blockage</p></li><li><p>Recurrent clots in high-risk patients</p></li><li><p>Chronic pain and mobility limitations</p></li><li><p>Long-term care needed for diabetic vascular disease</p></li></ul>\";s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";s:238:\"<ul><li><p>Endovascular Surgery</p></li><li><p>Peripheral Arterial Disease Management</p></li><li><p>Venous Disorders and Varicose Vein Care</p></li><li><p>Diabetic Limb Salvage</p></li><li><p>Aortic and Major Vessel Surgery</p></li></ul>\";s:10:\"meta_title\";s:104:\"Best Vascular Surgery Hospital in Bangalore | Varicose Veins & Blocked Artery Treatment | Nano Hospitals\";s:16:\"meta_description\";s:272:\"Nano Hospitals is a trusted vascular surgery hospital in Bangalore offering expert treatment for varicose veins, blocked arteries, diabetic foot, DVT, peripheral artery disease, and non-healing ulcers. Consult experienced vascular surgeons — book your appointment today.\";s:10:\"created_at\";s:19:\"2026-02-02 17:43:28\";s:10:\"updated_at\";s:19:\"2026-06-12 13:18:10\";s:13:\"related_image\";s:76:\"specialities/banners/relatedimages/bc161b15-e5eb-478c-8622-64722d0c1e94.webp\";}s:10:\"\0*\0changes\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0previous\";a:0:{}s:8:\"\0*\0casts\";a:0:{}s:17:\"\0*\0classCastCache\";a:0:{}s:21:\"\0*\0attributeCastCache\";a:0:{}s:13:\"\0*\0dateFormat\";N;s:10:\"\0*\0appends\";a:0:{}s:19:\"\0*\0dispatchesEvents\";a:0:{}s:14:\"\0*\0observables\";a:0:{}s:12:\"\0*\0relations\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0touches\";a:0:{}s:27:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadCallback\";N;s:26:\"\0*\0relationAutoloadContext\";N;s:10:\"timestamps\";b:1;s:13:\"usesUniqueIds\";b:0;s:9:\"\0*\0hidden\";a:0:{}s:10:\"\0*\0visible\";a:0:{}s:11:\"\0*\0fillable\";a:16:{i:0;s:4:\"name\";i:1;s:4:\"slug\";i:2;s:12:\"banner_image\";i:3;s:4:\"icon\";i:4;s:13:\"related_image\";i:5;s:11:\"about_intro\";i:6;s:10:\"about_more\";i:7;s:16:\"overview_content\";i:8;s:18:\"treatments_content\";i:9;s:18:\"facilities_content\";i:10;s:18:\"conditions_content\";i:11;s:13:\"risks_content\";i:12;s:22:\"subspecialties_content\";i:13;s:10:\"meta_title\";i:14;s:16:\"meta_description\";i:15;s:9:\"is_active\";}s:10:\"\0*\0guarded\";a:1:{i:0;s:1:\"*\";}s:16:\"\0*\0scoutMetadata\";a:0:{}}}s:28:\"\0*\0escapeWhenCastingToString\";b:0;}',1785307671),('laravel-cache-content:version','i:562;',2100664753);
