INSERT INTO `conditions` VALUES (1,'Hypertension (High Blood Pressure)','hypertension-high-blood-pressure',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p>The Department of Cardiology at Nano Hospitals is one of the best centers for hypertension and high blood pressure treatment in Bangalore, delivering comprehensive and personalized care for patients across Bengaluru. Our team of experienced cardiologists and hypertension specialists provides the best advanced diagnostic and therapeutic solutions to manage blood pressure and prevent life-threatening cardiovascular complications effectively.</p>','<p>Early detection of hypertension is critical, as uncontrolled high blood pressure silently damages the heart, kidneys, and brain over time. At Nano Hospitals Bangalore, we combine the best cutting-edge technology with evidence-based treatment protocols to help every patient achieve long-term blood pressure control and a healthier life.</p>','<p></p>','[{\"value\":\"Headaches\"},{\"value\":\"Dizziness\"},{\"value\":\"Nosebleeds (rare)\"},{\"value\":\"Blurred vision\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Genetics\"},{\"value\":\"Obesity\"},{\"value\":\"High salt diet\"},{\"value\":\"Stress\"},{\"value\":\"Sedentary lifestyle\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Stroke\"},{\"value\":\"Heart attack\"},{\"value\":\"Kidney failure\"},{\"value\":\"Vision loss\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Blood pressure measurement\"},{\"value\":\"ECG, echocardiogram\"},{\"value\":\"Kidney function tests\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Lifestyle changes\"},{\"value\":\"Antihypertensive medications (ACE inhibitors, beta-blockers)\"}]','<p>With proper management, patients live normal lives.<br></p>',0,1,'2026-01-29 11:13:30','2026-06-11 12:37:59','High Blood Pressure Treatment in Bangalore | Best Hypertension Specialists in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals','Nano Hospitals is one of the best hypertension and high blood pressure treatment hospitals in Bangalore. Our experienced specialists provide advanced, personalized blood pressure care for long-term heart health.',NULL,'Best Hypertension Hospital In Bangalore'),(2,'Diabetes','diabetes',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p>Nano Hospitals is one of the best diabetes treatment hospitals in Bangalore, offering comprehensive and personalized care for patients managing Type 1, Type 2, and gestational diabetes across Bengaluru. Our best team of endocrinologists, diabetologists, and diabetes educators works closely with each patient to develop the most effective blood sugar management strategies and prevent long-term complications.</p>','<p>Uncontrolled diabetes can silently damage the kidneys, eyes, nerves, and heart — making early intervention and consistent medical supervision absolutely vital. At Nano Hospitals Bangalore, we combine the best diagnostic tools with evidence-based treatment protocols and lifestyle guidance to help every patient achieve stable blood sugar levels and a healthier, complication-free life.</p>','<p></p>','[{\"value\":\"Frequent urination\"},{\"value\":\"Excessive thirst\"},{\"value\":\"Fatigue\"},{\"value\":\"Slow wound healing\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Genetics\"},{\"value\":\"Obesity\"},{\"value\":\"Sedentary lifestyle\"},{\"value\":\"Autoimmune destruction (Type 1)\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Heart disease\"},{\"value\":\"Kidney failure\"},{\"value\":\"Blindness\"},{\"value\":\"Nerve damage\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Healthy diet\"},{\"value\":\"Exercise\"},{\"value\":\"Weight control\"},{\"value\":\"Fasting blood sugar\"},{\"value\":\"HbA1c test\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Insulin therapy\"},{\"value\":\"Oral drugs (metformin)\"},{\"value\":\"Lifestyle changes\"}]','<p>Diabetes cannot be cured but can be controlled.<br></p>',0,1,'2026-02-03 00:51:04','2026-06-11 12:43:54','Best Diabetes Treatment in Bangalore | Top Diabetologists in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals','Nano Hospitals is one of the best diabetes treatment hospitals in Bangalore. Our expert endocrinologists and diabetologists provide personalized care for Type 1, Type 2 and gestational diabetes management.',NULL,'Best Diabetes Treatment Hospital In Bangalore'),(3,'Heart Disease ','heart-disease',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p>Nano Hospitals is one of the best heart disease treatment hospitals in Bangalore, providing advanced and comprehensive cardiac care for patients suffering from coronary artery disease, heart failure, arrhythmia, and other cardiovascular conditions across Bengaluru. Our dedicated team of best cardiologists, cardiac surgeons, and interventional specialists collaborates closely to deliver precise diagnosis and personalized treatment plans for the best possible cardiac outcomes.</p>','<p>Heart disease, characterized by conditions affecting the heart&#039;s blood supply and overall function, remains the leading cause of mortality across India — with Bangalore and Bengaluru reporting a significant and growing number of cardiac cases every year. At Nano Hospitals Bangalore, we are equipped with the best state-of-the-art cardiac diagnostic and interventional infrastructure, combining cutting-edge technology with evidence-based treatment protocols to help every patient achieve a stronger, healthier heart and improved quality of life.</p>','<p></p>','[{\"value\":\"Chest pain (angina)\"},{\"value\":\"Shortness of breath\"},{\"value\":\"Fatigue\"},{\"value\":\"Palpitations\"}]','[{\"value\":\"High cholesterol\"},{\"value\":\"Hypertension\"},{\"value\":\"Smoking\"},{\"value\":\"Diabetes\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Heart attack\"},{\"value\":\"Heart failure\"},{\"value\":\"Death\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Healthy diet\"},{\"value\":\"Exercise\"},{\"value\":\"Quit smoking\"},{\"value\":\"Control BP and cholesterol\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Medications (statins, beta-blockers)\"},{\"value\":\"Angioplasty\"},{\"value\":\"Bypass surgery\"}]','<p>With treatment, survival and quality of life improve.<br></p>',0,1,'2026-02-03 00:53:27','2026-06-15 07:13:44','Best Heart Disease Treatment in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals','Struggling with heart problems? Get advanced Heart Disease treatment at Nano Hospitals Bangalore from top cardiologists for a stronger, healthier heart.',NULL,'Best Heart Disease Treatment Hospital In Bangalore'),(4,'Stroke','stroke',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p>Nano Hospitals is one of the best stroke treatment hospitals in Bangalore, providing advanced and comprehensive neurology and neurosurgical care for patients suffering from ischemic stroke, hemorrhagic stroke, and transient ischemic attacks (TIA) across Bengaluru. Our best team of neurologists, neurosurgeons, interventional specialists, and rehabilitation experts collaborates closely to deliver the fastest possible diagnosis and most effective treatment plans, ensuring every stroke patient receives timely, life-saving care and the best possible neurological recovery.</p>','<p>Stroke occurs when blood supply to the brain is suddenly interrupted — either due to a blocked artery or a ruptured blood vessel — causing rapid brain cell death and potentially irreversible neurological damage in patients across Bangalore and Bengaluru. As a medical emergency where every second of delayed treatment increases brain damage, immediate access to the best stroke care in Bangalore is absolutely critical for survival and recovery. At Nano Hospitals Bangalore, we are equipped with a dedicated stroke response team, advanced neuroimaging technology, and evidence-based treatment protocols available round the clock to deliver the fastest and most effective stroke care to every patient.</p>','<p></p>','[{\"value\":\"Sudden weakness\\/paralysis\"},{\"value\":\"Slurred speech\"},{\"value\":\"Vision problems\"},{\"value\":\"Loss of balance\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Hypertension\"},{\"value\":\"Diabetes\"},{\"value\":\"High cholesterol\"},{\"value\":\"Smoking\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Permanent disability\"},{\"value\":\"Death\"}]','[{\"value\":\"CT\\/MRI brain\"},{\"value\":\"Blood tests\"},{\"value\":\"Carotid ultrasound\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Clot-busting drugs (thrombolysis)\"},{\"value\":\"Surgery (carotid endarterectomy)\"},{\"value\":\"Rehabilitation\"}]','<p>Cholesterol can be control