 | Joint Pain Specialists in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals','Nano Hospitals is a leading osteoarthritis and joint pain treatment center in Bangalore. Our orthopedic specialists offer advanced, non-surgical and surgical care to restore mobility and improve quality of life.',NULL,'Best Osteoarthritis Treatment Hospital In Bangalore'),(7,'Back and Neck Pain','back-and-neck-pain',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p>Nano Hospitals is one of the best back and neck pain treatment hospitals in Bangalore, providing advanced and comprehensive spine care for patients suffering from chronic back pain, cervical spondylosis, herniated discs, sciatica, and other spinal conditions across Bengaluru. Our best team of spine surgeons, orthopedic specialists, neurologists, and physiotherapists collaborates closely to deliver precise diagnosis and personalized treatment plans to help every patient achieve lasting pain relief and restored mobility.</p>','<p>Back and neck pain are among the most commonly reported musculoskeletal complaints affecting working professionals, elderly individuals, and athletes across Bangalore and Bengaluru — often caused by poor posture, sedentary lifestyles, degenerative disc disease, or spinal injuries. At Nano Hospitals Bangalore, we are equipped with the best state-of-the-art spinal diagnostic and interventional infrastructure, combining advanced imaging technology with evidence-based surgical and non-surgical treatment protocols to help every patient live pain-free and regain full quality of life.</p>','<p>Back and neck pain are common musculoskeletal issues. A slipped disc occurs when spinal<br>disc material presses on nerves.</p>','[{\"value\":\"Pain in back\\/neck\"},{\"value\":\"Numbness or tingling\"},{\"value\":\"Weakness in limbs\"},{\"value\":\"Difficulty walking\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Poor posture\"},{\"value\":\"Heavy lifting\"},{\"value\":\"Aging\"},{\"value\":\"Trauma\"}]','[{\"value\":null}]','[{\"value\":\"Chronic pain\"},{\"value\":\"Paralysis (rare)\"},{\"value\":\"Disability\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Pain medications\"},{\"value\":\"Physiotherapy\"},{\"value\":\"Surgery (discectomy, laminectomy)\"}]','<p>Most cases improve with conservative treatment; surgery restores function in severe cases.</p>',0,1,'2026-02-03 01:03:59','2026-06-11 13:26:15','Best Back and Neck Pain Treatment in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals','Suffering from back or neck pain? Consult expert spine specialists at Nano Hospitals Bangalore for advanced, personalized pain relief and faster recovery.',NULL,'Best Back and Neck Pain Treatment Hospital In Bangalore'),(8,'Osteoporosis','osteoporosis',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p>Nano Hospitals is one of the best osteoporosis treatment hospitals in Bangalore, providing advanced and comprehensive bone health care for patients suffering from osteoporosis, bone density loss, fragility fractures, and related skeletal conditions across Bengaluru. Our best team of orthopedic specialists, rheumatologists, endocrinologists, and physiotherapists collaborates closely to deliver precise bone health assessment and personalized treatment plans, ensuring every patient achieves stronger bones, reduced fracture risk, and improved overall skeletal health.</p>','<p>Osteoporosis is a progressive bone disorder where bones become increasingly weak, brittle, and prone to fractures — particularly affecting elderly individuals, postmenopausal women, and patients with calcium and vitamin D deficiencies across Bangalore and Bengaluru. Often developing silently without symptoms until a fracture occurs, osteoporosis demands early detection through bone density screening and timely medical intervention for effective management. At Nano Hospitals Bangalore, we are equipped with the best state-of-the-art bone diagnostic infrastructure including advanced DEXA scanning technology and evidence-based treatment protocols to help every patient strengthen their bones and prevent life-altering fractures.</p>','<p>Osteoporosis develops when bone loss occurs faster than