ervention for safe and complete healing. From simple hairline fractures to complex multi-fragment and open fractures, delayed or improper treatment can lead to permanent disability, chronic pain, and long-term functional limitations. At Nano Hospitals Bangalore, we are equipped with the best state-of-the-art orthopedic and trauma surgical infrastructure, combining advanced imaging technology, minimally invasive fixation techniques, and evidence-based rehabilitation protocols to help every patient recover faster, stronger, and more completely.</p>','<p></p>','[{\"value\":\"Severe pain\"},{\"value\":\"Swelling\"},{\"value\":\"Deformity\"},{\"value\":\"Loss of function\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Falls\"},{\"value\":\"Accidents\"},{\"value\":\"Sports injuries\"},{\"value\":\"Weak bones (osteoporosis)\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Permanent deformity\"},{\"value\":\"Disability\"},{\"value\":\"Chronic pain\"}]','[{\"value\":\"X-rays\"},{\"value\":\"CT\\/MRI\"}]','[{\"value\":\"Casting or splinting\"},{\"value\":\"Surgery (plates, screws, rods)\"},{\"value\":\"Physiotherapy\"}]','<p>Most fractures heal in 6–12 weeks; rehabilitation restores mobility.<br></p>',0,1,'2026-02-03 01:08:02','2026-06-15 08:30:01','Best Fracture & Trauma Treatment in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals','Injured or dealing with a fracture? Get the best Fractures and Trauma treatment at Nano Hospitals Bangalore from expert orthopedic surgeons for fast recovery.',NULL,'Best Fractures and Injury Trauma Treatment Hospital In Bangalore'),(10,'Asthma','asthma',NULL,NULL,NULL,'<p>Nano Hospitals is recognized as one of the best asthma treatment hospitals in Bangalore, providing advanced respiratory care for children and adults suffering from chronic asthma and breathing disorders across Bengaluru. Our best team of pulmonologists and allergy specialists delivers precise diagnosis and individualized treatment plans to help patients breathe freely and live without limitations.</p>','<p>Asthma triggered by allergens, pollution, and re