INSERT INTO `health_packages` VALUES (2,'basic health package','basic-health-package','Male',1000.00,500.00,1000.00,'health-packages/01KGFGHR1XXSYAXK9JNY5CCQK1.png','Health Packages at Nano Hospitals are designed to make preventive healthcare simple, affordable, and accessible. These comprehensive checkup packages help detect health issues early through a wide range of diagnostic tests, including blood investigations, organ-specific screenings, and lifestyle risk assessments.','Health Packages at Nano Hospitals are designed to make preventive healthcare simple, affordable, and accessible. These comprehensive checkup packages help detect health issues early through a wide range of diagnostic tests, including blood investigations, organ-specific screenings, and lifestyle risk assessments.','sds','sds','sdsd','2026-01-26 08:29:59','2026-02-02 10:16:57'),(3,'Pre Employment Package','pre-employment-package','Both',5000.00,2600.00,1000.00,'health-packages/01KGKN5NZCKKWTZD3G7J4PADPA.webp','The Pre-Employment Health Package offers a comprehensive medical evaluation for job readiness. It includes detailed blood tests to assess general health, immunity, and metabolic status',' Diabetes and lipid screening help identify lifestyle and cardiac risk factors early. Urine analysis, ECG, chest X-ray, and ultrasound support thorough internal health assessment. An essential screening to ensure fitness for work and confident onboarding.','Pre Employment Package','Pre Employment Package\n','Pre Employment Package','2026-01-26 08:30:22','2026-02-04 01:24:47'),(4,'Master Health Package','master-health-package','Both',5000.00,2800.00,NULL,'health-packages/01KGKQWDC80VYBFB5ZGZEEP3SY.png','The Nano Hospitals Master Health Package offers a comprehensive evaluation of your overall health. It includes detailed blood tests, cardiac screening, and advanced imaging for early detection of health risks','Key organ functions such as heart, liver, kidneys, thyroid, and metabolism are thoroughly assessed. Ultrasound, ECG, and chest X-ray provide a complete internal health overview. A preventive health package designed to help you take control of your health with confidence at Nano Hospitals','Master Health Package','The Nano Hospitals Master Health Package offers a comprehensive evaluation of your overall health.','Master Health Package','2026-01-26 08:38:47','2026-02-04 01:44:22');
