INSERT INTO `specialities` VALUES (1,'Orthopedics (Bone & Joint Care)','bone-joint-care','specialities/banners/01KGMKN5FEYX8P8GB8RAD96TMK.webp','specialities/icons/c4b1f738-80ac-49b3-9524-3d66b841373a.webp',1,'<p>Nano Hospitals is one of the trusted orthopedic hospitals in Bangalore, offering specialised care for all conditions affecting the bones, joints, muscles, ligaments, tendons, and spine. The department treats a wide range of musculoskeletal problems — from fractures, knee pain, and arthritis to spine disorders and sports injuries — with a focus on accurate diagnosis, early treatment, and lasting recovery.</p>','<p>Bone and joint problems often start with mild symptoms like knee stiffness, back pain, or reduced flexibility. Without timely treatment, these conditions can worsen and affect your ability to walk, work, and carry out everyday activities. At Nano Hospitals Bangalore, our orthopedic specialists are trained to identify the root cause and provide the right treatment at the right time — whether it is non-surgical management, physiotherapy, or advanced <a href=\"/procedures/knee-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">knee replacement</a> and <a href=\"/procedures/hip-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">hip replacement</a> surgery.</p><p>Our approach is patient-centred and personalised. Every treatment plan is built around the individual&#039;s age, activity level, severity of the condition, and overall health. From first consultation to post-surgery rehabilitation, our team ensures you receive consistent, compassionate, and clinically sound care.</p>','<p>Bone and Joint Care focuses on diagnosing and managing musculoskeletal conditions that affect mobility, strength, and daily function. Early symptoms such as joint pain, stiffness, or restricted movement can progress if left untreated.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early diagnosis, personalised treatment planning, and long-term rehabilitation to improve mobility and quality of life.</p>','<h3><strong>Non-Surgical Treatments</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Medical management of joint pain and inflammation</p></li><li><p>Pain relief protocols and mobility support</p></li><li><p>Physiotherapy and rehabilitation programs</p></li><li><p>Posture correction and ergonomic guidance</p></li><li><p>Bone health evaluation and <a href=\"/conditions/osteoporosis\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Osteoporosis</a> management</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Minimally Invasive Procedures</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Arthroscopy for knee, shoulder, and other joints</p></li><li><p>Image-guided joint injections</p></li><li><p>Sports injury repair with minimal tissue damage</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Surgical Treatments</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Fracture fixation and trauma surgery</p></li><li><p><a href=\"/procedures/knee-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Knee replacement</a>, <a href=\"/procedures/hip-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">hip replacement</a>, and shoulder joint replacement surgeries</p></li><li><p>Spine surgeries for nerve compression or instability</p></li><li><p>Corrective surgeries for deformities</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Digital X-Ray for rapid diagnosis</p></li><li><p>CT Scan and MRI for joint and spine evaluation</p></li><li><p>C-Arm for precision-guided procedures</p></li><li><p>Dedicated Orthopaedic ICU support</p></li><li><p>Post-operative recovery and monitoring units</p></li><li><p>Rehabilitation and physiotherapy services</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p><a href=\"/conditions/osteoarthritis\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Osteoarthritis</a> and degenerative joint disease</p></li><li><p>Degenerative disc disease and spondylosis</p></li><li><p>Fractures, dislocations, and trauma injuries</p></li><li><p>Sports injuries and ligament tears</p></li><li><p>Chronic back pain, <a href=\"/conditions/back-and-neck-pain\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">sciatica</a>, and <a href=\"/conditions/back-and-neck-pain\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">slipped disc</a></p></li><li><p><a href=\"/conditions/osteoporosis\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Osteoporosis</a> and inflammatory joint conditions</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Progressive degeneration if untreated</p></li><li><p>Reduced mobility and chronic pain</p></li><li><p>Risk of fractures in <a href=\"/conditions/osteoporosis\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Osteoporosis</a></p></li><li><p>Need for long-term rehabilitation</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p><a href=\"/procedures/knee-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">Knee replacement</a> and <a href=\"/procedures/hip-replacement-surgery\" class=\"text-red-600 hover:underline font-medium\">hip replacement</a> surgery</p></li><li><p>Spine Care and Back Pain Management</p></li><li><p>Sports Medicine and Arthroscopy</p></li><li><p>Orthopaedic Trauma Care</p></li><li><p>Geriatric Orthopaedics</p></li></ul>','Best Bone & Joint Care Hospital in Bangalore | Orthopedic Treatment | Nano Hospitals','Looking for the best orthopedic hospital in Bangalore? Nano Hospitals offers expert bone and joint care for knee pain, joint replacement, fractures, arthritis, spine disorders, and sports injuries — with experienced orthopedic surgeons and advanced facilities.','2026-01-26 06:48:30','2026-07-22 05:54:41','specialities/banners/relatedimages/01KGM4QHD24NE3KGT2PWJVTGJS.jpg'),(2,'Paediatrics  (child-care)','child-care-paediatrics','specialities/banners/relatedimages/01KGM51DNYKVRMJF5TBN76MB1F.jpg','specialities/icons/01KGJ875T3JSGCM1CPJ0KKC78K.webp',1,'<p>Child Care at Nano Hospitals is dedicated to providing comprehensive, compassionate, and age-appropriate medical care for newborns, infants, children, and adolescents. Children are not just small adults—their bodies, immunity, growth patterns, and emotional needs are unique and require specialised medical expertise.</p>','<p>From the first moments of life to the critical years of growth and development, the department focuses on early detection, timely treatment, and preventive healthcare. Whether it is a premature newborn, a child with recurrent infections, or an adolescent with developmental concerns, care is delivered with equal emphasis on medical accuracy and emotional comfort.</p><p>The department works closely with parents and caregivers, ensuring they are informed, supported, and actively involved at every stage of the child’s care journey</p>','<p>Child Care services focus on the medical, developmental, and emotional needs of children from birth through adolescence. Early diagnosis and timely intervention play a vital role in ensuring healthy growth and long-term wellbeing.</p><p>Nano Hospitals combines paediatric expertise with a child-friendly approach to deliver safe, effective, and reassuring care.</p>','<h3><strong>Neonatal Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Immediate newborn assessment and stabilisation</p></li><li><p>Care for premature and low-birth-weight babies</p></li><li><p>Thermal care, feeding support, and infection prevention</p></li><li><p>Neonatal resuscitation when required</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Paediatric Medical Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Diagnosis and treatment of childhood illnesses</p></li><li><p>Management of infections and respiratory conditions</p></li><li><p>Nutritional assessment and growth monitoring</p></li><li><p>Developmental screening and follow-up</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Paediatric Emergency &amp; Preventive Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Emergency stabilisation of sick children</p></li><li><p>Management of dehydration, breathing difficulty, and infections</p></li><li><p>Immunisation and regular health check-ups</p></li><li><p>Parental guidance on nutrition and development</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Neonatal Intensive Care Unit (NICU)</p></li><li><p>Neonatal resuscitation setup within delivery areas</p></li><li><p>Advanced laboratory diagnostics</p></li><li><p>Imaging support (X-ray, ultrasound, CT when indicated)</p></li><li><p>24×7 emergency and ICU backup</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Prematurity and low birth weight</p></li><li><p>Neonatal infections and breathing difficulties</p></li><li><p>Fever, respiratory and gastrointestinal infections</p></li><li><p>Nutritional deficiencies and feeding difficulties</p></li><li><p>Delayed milestones and poor weight gain</p></li><li><p>Paediatric emergencies including seizures and dehydration</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Early diagnosis and timely intervention</p></li><li><p>Family-centred communication and involvement</p></li><li><p>Gentle handling and emotional reassurance</p></li><li><p>Long-term focus on healthy growth and development</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Neonatology</p></li><li><p>General Paediatrics</p></li><li><p>Preventive Child Health</p></li><li><p>Developmental Paediatrics</p></li></ul>','Best Child Care Hospital in Bangalore | Pediatric Care at Nano Hospitals','Nano Hospitals provides expert child care in Bangalore with experienced pediatricians, advanced facilities, and compassionate care for infants, children, and adolescents.','2026-01-26 07:00:01','2026-04-21 05:03:40','specialities/banners/relatedimages/01KGM51DNYKVRMJF5TBN76MB1F.jpg'),(3,'Gynaecology (Women care)','women-care-obstetrics','specialities/banners/9e11e61f-65dc-4fcc-a31a-b6da65c0a508.webp','specialities/icons/01KGJ87T8219AQDKPMNBFTX08S.webp',1,'<p>Women Care at Nano Hospitals is dedicated to supporting women through every stage of life—adolescence, reproductive years, pregnancy, childbirth, and menopause. Women’s health needs are complex and dynamic, influenced by hormonal changes, lifestyle, family planning choices, and age-related transitions.</p>','<p>From preventive screenings and menstrual health to safe motherhood and advanced gynaecological care, the department emphasises early diagnosis, informed decision-making, and respectful care. During pregnancy and childbirth, special focus is placed on maternal safety and newborn wellbeing, supported by integrated neonatal services and emergency preparedness.</p><p>Care is delivered in partnership with women and their families—ensuring clarity, dignity, and emotional support alongside medical excellence.</p>','<p>Women Care focuses on preventive health, reproductive wellbeing, safe motherhood, and gynaecological care across all life stages. Early diagnosis and continuity of care help women make informed health decisions.</p><p>Nano Hospitals combines clinical expertise with respectful, compassionate care to support women’s long-term wellbeing.</p>','<h3><strong>Preventive &amp; Outpatient Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Adolescent gynaecology counselling</p></li><li><p>Menstrual health evaluation and management</p></li><li><p>Family planning and contraception guidance</p></li><li><p>Routine gynaecological check-ups and screenings</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Antenatal &amp; Pregnancy Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Preconception counselling</p></li><li><p>Antenatal check-ups and fetal monitoring</p></li><li><p>Management of pregnancy-related conditions</p></li><li><p>High-risk pregnancy monitoring and care</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Labour, Delivery &amp; Gynaecological Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Normal and assisted vaginal deliveries</p></li><li><p>Emergency obstetric interventions</p></li><li><p>Immediate newborn assessment and care</p></li><li><p>Medical and surgical gynaecological treatments</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Advanced labour room with continuous monitoring</p></li><li><p>Neonatal resuscitation setup within delivery areas</p></li><li><p>NICU for immediate newborn support</p></li><li><p>Ultrasound and imaging services</p></li><li><p>Advanced laboratory diagnostics</p></li><li><p>Emergency operation theatre access</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Irregular or painful periods, PCOS, and hormonal imbalances</p></li><li><p>High-risk pregnancies and gestational complications</p></li><li><p>Anaemia during pregnancy</p></li><li><p>Uterine fibroids, ovarian cysts, and pelvic infections</p></li><li><p>Adolescent and menopause-related gynaecological concerns</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Respectful, woman-centred care</p></li><li><p>Clear communication and shared decision-making</p></li><li><p>Safety-first clinical protocols</p></li><li><p>Emotional support during sensitive life moments</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Obstetrics and Maternity Care</p></li><li><p>High-Risk Pregnancy Management</p></li><li><p>Preventive Gynaecology</p></li><li><p>Adolescent and Menopause Care</p></li></ul>','Best Gynaecology  Hospital in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals','Complete women’s healthcare in Bangalore at Nano Hospitals. Specialized care for hormonal health, pregnancy, and all life stages of women.','2026-02-02 11:38:53','2026-04-21 05:15:10','specialities/banners/relatedimages/dec66dd4-c88d-472c-8ace-35341787b1bb.webp'),(4,'General Medicine','general-medicine','specialities/banners/c722a471-d790-4f97-b241-93335a9a9b2f.webp','specialities/icons/4391236c-b190-4044-8e18-6fcf4d9e7cbb.webp',1,'<p>General Medicine &amp; Allied Specialties at Nano Hospitals forms the core foundation of adult patient care, serving as the first and most crucial point of contact for individuals experiencing acute illness, chronic disease, or unexplained symptoms. The department focuses on holistic diagnosis, medical management, disease prevention, and long-term health monitoring.</p>','<p>Many medical conditions begin subtly—fatigue, fever, breathlessness, weight changes, or body pain may signal deeper issues. General Medicine specialists are trained to assess the body as a whole, identify root causes, and coordinate care across specialties when required.</p><p>Care is continuous, evidence-based, and personalised—supporting patients through illness, recovery, and long-term disease control.</p>','<p>General Medicine focuses on comprehensive adult healthcare, from diagnosis of acute illnesses to long-term management of chronic and complex conditions.</p><p>At Nano Hospitals, the department plays a pivotal role in early detection, coordinated treatment, and timely referral to super-specialties when needed.</p>','<h3><strong>Diagnostic &amp; Evaluation Services</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Detailed medical consultation and physical examination</p></li><li><p>Systematic evaluation of unexplained symptoms</p></li><li><p>Risk assessment for lifestyle and metabolic diseases</p></li><li><p>Coordination of diagnostic investigations</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Medical Management</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Treatment of acute infections and illnesses</p></li><li><p>Long-term management of chronic diseases</p></li><li><p>Medication optimisation and monitoring</p></li><li><p>Supportive care during hospitalisation</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Preventive &amp; Inpatient Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Preventive health check-ups and adult vaccinations</p></li><li><p>Lifestyle modification and nutritional counselling</p></li><li><p>Management of hospitalised patients</p></li><li><p>ICU coordination and post-discharge follow-up</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Advanced laboratory medicine for accurate diagnostics</p></li><li><p>ECG, Digital X-Ray, CT Scan, and MRI</p></li><li><p>2D Echocardiography when cardiac assessment is required</p></li><li><p>24×7 pharmacy support</p></li><li><p>ICU and emergency services</p></li><li><p>Electronic monitoring and documentation systems</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Fever of unknown origin and acute infections</p></li><li><p>Respiratory and gastrointestinal illnesses</p></li><li><p>Diabetes, hypertension, and thyroid disorders</p></li><li><p>Chronic kidney and liver disease (medical management)</p></li><li><p>Obesity, dyslipidaemia, and metabolic syndrome</p></li><li><p>Geriatric conditions and multiple co-morbidities</p></li><li><p>Undiagnosed fatigue, weight loss, pain, or weakness</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Thorough clinical evaluation, not assumptions</p></li><li><p>Early diagnosis to prevent complications</p></li><li><p>Rational, evidence-based treatment</p></li><li><p>Clear communication and patient education</p></li><li><p>Long-term disease control and follow-up</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Internal Medicine</p></li><li><p>Preventive Medicine</p></li><li><p>Geriatric Medicine</p></li><li><p>Infectious Disease Management</p></li><li><p>Lifestyle and Metabolic Disorder Care</p></li></ul>','Best General Medicine Hospital in Bangalore | Nano hospitals','Nano Hospitals offers expert general medicine care in Bangalore with experienced physicians for diagnosis, treatment, and prevention of a wide range of health conditions.','2026-02-02 11:41:51','2026-04-21 07:45:56','specialities/banners/relatedimages/4b17feda-73bd-4d51-a61e-89312fe7b056.webp'),(5,'Cardiology(heart care)','heart-care','specialities/banners/d4b79b00-5783-4b32-b927-54cde29747bd.webp','specialities/icons/01KGJ8CGZ01K9DDBXQ95FXYXRV.webp',1,'<p>Nano Hospitals is a trusted cardiology and heart care hospital in Bangalore, offering specialised services for the prevention, early detection, and treatment of all heart-related conditions. Heart disease — including coronary artery disease, hypertension, heart failure, and arrhythmia — often develops silently before warning signs like chest pain, breathlessness, palpitations, or fatigue appear. Our experienced cardiologists in Bangalore ensure cardiac risk is identified and treated at the earliest stage, before it becomes a life-threatening emergency.</p>','<p>The cardiology department at Nano Hospitals Bangalore is equipped with advanced diagnostics including ECG, 2D Echocardiography, and cardiac risk profiling for patients with diabetes, high blood pressure, obesity, or a family history of heart disease. Each patient receives a personalised, evidence-based heart treatment plan tailored to their age, lifestyle, and condition — with the department working in close coordination with Emergency, ICU, and General Medicine teams for seamless, round-the-clock cardiac care.</p><p>At Nano Hospitals, heart care goes beyond symptom relief — the focus is on long-term cardiovascular health and disease prevention. Whether you need a cardiac health check-up in Bangalore, treatment for hypertension, or ongoing management of a diagnosed heart condition, our cardiologists provide clear, personalised guidance at every step — from first consultation to long-term follow-up and recovery.</p>','<p>Heart Care focuses on identifying and managing cardiovascular risks early, before complications arise. Timely cardiac evaluation plays a crucial role in preventing life-threatening events.</p><p>At Nano Hospitals, cardiology services are integrated with emergency and critical care systems to ensure rapid response and continuity of care.</p>','<h3><strong>Cardiac Diagnostic Services</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Electrocardiogram (ECG) for rhythm assessment</p></li><li><p>2D Echocardiography for heart structure and function</p></li><li><p>Cardiac risk profiling and clinical evaluation</p></li><li><p>Monitoring of heart function in medical and surgical patients</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Medical Management</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Hypertension management</p></li><li><p>Heart failure medical treatment</p></li><li><p>Arrhythmia management</p></li><li><p>Medical treatment for coronary artery disease</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Preventive &amp; Emergency Cardiac Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Cardiac risk assessment and lifestyle counselling</p></li><li><p>Monitoring high-risk patients (diabetes, obesity, family history)</p></li><li><p>Immediate evaluation of chest pain</p></li><li><p>Cardiac monitoring in ICU and wards</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>ECG machines for rapid rhythm assessment</p></li><li><p>2D Echocardiography systems</p></li><li><p>Advanced laboratory medicine for cardiac markers</p></li><li><p>ICU and emergency services for continuous monitoring</p></li><li><p>Digital X-Ray, CT, and MRI support when required</p></li><li><p>24×7 pharmacy for uninterrupted medication access</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Hypertension and coronary artery disease</p></li><li><p>Heart rhythm disorders and heart failure</p></li><li><p>Chest pain, breathlessness, palpitations</p></li><li><p>Dizziness or fainting episodes</p></li><li><p>Cardiac involvement in diabetes and kidney disease</p></li><li><p>Pre-operative cardiac assessment for surgery</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Early detection over late intervention</p></li><li><p>Evidence-based medical management</p></li><li><p>Patient education and lifestyle modification</p></li><li><p>Continuous monitoring and follow-up</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Preventive Cardiology</p></li><li><p>Heart Failure Management</p></li><li><p>Medical Cardiology</p></li><li><p>Cardiac Risk Assessment and Monitoring</p></li></ul>','Best Heart Care & Cardiology Hospital in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals','Nano Hospitals is a trusted cardiology and heart care hospital in Bangalore offering expert diagnosis and treatment for heart disease, hypertension, arrhythmia, heart failure, and chest pain. Consult experienced cardiologists — book your appointment today.','2026-02-02 11:44:30','2026-06-12 07:46:18','specialities/banners/relatedimages/a7cdc4e0-1622-45f5-8253-216e12293df9.webp'),(6,'Neurology (Brain Care)','brain-care','specialities/banners/94533ca4-70e0-4c4a-97e6-ad32b1b87fce.webp','specialities/icons/01KGJ895HXJABF5239AHDS8P6K.webp',1,'<p>Nano Hospitals is a leading neurology and brain care hospital in Bangalore, providing comprehensive medical care for all conditions affecting the brain, spinal cord, nerves, and muscles. Our experienced neurologists in Bangalore — with DM Neurology qualifications — diagnose and treat a wide range of neurological disorders including stroke, epilepsy, migraine, peripheral neuropathy, memory loss, movement disorders, and nerve compression syndromes using advanced neuro-imaging, EEG, and evidence-based treatment protocols.</p>','<p>Neurological conditions can develop gradually or strike suddenly — stroke, seizures, and acute weakness require immediate emergency neurological care, while conditions like chronic migraine, neuropathy, and memory decline need careful long-term management. As a dedicated neurology treatment hospital in Bangalore, Nano Hospitals focuses on early recognition, rapid diagnosis, and timely intervention to prevent permanent disability and protect brain function at every stage of care.</p><p>Brain care at Nano Hospitals is coordinated across Emergency, ICU, General Medicine, and Rehabilitation teams — ensuring seamless, round-the-clock neurological support for every patient. Care is personalised with strong emphasis on patient education, family involvement, functional recovery, and quality of life. Patients across Bangalore trust Nano Hospitals for neurology care because of the expert team, advanced diagnostic facilities, and the patient-first approach maintained from first consultation to long-term follow-up.</p>','<p>Brain Care focuses on the early identification and medical management of neurological disorders to prevent long-term disability and improve quality of life.</p><p>At Nano Hospitals, neurological care is delivered through close coordination with emergency and critical care services to ensure rapid and continuous treatment.</p>','<h3><strong>Neurological Evaluation &amp; Diagnostics</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Detailed neurological examination</p></li><li><p>Electroencephalogram (EEG) for brain activity</p></li><li><p>CT Scan and MRI coordination</p></li><li><p>Monitoring neurological status in hospitalised patients</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Medical Neurology Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Stroke evaluation and medical management</p></li><li><p>Seizure and epilepsy management</p></li><li><p>Headache and migraine treatment</p></li><li><p>Neuropathy and nerve disorder care</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Emergency &amp; Long-Term Neurological Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Acute stroke assessment and seizure stabilisation</p></li><li><p>Altered consciousness evaluation</p></li><li><p>Neurological monitoring in ICU</p></li><li><p>Chronic disease follow-up and rehabilitation coordination</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>EEG systems for brain activity assessment</p></li><li><p>CT Scan and MRI for detailed neuro-imaging</p></li><li><p>Advanced laboratory medicine for metabolic and infectious evaluation</p></li><li><p>ICU and emergency services for neurological monitoring</p></li><li><p>Digital X-Ray support when required</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Stroke and transient ischemic attacks (TIA)</p></li><li><p>Epilepsy and seizure disorders</p></li><li><p>Migraine and chronic headache disorders</p></li><li><p>Peripheral neuropathy and nerve compression syndromes</p></li><li><p>Weakness, paralysis, numbness, or tingling</p></li><li><p>Speech, vision, memory, or behavioural changes</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Early recognition of neurological warning signs</p></li><li><p>Evidence-based medical management</p></li><li><p>Multidisciplinary coordination</p></li><li><p>Patient and family education</p></li><li><p>Focus on functional recovery and quality of life</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Stroke Care and Prevention</p></li><li><p>Epilepsy and Seizure Management</p></li><li><p>Headache and Migraine Care</p></li><li><p>Peripheral Nerve Disorders</p></li></ul>','Best Neurology (Brain Care) Hospital in Bangalore | Stroke, Epilepsy & Nerve Disorder Treatment | Nano Hospitals','Nano Hospitals is a trusted neurology and brain care hospital in Bangalore offering expert treatment for stroke, epilepsy, migraine, neuropathy, memory loss, and nervous system disorders. Experienced neurologists with DM Neurology — book your appointment today.','2026-02-02 11:47:15','2026-06-12 08:10:12','specialities/banners/relatedimages/21c9647c-d1bc-4f8f-a4a0-c61f164b5bbc.webp'),(7,'Pulmonology (Lung Care)','lung-care','specialities/banners/2eb47bd3-8740-4bf3-afb9-441228a04ded.webp','specialities/icons/01KGJ89VSJPF5RRSXWXGPP1CB1.webp',1,'<p>Lung Care at Nano Hospitals focuses on the diagnosis, treatment, and long-term management of respiratory and lung-related conditions. Breathing problems may range from mild, recurrent symptoms to sudden, life-threatening emergencies.</p>','<p>Conditions such as asthma, chronic bronchitis, respiratory infections, or lung complications related to other medical illnesses can significantly affect daily life if not addressed early.</p><p>The department emphasises early intervention, accurate diagnosis, patient education, and continuity of care, supported by emergency and critical care services to prevent disease progression and reduce hospitalisations.</p>','<p>Lung Care focuses on early identification and structured management of respiratory conditions to improve breathing comfort and prevent complications.</p><p>At Nano Hospitals, pulmonology services are closely integrated with emergency and ICU teams to ensure timely escalation and continuous respiratory support.</p>','<h3><strong>Diagnostic &amp; Evaluation Services</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Detailed respiratory history and clinical examination</p></li><li><p>Assessment of breathlessness, cough, and chest symptoms</p></li><li><p>Chest imaging coordination (X-ray, CT scan when required)</p></li><li><p>Laboratory investigations for infections and inflammation</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Medical Respiratory Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Management of asthma and COPD</p></li><li><p>Treatment of respiratory infections</p></li><li><p>Oxygen therapy for breathing difficulty</p></li><li><p>Medical management of airway and lung inflammation</p></li></ul><h3><strong>Emergency &amp; Long-Term Lung Care</strong></h3><ul><li><p>Stabilisation of acute respiratory distress</p></li><li><p>Ventilatory and oxygen support when required</p></li><li><p>Respiratory monitoring in ICU and wards</p></li><li><p>Chronic disease monitoring and patient education</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Digital X-Ray for rapid chest evaluation</p></li><li><p>CT Scan support for detailed lung imaging</p></li><li><p>Advanced laboratory medicine for respiratory diagnostics</p></li><li><p>ICU and emergency services for respiratory monitoring</p></li><li><p>Oxygen therapy and ventilatory support systems</p></li><li><p>24×7 pharmacy for uninterrupted respiratory medications</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Asthma, COPD, and chronic bronchitis</p></li><li><p>Pneumonia, tuberculosis, and viral respiratory infections</p></li><li><p>Acute breathlessness and respiratory failure</p></li><li><p>Severe chest infections</p></li><li><p>Persistent cough, wheezing, and chest tightness</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Early identification of respiratory symptoms</p></li><li><p>Accurate diagnosis of underlying causes</p></li><li><p>Preventive strategies to reduce flare-ups</p></li><li><p>Patient education for long-term control</p></li><li><p>Seamless integration with emergency and ICU services</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Asthma and allergy care</p></li><li><p>Chronic lung disease management</p></li><li><p>Respiratory infection management</p></li><li><p>Critical respiratory care</p></li></ul>','Best Lung Care Hospital in Bangalore | Advanced Respiratory Treatment','Nano Hospitals offers advanced lung care services in Bangalore for asthma, breathing disorders, and critical respiratory conditions with expert pulmonologists.','2026-02-02 11:49:03','2026-04-21 07:19:52','specialities/banners/relatedimages/b7bc5299-eb9a-4ef8-ba7c-5990e97a552f.webp'),(8,'Urology ','urology','specialities/banners/b8e58dfa-a18a-4a39-ab22-65895a9194f1.webp','specialities/icons/01KGJ8AFVQM21H9TWPK3ZVNB5Z.webp',1,'<p>Nano Hospitals is a leading urology hospital in Bangalore providing expert diagnosis and treatment for all urinary tract disorders in men and women, including kidney stones, prostate enlargement, urinary tract infections, bladder conditions, and male reproductive health problems. Our experienced urologists in Bangalore manage conditions affecting the kidneys, ureters, bladder, urethra, and prostate — using advanced endoscopic and minimally invasive surgical techniques for faster recovery and better outcomes.</p>','<p>Urological problems often begin with subtle symptoms — frequent urination, burning sensation, blood in urine, lower abdominal discomfort, or weak urinary flow — but can progress to kidney damage, urinary obstruction, or serious infection if left untreated. As a dedicated urology treatment centre in Bangalore, Nano Hospitals focuses on early detection, precise diagnosis, and timely intervention to protect kidney function and restore normal urinary health.</p><p>Every urology patient at Nano Hospitals receives a personalised treatment plan based on age, medical history, lifestyle, and condition severity — supported by advanced imaging, laser stone treatment, and structured post-treatment follow-up care. Patients across Bangalore trust Nano Hospitals for urology care because of the compassionate, patient-first approach at every stage — from first consultation to full recovery.</p>','<p>Urology focuses on diagnosing and managing disorders of the urinary system and male reproductive organs. Early signs such as painful urination, blood in urine, urinary leakage, or flank pain should not be ignored, as they may indicate infection, stones, prostate enlargement, or more serious conditions.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early detection, accurate imaging and laboratory evaluation, minimally invasive intervention whenever possible, and long-term monitoring to protect urinary and kidney health</p>','<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Medical management of urinary tract infections (UTIs)</p></li><li><p>Medications for prostate enlargement and urinary symptoms</p></li><li><p>Bladder control therapy for incontinence</p></li><li><p>Dietary and lifestyle guidance for kidney stone prevention</p></li><li><p>Hormonal and medication-based management for certain male reproductive disorders</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Cystoscopy for bladder and urethral evaluation</p></li><li><p>Ureteroscopy with laser treatment for kidney and ureteric stones</p></li><li><p>Endoscopic prostate procedures (TURP and laser prostate surgery)</p></li><li><p>Image-guided catheter placements and stenting</p></li><li><p>Minimally invasive treatment for urinary obstruction</p></li></ul><h3>Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Kidney stone removal surgeries</p></li><li><p>Prostate surgery for severe enlargement or obstruction</p></li><li><p>Bladder tumor surgery</p></li><li><p>Reconstructive urological surgeries</p></li><li><p>Treatment of congenital urinary tract abnormalitie</p></li></ul>','<h2>Facilities and Technologies Used</h2><ul><li><p>Advanced Ultrasound for kidney, bladder, and prostate evaluation</p></li><li><p>CT Scan for detailed stone and urinary tract imaging</p></li><li><p>MRI for complex urological assessments</p></li><li><p>Endoscopic urology equipment for minimally invasive procedures</p></li><li><p>Laser technology for stone and prostate treatment</p></li><li><p>Dedicated urology operation theatres</p></li><li><p>Post-operative monitoring and recovery units</p></li></ul>','<h2>Conditions and Ailments Treated</h2><ul><li><p>Kidney stones and ureteric stones</p></li><li><p>Urinary tract infections (UTIs)</p></li><li><p>Enlarged prostate (BPH)</p></li><li><p>Urinary incontinence and bladder control issues</p></li><li><p>Blood in urine (hematuria)</p></li><li><p>Bladder and kidney disorders</p></li><li><p>Male reproductive health issues</p></li></ul>','<h2>Risks and Challenges</h2><ul><li><p>Recurrent stone formation if preventive care is not followed</p></li><li><p>Kidney damage due to untreated obstruction or infection</p></li><li><p>Urinary retention affecting bladder function</p></li><li><p>Chronic discomfort impacting daily life</p></li><li><p>Need for long-term monitoring in prostate and bladder conditions</p></li></ul>','<h2>Sub-specialties in Urology</h2><ul><li><p>Endourology and Stone Management</p></li><li><p>Prostate Care and Male Urinary Disorders</p></li><li><p>Uro-Oncology (Urological Tumors)</p></li><li><p>Reconstructive Urology</p></li><li><p>Female Urology and Incontinence Care</p></li></ul>','Best Urology Hospital in Bangalore | Kidney Stone & Prostate Treatment | Nano Hospitals','Nano Hospitals is a trusted urology hospital in Bangalore offering expert treatment for kidney stones, prostate enlargement, UTIs, bladder disorders, and male reproductive health. Consult experienced urologists — book your appointment today.','2026-02-02 11:55:57','2026-06-12 07:47:17','specialities/banners/relatedimages/50572282-7671-48f3-9be7-031c29c5a936.webp'),(9,'Gastroenterology','gastroenterology','specialities/banners/27b1930a-0ce1-4e3f-a9c1-68aebd59524b.webp','specialities/icons/e9eaf58f-eec1-467c-9950-4c43f16d8102.webp',1,'<p>Nano Hospitals is a trusted gastroenterology and digestive care hospital in Bangalore, offering expert diagnosis and treatment for all conditions affecting the oesophagus, stomach, intestines, liver, gallbladder, pancreas, and rectum. Our experienced gastroenterologist in Bangalore — with DM Gastroenterology qualification — provides evidence-based treatment for acidity, GERD, peptic ulcers, IBS, IBD, gallstones, liver disease, pancreatitis, and gastrointestinal bleeding using advanced endoscopy, imaging, and minimally invasive procedures.</p>','<p>Digestive problems often start as minor discomforts — persistent acidity, bloating, irregular bowel habits, or abdominal pain — but can progress to serious conditions like chronic inflammation, liver damage, ulcers, nutritional deficiencies, or GI bleeding if left untreated. As a dedicated gastroenterology treatment hospital in Bangalore, Nano Hospitals focuses on early endoscopic diagnosis, identifying root causes, and personalised treatment plans to restore digestive health and prevent recurrence.</p><p>Care at Nano Hospitals follows a patient-centred approach combining clinical evaluation, high-definition endoscopy and colonoscopy, advanced liver and abdominal imaging, dietary guidance, and surgical intervention when needed. Each gastroenterology treatment plan in Bangalore is tailored to the patient&#039;s age, lifestyle, medical history, and disease severity — with structured follow-up to ensure lasting digestive health and quality of life.</p>','<p>Gastroenterology deals with diseases of the gastrointestinal (GI) tract and associated organs such as the liver and pancreas. Early symptoms like persistent heartburn, abdominal pain, constipation, diarrhea, or unexplained weight loss should be evaluated promptly.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early diagnosis through endoscopy and imaging, personalised treatment plans, and long-term dietary and lifestyle support to maintain digestive health.</p>','<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Medical management of acidity, gastritis, and reflux</p></li><li><p>Treatment of infections such as H. pylori</p></li><li><p>Dietary planning for IBS and digestive disorders</p></li><li><p>Medication-based management of liver and pancreatic conditions</p></li><li><p>Nutritional therapy for malabsorption disorders</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Upper GI endoscopy for stomach and esophagus evaluation</p></li><li><p>Colonoscopy for large intestine examination</p></li><li><p>ERCP for bile duct and pancreatic duct disorders</p></li><li><p>Endoscopic removal of polyps and small growths</p></li><li><p>Endoscopic control of GI bleeding</p></li></ul><h3>Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Gallbladder removal (cholecystectomy)</p></li><li><p>Surgery for hernias affecting the digestive tract</p></li><li><p>Intestinal obstruction surgery</p></li><li><p>Liver and pancreatic surgical procedures (when required)</p></li><li><p>Tumor removal surgeries in the digestive system</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>High-definition endoscopy and colonoscopy systems</p></li><li><p>Ultrasound for abdominal organ evaluation</p></li><li><p>CT Scan and MRI for liver, pancreas, and intestinal imaging</p></li><li><p>Advanced laboratory testing for digestive disorders</p></li><li><p>Endoscopic ultrasound (EUS) for deeper tissue assessment</p></li><li><p>Dedicated GI procedure suites</p></li><li><p>Post-procedure recovery and monitoring units</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Acid reflux (GERD) and gastritis</p></li><li><p>Peptic ulcers</p></li><li><p>Irritable Bowel Syndrome (IBS)</p></li><li><p>Inflammatory Bowel Disease (IBD)</p></li><li><p>Gallstones and bile duct disorders</p></li><li><p>Liver diseases including fatty liver and hepatitis</p></li><li><p>Pancreatitis</p></li><li><p>Constipation and chronic diarrhea</p></li><li><p>Gastrointestinal bleeding</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Chronic inflammation leading to long-term damage</p></li><li><p>Nutritional deficiencies due to poor absorption</p></li><li><p>Risk of bleeding or obstruction in untreated conditions</p></li><li><p>Liver damage if metabolic or viral diseases are not managed</p></li><li><p>Recurrence of symptoms without lifestyle modification</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Gastroenterology</p></li><li><p>Hepatology (Liver Care)</p></li><li><p>Pancreatic Disorders Management</p></li><li><p>Advanced Endoscopy</p></li><li><p>GI Oncology (Digestive System Tumors)</p></li></ul>','Best Gastroenterology Hospital in Bangalore | Digestive Care, Endoscopy & Liver Treatment | Nano Hospitals','Nano Hospitals is a trusted gastroenterology hospital in Bangalore offering expert treatment for acidity, GERD, IBS, gallstones, liver disease, pancreatitis, and digestive disorders. Experienced gastroenterologists with DM Gastroenterology — book your appointment today.\n','2026-02-02 11:58:42','2026-06-12 08:12:49','specialities/banners/relatedimages/696ceeb8-be1b-4ef3-adae-fee0989cdcda.webp'),(10,'Diabetology & Endocrinology','diabetology-endocrinology','specialities/banners/aa2fba41-cb73-4339-b7e5-547c4dfb1507.webp','specialities/icons/01KGJ8DX2W3E0QMVZEGKA6NVQF.webp',1,'<p>Diabetology &amp; Endocrinology at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> focuses on the diagnosis, treatment, and long-term management of endocrine disorders — conditions caused by imbalance of hormones that regulate metabolism, growth, reproduction, and overall body function.</p>','<p>Hormonal problems often develop gradually, with symptoms such as unexplained weight changes, fatigue, excessive thirst, frequent urination, mood fluctuations, menstrual irregularities, or growth concerns. If left untreated, these disorders can affect the heart, kidneys, nerves, bones, and reproductive health. At Nano Hospitals, care is aimed not only at controlling symptoms but also at restoring hormonal balance and preventing long-term complications.</p><p>Treatment follows a patient-centred approach combining laboratory evaluation, advanced imaging, medication management, lifestyle guidance, and continuous monitoring. Each care plan is individualised based on age, gender, lifestyle, and the specific hormonal condition.</p>','<p>This specialty (Endocrinology) deals with disorders of hormone-producing glands such as the pancreas, thyroid, adrenal glands, pituitary gland, and reproductive glands. Early detection of hormonal imbalance is essential, as many endocrine conditions silently damage organs over time.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early screening, precise diagnosis, personalised medication plans, and long-term follow-up to maintain metabolic and hormonal stability.</p>','<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Diabetes management with oral medications and insulin therapy</p></li><li><p>Continuous glucose monitoring guidance</p></li><li><p>Thyroid disorder management (hypothyroidism and hyperthyroidism)</p></li><li><p>Hormone therapy for adrenal and pituitary disorders</p></li><li><p>Lifestyle and dietary counselling for metabolic health</p></li><li><p>Bone health and osteoporosis management</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Fine-needle aspiration (FNA) for thyroid nodules</p></li><li><p>Hormone level testing with dynamic endocrine evaluations</p></li><li><p>Image-guided procedures for certain gland-related conditions</p></li></ul><h3>Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Thyroid surgery for nodules, goiter, or thyroid cancer</p></li><li><p>Adrenal gland surgery for hormone-secreting tumors</p></li><li><p>Pituitary gland surgery (in coordination with neurosurgery)</p></li><li><p>Parathyroid surgery for calcium imbalance disorder</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Advanced hormone laboratory testing</p></li><li><p>Continuous glucose monitoring systems</p></li><li><p>Thyroid ultrasound imaging</p></li><li><p>CT Scan and MRI for endocrine gland evaluation</p></li><li><p>Bone density scan (DEXA) for osteoporosis detection</p></li><li><p>Dedicated diabetes education and counselling support</p></li><li><p>Long-term metabolic monitoring programs</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Type 1 and Type 2 Diabetes</p></li><li><p>Gestational diabetes</p></li><li><p>Thyroid disorders (hypothyroidism, hyperthyroidism, nodules)</p></li><li><p>Polycystic Ovary Syndrome (PCOS)</p></li><li><p>Obesity and metabolic syndrome</p></li><li><p>Osteoporosis and calcium disorders</p></li><li><p>Pituitary gland disorders</p></li><li><p>Adrenal gland disorders</p></li><li><p>Hormonal growth and puberty disorders</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Organ damage from uncontrolled diabetes</p></li><li><p>Heart, kidney, and nerve complications</p></li><li><p>Hormonal imbalances affecting fertility and growth</p></li><li><p>Bone loss leading to fractures</p></li><li><p>Lifelong monitoring needed for many endocrine conditions</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Diabetology and Metabolic Care</p></li><li><p>Thyroid and Parathyroid Disorders</p></li><li><p>Reproductive Endocrinology</p></li><li><p>Pediatric Endocrinology</p></li><li><p>Bone and Mineral Metabolism Care</p></li></ul>','Diabetology & Endocrinology in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals','Nano Hospitals offers expert diabetes and hormone care in Bangalore with specialized endocrinologists for diabetes, thyroid, PCOS, and other hormonal disorders.','2026-02-02 12:02:01','2026-04-21 07:36:53','specialities/banners/relatedimages/ad21344f-1601-4dfa-bb47-5105d2c9beed.webp'),(11,'Oncology','cancer-care','specialities/banners/ef31f4f0-0e2e-49fa-92e4-f12b24eeba0f.webp','specialities/icons/c4a3bc73-9b25-45da-ad91-0eccaca4492a.webp',1,'<p>Oncology at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> is dedicated to the prevention, early detection, diagnosis, treatment, and long-term management of various types of cancers. The department provides comprehensive oncology services addressing tumors affecting different organs and body systems.</p>','<p>Cancer may develop silently, with early symptoms such as unexplained weight loss, persistent fatigue, abnormal lumps, chronic cough, changes in bowel habits, or unusual bleeding often being overlooked. Early diagnosis significantly improves treatment outcomes. At Nano Hospitals, care focuses not only on eliminating cancer but also on preserving organ function, reducing treatment side effects, and supporting emotional and physical well-being.</p><p>Treatment follows a multidisciplinary, patient-centred approach involving oncologists, surgeons, radiologists, pathologists, and rehabilitation specialists. Each treatment plan is personalised based on cancer type, stage, genetic factors, and overall patient health.</p>','<p>Oncology involves managing abnormal cell growth that can invade surrounding tissues or spread to other parts of the body. Timely screening, imaging, biopsy, and laboratory tests are essential for accurate staging and treatment planning.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early detection programs, evidence-based treatment protocols, and continuous monitoring to improve survival rates and quality of life.</p>','<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Chemotherapy to destroy or slow cancer cell growth</p></li><li><p>Immunotherapy to strengthen the body’s immune response against cancer</p></li><li><p>Targeted therapy aimed at specific cancer cell pathways</p></li><li><p>Hormone therapy for hormone-sensitive cancers</p></li><li><p>Palliative care to manage symptoms and improve comfort</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Image-guided biopsies for accurate diagnosis</p></li><li><p>Port placements for chemotherapy delivery</p></li><li><p>Endoscopic tumor evaluation and minor tumor removals</p></li><li><p>Minimally invasive tumor ablation in selected cases</p></li></ul><h3>Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Tumor removal surgeries</p></li><li><p>Organ-preserving cancer surgeries</p></li><li><p>Reconstructive surgeries after tumor removal</p></li><li><p>Lymph node dissection when required</p></li><li><p>Complex oncological surgeries for advanced cancers</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Advanced imaging: CT Scan, MRI, and PET-CT for cancer staging</p></li><li><p>Modern chemotherapy infusion units</p></li><li><p>Radiation therapy with precision linear accelerators</p></li><li><p>Molecular and pathology labs for cancer profiling</p></li><li><p>Dedicated oncology operation theatres</p></li><li><p>Intensive care and post-surgical recovery units</p></li><li><p>Cancer rehabilitation and supportive care services</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Breast cancer</p></li><li><p>Lung cancer</p></li><li><p>Gastrointestinal cancers</p></li><li><p>Prostate cancer</p></li><li><p>Gynecological cancers</p></li><li><p>Head and neck cancers</p></li><li><p>Blood cancers (leukemia, lymphoma, myeloma)</p></li><li><p>Skin cancers</p></li><li><p>Liver and pancreatic cancers</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Cancer spreading to other organs (metastasis)</p></li><li><p>Treatment-related side effects</p></li><li><p>Emotional and psychological impact</p></li><li><p>Nutritional challenges during therapy</p></li><li><p>Need for long-term monitoring to detect recurrence</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Medical Oncology (drug-based cancer treatment)</p></li><li><p>Surgical Oncology</p></li><li><p>Radiation Oncology</p></li><li><p>Hemato-Oncology (blood cancers)</p></li><li><p>Pediatric Oncology</p></li><li><p>Palliative and Supportive Care</p></li></ul>','Comprehensive Cancer Treatment in Bangalore | Nano Hospitals','Expert cancer treatment in Bangalore at Nano Hospitals. Specialized oncology care for tumors across organs with advanced diagnostics and therapies.','2026-02-02 12:08:41','2026-04-21 07:34:05','specialities/banners/relatedimages/3524383f-89e8-42d2-a789-c9f859083cdb.webp'),(12,'Vascular Surgery','vascular-surgery','specialities/banners/d2edb3ef-e297-4343-ace4-1bf8ab7ee0cb.webp','specialities/icons/01KGJ8F6F501HFEH5PB27Q2ZY3.webp',1,'<p>Nano Hospitals is a leading vascular surgery hospital in Bangalore, providing advanced diagnosis and treatment for all conditions affecting arteries, veins, and blood circulation. Our experienced vascular surgeons in Bangalore treat a wide range of disorders — from varicose veins and blocked arteries to diabetic foot, deep vein thrombosis (DVT), peripheral artery disease (PAD), and non-healing vascular ulcers — using the latest minimally invasive endovascular techniques for safe, faster recovery.</p>','<p>Vascular disorders often begin with easily ignored symptoms — leg pain while walking, swollen feet, visible bulging veins, numbness, cold limbs, or slow-healing wounds. Without timely vascular treatment in Bangalore, these conditions can progress to dangerous complications including blood clots, gangrene, stroke, or limb loss. At Nano Hospitals, early detection through Doppler ultrasound and CT angiography ensures that circulation problems are identified and treated before they become life-threatening.</p><p>Every vascular patient at Nano Hospitals receives a personalised treatment plan based on disease severity, risk factors like diabetes and hypertension, and overall health. From medical management and compression therapy to endovascular stenting, laser varicose vein treatment, bypass surgery, and limb salvage procedures, Nano Hospitals offers complete vascular care under one roof — with expert surgeons, advanced imaging, and dedicated post-treatment follow-up across BG Road and Uttarahalli, Bangalore.</p>','<p>Vascular Surgery involves managing diseases of the circulatory system outside the heart and brain. Early symptoms such as leg cramps during walking, persistent swelling, skin discoloration, or cold extremities should be evaluated promptly.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early vascular screening, Doppler studies, and preventive care to reduce the risk of stroke, limb loss, and other severe outcomes.</p>','<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Medications to improve blood flow and prevent clots</p></li><li><p>Compression therapy for venous disorders</p></li><li><p>Lifestyle modification and smoking cessation support</p></li><li><p>Wound care for vascular ulcers</p></li><li><p>Diabetes and blood pressure management to protect vessels</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Angiography for vessel imaging</p></li><li><p>Angioplasty and stent placement to open blocked arteries</p></li><li><p>Endovenous laser treatment (EVLT) for varicose veins</p></li><li><p>Catheter-based clot removal procedures</p></li><li><p>Image-guided vascular interventions</p></li></ul><h3>Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Bypass surgery for blocked arteries</p></li><li><p>Varicose vein surgery</p></li><li><p>Carotid artery surgery to reduce stroke risk</p></li><li><p>Aneurysm repair surgeries</p></li><li><p>Limb-saving vascular reconstructions</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Vascular Doppler Ultrasound</p></li><li><p>CT Angiography and MR Angiography</p></li><li><p>Digital Subtraction Angiography (DSA) suite</p></li><li><p>Endovascular catheterisation labs</p></li><li><p>Hybrid operation theatres for complex vascular procedures</p></li><li><p>Dedicated vascular ICU and recovery units</p></li><li><p>Advanced wound care and limb preservation services</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Peripheral Artery Disease (PAD)</p></li><li><p>Varicose veins and chronic venous insufficiency</p></li><li><p>Deep Vein Thrombosis (DVT)</p></li><li><p>Diabetic foot with poor circulation</p></li><li><p>Carotid artery disease</p></li><li><p>Aortic aneurysms</p></li><li><p>Non-healing vascular ulcers</p></li><li><p>Blood vessel blockages in limbs</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Risk of stroke from untreated carotid disease</p></li><li><p>Limb loss due to severe arterial blockage</p></li><li><p>Recurrent clots in high-risk patients</p></li><li><p>Chronic pain and mobility limitations</p></li><li><p>Long-term care needed for diabetic vascular disease</p></li></ul>','<ul><li><p>Endovascular Surgery</p></li><li><p>Peripheral Arterial Disease Management</p></li><li><p>Venous Disorders and Varicose Vein Care</p></li><li><p>Diabetic Limb Salvage</p></li><li><p>Aortic and Major Vessel Surgery</p></li></ul>','Best Vascular Surgery Hospital in Bangalore | Varicose Veins & Blocked Artery Treatment | Nano Hospitals','Nano Hospitals is a trusted vascular surgery hospital in Bangalore offering expert treatment for varicose veins, blocked arteries, diabetic foot, DVT, peripheral artery disease, and non-healing ulcers. Consult experienced vascular surgeons — book your appointment today.','2026-02-02 12:13:28','2026-06-12 07:48:10','specialities/banners/relatedimages/bc161b15-e5eb-478c-8622-64722d0c1e94.webp'),(13,'Dermatology','dermatology','specialities/banners/33f1af24-e94c-4e94-b63b-96a7342e4fab.webp','specialities/icons/01KGJ8FYYNHKB9GR2ZA7Q7X83V.webp',1,'<p>Dermatology at <strong>Nano Hospitals</strong> focuses on the diagnosis, treatment, and long-term management of conditions affecting the skin, hair, and nails. The department manages medical, surgical, and cosmetic dermatological concerns across all age groups.</p>','<p>Skin problems may begin with mild symptoms such as itching, rashes, acne, pigmentation, or hair thinning, but can progress to chronic infections, scarring, or systemic disease manifestations if left untreated. At Nano Hospitals, care aims not only to relieve visible symptoms but also to identify underlying causes and restore healthy skin function and appearance.</p><p>Treatment follows a patient-centred approach combining clinical evaluation, dermatoscopic assessment, laboratory support, procedural dermatology, and long-term skincare guidance. Each care plan is tailored according to skin type, condition severity, lifestyle, and overall health.</p>','<p>Dermatology deals with disorders of the skin, hair, nails, and related mucous membranes. Early symptoms such as persistent itching, discoloration, unusual moles, hair loss, or non-healing skin lesions should be evaluated promptly.</p><p>Nano Hospitals emphasises early diagnosis, targeted treatment, and preventive skincare education to maintain long-term skin health.</p>','<h3>Non-Surgical Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Medical treatment for acne, eczema, and psoriasis</p></li><li><p>Allergy and skin infection management</p></li><li><p>Pigmentation disorder treatment</p></li><li><p>Hair loss evaluation and medical therapy</p></li><li><p>Nail infection and disorder treatment</p></li></ul><h3>Minimally Invasive Procedures</h3><ul><li><p>Chemical peels for pigmentation and acne scars</p></li><li><p>Cryotherapy for warts and small lesions</p></li><li><p>Intralesional injections for keloids and alopecia</p></li><li><p>PRP (Platelet-Rich Plasma) therapy for hair restoration</p></li><li><p>Dermatoscopic mole evaluation</p></li></ul><h3>Surgical &amp; Advanced Treatments</h3><ul><li><p>Minor skin surgeries for cysts and benign growths</p></li><li><p>Skin biopsies for diagnosis</p></li><li><p>Mole and skin lesion removal</p></li><li><p>Laser treatments for scars, pigmentation, and vascular lesions</p></li><li><p>Treatment of